rulings: ["[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'This card now uses the Reach keyword ability to enable the blocking of flying creatures. This works because a creature with flying can only be blocked by creatures with flying or reach.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Cycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with cycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature card” is any card with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact, enchantment, or land. Older cards of type summon are also creature cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature spell” is any spell with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact or enchantment. Older cards of type summon are also creature spells.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Spidery Grasp can target a creature that’s already untapped. It will still get +2/+4 and gain reach.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "A card\'s mana value is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner. The mana value is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {1}{U}{U} has mana value 3. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions that could apply to it. A card with no mana cost has a mana value of 0."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'All counters with the same name are indistinguishable from other counters with that name. Cards from the Time Spiral block that interact with time counters will interact with As Foretold.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If a spell has no mana cost, its mana value is 0. You can cast it with As Foretold\'s alternative cost."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If the card has X in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it for another cost that doesn\'t include X. For example, if there are five time counters on As Foretold and you choose to use its effect to cast Pull from Tomorrow, X must be 0. X can\'t be 2, even though the spell\'s mana value would be 4."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'If you control multiple As Foretolds, you may cast one spell for each of them paying {0}.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If you\'re casting a split card, only the mana value of the half you\'re casting is compared to the number of time counters on As Foretold. This is because only that half is on the stack at the time that you choose to apply the effect of As Foretold."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell for an alternative cost of {0}, you can\'t pay any other alternative costs, such as emerge costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as bargain. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, you must pay those to cast the spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "A creature spell that\'s multiple colors is each of those colors. For example, Ahn-Crop Champion is a white creature and a green creature, so it can benefit from either Oketra\'s Monument or Rhonas\'s Monument—or both at once."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'Each Monument has one ability that reduces the cost of creature spells of a certain color, and a triggered ability that triggers whenever you cast any creature spell—not just a creature spell of that color.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Each Monument\'s triggered ability triggers as the creature spell is cast and resolves before that creature spell resolves. The ability will resolve even if that creature spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, the triggered ability of Bontu\'s Monument causes the opposing team to lose 2 life and you gain 1 life."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a creature spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the creature remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "A creature spell that\'s multiple colors is each of those colors. For example, Ahn-Crop Champion is a white creature and a green creature, so it can benefit from either Oketra\'s Monument or Rhonas\'s Monument—or both at once."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'Each Monument has one ability that reduces the cost of creature spells of a certain color, and a triggered ability that triggers whenever you cast any creature spell—not just a creature spell of that color.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Each Monument\'s triggered ability triggers as the creature spell is cast and resolves before that creature spell resolves. The ability will resolve even if that creature spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a creature spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the creature remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "A creature that is a Zombie and has other types, such as a Zombie Jackal, isn\'t a non-Zombie creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it\'s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you\'re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn\'t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you\'ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If a copy of a spell or a token is put into its owner\'s library, it\'s moved there, then it will cease to exist as a state-based action."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If a spell is put into its owner\'s library, it\'s removed from the stack and thus will not resolve. The spell isn\'t countered; it just no longer exists. This works against a spell that can\'t be countered."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you\'ll exile the card if it would leave the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can\'t cast the half with aftermath."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If the target\'s owner\'s library contains no cards, the target spell or permanent will be put into that player\'s library as the only card."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you\'ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it\'s legal for you to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you\'d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its mana value is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with mana value 2 from your hand, you can\'t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Once you\'ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can\'t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it\'s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you\'re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn\'t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you\'ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you\'ll exile the card if it would leave the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can\'t cast the half with aftermath."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you\'ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it\'s legal for you to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you\'d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its mana value is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with mana value 2 from your hand, you can\'t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to choose the same value for X while casting Earth as you did while casting Heaven."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Once you\'ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can\'t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it\'s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you\'re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn\'t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you\'ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you\'ll exile the card if it would leave the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can\'t cast the half with aftermath."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you\'ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it\'s legal for you to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you\'d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its mana value is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with mana value 2 from your hand, you can\'t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Once you\'ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can\'t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "All cards in the Amonkhet set that let you exert a creature let you do so as you declare it as an attacking creature, as do some of the cards in the Hour of Devastation set. You can\'t do so later in combat, and creatures put onto the battlefield attacking can\'t be exerted. Any abilities that trigger on exerting an attacking creature will resolve before blockers are declared."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Combat Celebrant\'s ability untaps all of your creatures, not just the ones that are attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If an exerted creature is already untapped during your next untap step (most likely because it had vigilance or an effect untapped it), exert\'s effect preventing it from untapping expires without having done anything."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If you exert Combat Celebrant, you get an additional combat phase even if Combat Celebrant doesn\'t survive the first combat phase."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If you exert multiple Combat Celebrants in one combat phase, you\'ll have that many additional combat phases, but all of your creatures are untapped only during the current combat phase. You\'ll need to exert the Combat Celebrants one at a time, in multiple combat phases, to untap your attacking creatures and attack with them in each combat step."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If you gain control of another player\'s creature until end of turn and exert it, it will untap during that player\'s untap step."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "There\'s no main phase between your combat phases, so you\'ll have no opportunity to cast spells or activate abilities that could only be cast any time you could cast a sorcery. For example, you won\'t be able to cast another creature or equip Equipment between combats."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Untapping an attacking creature doesn\'t remove it from combat."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'You can\\\'t exert a creature unless an effect allows you to do so. Similar effects that "tap and freeze" a creature (such as that of Decision Paralysis) don\\\'t exert that creature.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "An ability that triggers whenever you discard a card doesn\'t give you permission to discard cards. You\'ll need another effect that instructs or allows you to discard them."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers whenever you “cycle or discard” a card triggers only once if you cycle a card. The ability “Whenever you discard a card” is functionally identical to this ability; cycling is mentioned for clarity.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'If a player discards a card during their cleanup step due to having too many cards in hand, any appropriate abilities that trigger on discarding that card trigger. If this happens, those triggered abilities are put onto the stack and players receive priority in that cleanup step to cast spells or activate abilities (normally, no players may take actions during a cleanup step). Another cleanup step is created following that one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'Some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn\'t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Magma Spray\'s replacement effect will exile the target creature if it would die this turn for any reason, not just due to lethal damage. It applies to the target creature even if Magma Spray deals no damage to it (due to a prevention effect) or Magma Spray deals damage to a different creature (due to a redirection effect)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Once a creature has attacked you or a planeswalker you control, it will remain in combat even if it gains flying. Similarly, if a creature with flying enters the battlefield attacking, Sandwurm Convergence\'s first ability can\'t undo that attack."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'A card that changes zones is considered a new object, so casting the same Approach of the Second Sun card on a later turn is “another spell” named Approach of the Second Sun.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "A copy of a spell isn\'t cast, so it won\'t count as the first nor as the second Approach of the Second Sun."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "As your second Approach of the Second Sun resolves, it checks only whether the first one was cast, not whether the first one resolved. If your first Approach of the Second Sun was countered, you\'ll still win the game as your second one resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If you have fewer than six cards in your library, you\'ll put Approach of the Second Sun on the bottom of your library. Otherwise, you\'ll lift up the top six cards without looking at them and place Approach of the Second Sun just under them."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'The second Approach of the Second Sun that you cast must be cast from your hand, but first may have been cast from anywhere.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Approach of the Second Sun has no effect until it\'s resolving. If the second one you cast is countered, you won\'t win the game."}]', "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A creature spell that’s multiple colors is each of those colors. For example, Ahn-Crop Champion is a white creature and a green creature, so it can benefit from either Oketra’s Monument or Rhonas’s Monument—or both at once.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each Monument has one ability that reduces the cost of creature spells of a certain color, and a triggered ability that triggers whenever you cast any creature spell—not just a creature spell of that color.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each Monument’s triggered ability triggers as the creature spell is cast and resolves before that creature spell resolves. The ability will resolve even if that creature spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The triggered ability of Kefnet’s Monument doesn’t tap the creature. It can target any creature, tapped or untapped. If that creature is already untapped at the beginning of its controller’s next untap step, the effect won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a creature spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the creature remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A creature spell that’s multiple colors is each of those colors. For example, Ahn-Crop Champion is a white creature and a green creature, so it can benefit from either Oketra’s Monument or Rhonas’s Monument—or both at once.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each Monument has one ability that reduces the cost of creature spells of a certain color, and a triggered ability that triggers whenever you cast any creature spell—not just a creature spell of that color.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each Monument’s triggered ability triggers as the creature spell is cast and resolves before that creature spell resolves. The ability will resolve even if that creature spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The triggered ability of Rhonas’s Monument can’t target the creature spell that caused it to trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a creature spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the creature remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A spell or ability that counters spells can still target a creature spell you control. When that spell or ability resolves, the creature spell won’t be countered, but any additional effects of that spell or ability will still happen.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it’s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you’re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn’t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Any damage dealt by a creature you control with lifelink causes you to gain that much life, not just combat damage.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you’ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you’ll exile the card if it would leave the stack.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can’t cast the half with aftermath.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If either or both targets are illegal when Fight tries to resolve, no creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you’ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you’d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Untapping an attacking creature doesn’t remove it from combat.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its converted mana cost is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with converted mana cost 2 from your hand, you can’t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it’s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you’re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn’t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'As blockers are declared, any creature that’s tapped or affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t block doesn’t block. If there’s a cost associated with having the creature block, no player is forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t block if that cost isn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you’ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you’ll exile the card if it would leave the stack.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can’t cast the half with aftermath.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you’ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Lead doesn’t give any creatures the ability to block the target creature. It just forces those creatures that are already able to block the creature to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you’d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its converted mana cost is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with converted mana cost 2 from your hand, you can’t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it’s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you’re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn’t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you’ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a copy of a spell is returned to its owner’s hand, it’s moved there, then it will cease to exist as a state-based action.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a spell is returned to its owner’s hand, it’s removed from the stack and thus will not resolve. The spell isn’t countered; it just no longer exists. This works against a spell that can’t be countered.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you’ll exile the card if it would leave the stack.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can’t cast the half with aftermath.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you’ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you choose the name of a split card, you choose one name, not both. For example, you could name Failure or Comply, but not Failure // Comply. Opponents are still allowed to cast the half you didn’t choose.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you’d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its converted mana cost is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with converted mana cost 2 from your hand, you can’t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You choose a card name as Comply resolves, not as you cast it. Opponents can’t cast spells with that name after you’ve chosen it.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You may choose the name of a land card. Cards with that name can still be played since lands are never cast.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it’s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you’re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn’t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you’ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a creature with trample you control would deal combat damage to a blocking creature this turn, you must assign its unmodified damage. For example, a 3/3 creature with trample blocked by a 2/2 creature can only have 1 damage assigned to the defending player. It will then deal 4 damage to the blocking creature and 2 to the defending player.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If an effect such as that of Chandra’s Pyrohelix asks you to divide damage among targets, you must divide the unmodified damage before doubling it.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you’ll exile the card if it would leave the stack.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can’t cast the half with aftermath.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you’ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you cast two Insults in one turn, damage dealt by sources you control this turn will be multiplied by 4. If you cast three Insults, it will be multiplied by 8, and so on. How rude.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you’d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its converted mana cost is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with converted mana cost 2 from your hand, you can’t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can’t cast Injury unless you target both a creature and a player. If one target is illegal as Injury resolves, the spell deals damage to the remaining legal target.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it’s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you’re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn’t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you’ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you’ll exile the card if it would leave the stack.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can’t cast the half with aftermath.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you’ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Ribbons causes the opposing team to lose two times X life.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you’d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its converted mana cost is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with converted mana cost 2 from your hand, you can’t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it’s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you’re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn’t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you’ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you’ll exile the card if it would leave the stack.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can’t cast the half with aftermath.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you’ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, each opponent in turn order chooses a creature they control, if they control any creatures. After each opponent has done so, you gain control of each chosen creature simultaneously.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well, and any effects that give the player control of permanents immediately end.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Once Riches begins to resolve, no player may take other actions until it’s done. Notably, opponents can’t try to remove a creature after choosing it but before you gain control of it.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Rags affects only creatures on the battlefield at the time it resolves. It won’t affect creatures that enter the battlefield or noncreature permanents that become creatures later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Riches’s effect doesn’t target. Creatures with hexproof may be lured away this way.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Riches’s effect lasts indefinitely. It doesn’t wear off during the cleanup step.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you’d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its converted mana cost is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with converted mana cost 2 from your hand, you can’t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it’s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you’re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn’t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you’ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you’ll exile the card if it would leave the stack.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can’t cast the half with aftermath.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you’ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you’d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The value of X is determined only as Onward resolves. It won’t change later in the turn if other effects modify the creature’s power.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its converted mana cost is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with converted mana cost 2 from your hand, you can’t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it’s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you’re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn’t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you’ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you’ll exile the card if it would leave the stack.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can’t cast the half with aftermath.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you’ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you’d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its converted mana cost is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with converted mana cost 2 from your hand, you can’t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A split card only counts once for Cryptic Serpent’s ability, even if it’s both an instant and a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Cryptic Serpent’s ability can’t reduce its cost to less than {U}{U}.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Cryptic Serpent’s ability doesn’t change its mana cost or converted mana cost. It just reduces the cost to cast the spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A split card only counts once for Warfire Javelineer’s ability, even if it’s both an instant and a sorcery.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A token creature exiled this way won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'After the target creature returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the creature that was exiled. It won’t be in combat or have any additional abilities it may have had when it was exiled. Any counters on it or Auras attached to it are removed, and any Equipment will no longer be attached.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Vizier of Deferment’s triggered ability can target any creature, but it will affect a creature only if that creature was declared as an attacker or blocker this turn, whether you cast Vizier of Deferment during combat or later in the turn. Notably, the ability won’t affect a creature that entered the battlefield attacking or blocking.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon. They\\\'re generally written "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keyword abilities (such as equip) are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text. An activated mana ability is one that produces mana as it resolves, not one that costs mana to activate. Notably, exerting a creature isn\\\'t an activated ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Harsh Mentor\'s ability doesn\'t trigger when an opponent activates an ability of a card in hand (such as cycling) or a card in a graveyard (such as embalm), even if that causes a card to be put onto the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Harsh Mentor\'s ability resolves before the ability that caused it to trigger."}]', "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keyword abilities (such as embalm) are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Any untapped Zombie you control can be tapped to pay the second ability’s activation cost, even one that just came under your control.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can’t normally activate abilities of cards in graveyards. Those that you can activate are those that instruct you to move the card out of a graveyard, or those that specifically say that you can activate them if the card is in your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keyword abilities are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text. Triggered abilities (starting with “when,” “whenever,” or “at”) are unaffected by the last ability of Edifice of Authority. Notably, exerting a creature isn’t an activated ability.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Edifice of Authority can’t be used to undo an attack or block once it has been declared. Its abilities must be activated no later than the beginning of combat step to stop a creature from attacking, and no later than the declare attackers step to stop a creature from blocking.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Once a player has announced that they are activating the ability of a creature, Edifice of Authority can’t be used to undo it. Its last ability must be activated before the player activates that creature’s ability. The player may respond to Edifice of Authority’s ability with the target creature’s ability if able.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All attackers are chosen at once. You can’t attack with Ahn-Crop Champion, untap a tapped creature, and then attack with that creature.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All cards in the Amonkhet set that let you exert a creature let you do so as you declare it as an attacking creature, as do some of the cards in the Hour of Devastation set. You can’t do so later in combat, and creatures put onto the battlefield attacking can’t be exerted. Any abilities that trigger on exerting an attacking creature will resolve before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If an exerted creature is already untapped during your next untap step (most likely because it had vigilance or an effect untapped it), exert’s effect preventing it from untapping expires without having done anything.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you attack with two Ahn-Crop Champions and exert both, each will untap the other.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you gain control of another player’s creature until end of turn and exert it, it will untap during that player’s untap step.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Untapping an attacking creature doesn’t remove it from combat.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can’t exert a creature unless an effect allows you to do so. Similar effects that “tap and freeze” a creature (such as that of Decision Paralysis) don’t exert that creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All attackers are chosen at once. You can’t attack with Champion of Rhonas, put a creature card onto the battlefield, and then attack with that creature.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All cards in the Amonkhet set that let you exert a creature let you do so as you declare it as an attacking creature, as do some of the cards in the Hour of Devastation set. You can’t do so later in combat, and creatures put onto the battlefield attacking can’t be exerted. Any abilities that trigger on exerting an attacking creature will resolve before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If an exerted creature is already untapped during your next untap step (most likely because it had vigilance or an effect untapped it), exert’s effect preventing it from untapping expires without having done anything.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If the creature put onto the battlefield has any abilities that trigger when creatures attack or when you exert creatures, those abilities won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you gain control of another player’s creature until end of turn and exert it, it will untap during that player’s untap step.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can’t exert a creature unless an effect allows you to do so. Similar effects that “tap and freeze” a creature (such as that of Decision Paralysis) don’t exert that creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All attackers are chosen at once. You can’t attack with Devoted Crop-Mate, return a creature card to the battlefield, and then attack with that creature.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All cards in the Amonkhet set that let you exert a creature let you do so as you declare it as an attacking creature, as do some of the cards in the Hour of Devastation set. You can’t do so later in combat, and creatures put onto the battlefield attacking can’t be exerted. Any abilities that trigger on exerting an attacking creature will resolve before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a creature has a targeted triggered ability that triggers when you exert it, you can exert it even if there isn’t a legal target for that triggered ability.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If an exerted creature is already untapped during your next untap step (most likely because it had vigilance or an effect untapped it), exert’s effect preventing it from untapping expires without having done anything.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If the creature returned to the battlefield has any abilities that trigger when creatures attack or when you exert creatures, those abilities won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If the mana cost of a card in your graveyard includes X, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you gain control of another player’s creature until end of turn and exert it, it will untap during that player’s untap step.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The converted mana cost of a card in your graveyard is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner. The converted mana cost is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {1}{U}{U} has converted mana cost 3.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can’t exert a creature unless an effect allows you to do so. Similar effects that “tap and freeze” a creature (such as that of Decision Paralysis) don’t exert that creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All attackers are chosen at once. You can’t attack with one, sacrifice it to satisfy Bontu’s combat restriction, and then attack with Bontu.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Creature tokens that die are put into your graveyard as normal (and cease to exist soon after). If one died this turn, it satisfies Bontu’s combat restriction.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Bontu’s activated ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life and you gain 1 life.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The creature that died doesn’t have to still be in its owner’s graveyard to satisfy Bontu’s combat restriction.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All cards in the Amonkhet set that let you exert a creature let you do so as you declare it as an attacking creature, as do some of the cards in the Hour of Devastation set. You can’t do so later in combat, and creatures put onto the battlefield attacking can’t be exerted. Any abilities that trigger on exerting an attacking creature will resolve before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a creature has a targeted triggered ability that triggers when you exert it, you can exert it even if there isn’t a legal target for that triggered ability.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If an exerted creature is already untapped during your next untap step (most likely because it had vigilance or an effect untapped it), exert’s effect preventing it from untapping expires without having done anything.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you gain control of another player’s creature until end of turn and exert it, it will untap during that player’s untap step.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can’t exert a creature unless an effect allows you to do so. Similar effects that “tap and freeze” a creature (such as that of Decision Paralysis) don’t exert that creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All cards in the Amonkhet set that let you exert a creature let you do so as you declare it as an attacking creature, as do some of the cards in the Hour of Devastation set. You can’t do so later in combat, and creatures put onto the battlefield attacking can’t be exerted. Any abilities that trigger on exerting an attacking creature will resolve before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If an exerted creature is already untapped during your next untap step (most likely because it had vigilance or an effect untapped it), exert’s effect preventing it from untapping expires without having done anything.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you gain control of another player’s creature until end of turn and exert it, it will untap during that player’s untap step.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Some cards have abilities that trigger whenever you exert any creature. These abilities trigger when you exert that creature or any other creature you control.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can’t exert a creature unless an effect allows you to do so. Similar effects that “tap and freeze” a creature (such as that of Decision Paralysis) don’t exert that creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All cards in the Amonkhet set that let you exert a creature let you do so as you declare it as an attacking creature, as do some of the cards in the Hour of Devastation set. You can’t do so later in combat, and creatures put onto the battlefield attacking can’t be exerted. Any abilities that trigger on exerting an attacking creature will resolve before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If an exerted creature is already untapped during your next untap step (most likely because it had vigilance or an effect untapped it), exert’s effect preventing it from untapping expires without having done anything.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you gain control of another player’s creature until end of turn and exert it, it will untap during that player’s untap step.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can’t exert a creature unless an effect allows you to do so. Similar effects that “tap and freeze” a creature (such as that of Decision Paralysis) don’t exert that creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All creatures you control get +1/+1 from Gideon’s first ability, not just the ones that it untapped.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Gideon’s second ability causes him to become a creature with the creature types Human and Soldier. He remains a planeswalker with the planeswalker type Gideon. (He also retains any other card types or subtypes he may have had.) Each subtype is correlated to the proper card type: planeswalker is only a type (not a creature type), and Human and Soldier are just creature types (not planeswalker types).'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Gideon’s second ability doesn’t count as a creature entering the battlefield. Gideon was already on the battlefield; he only changed his types.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If Gideon becomes a creature the same turn he enters the battlefield, you can’t attack with him or use any of his {T} abilities (if he gains any).'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If damage that can’t be prevented is dealt to Gideon after his second ability has resolved, that damage will have all applicable results: specifically, the damage is marked on Gideon (since he’s a creature) and that damage causes that many loyalty counters to be removed from him (since he’s a planeswalker). Even though he has indestructible, if Gideon has no loyalty counters on him, he’s put into his owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The set of creatures affected by Gideon’s first and third abilities is determined as the abilities resolve. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn and permanents you control that become creatures later in the turn won’t get +1/+1 or +2/+2.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All of the tokens enter the battlefield simultaneously. They’ll be created with the same name, color, type and subtype, abilities, power, toughness, and so on.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If an effect creates more than one kind of token, it’ll create twice as many of each kind. For example, if you cast Bestial Menace while controlling Anointed Procession, you’ll create two Snake tokens, two Wolf tokens, and two Elephant tokens.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If the effect creating the tokens instructs you to do something with those tokens at a later time, like exiling them at the end of combat, you’ll do that for all the tokens.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If the token you create has any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities, first determine how many tokens are being created, then apply those abilities individually for each one. For example, if a token with “You may have [this permanent] enter the battlefield as a copy of any creature on the battlefield” would be created (such as an embalmed Vizier of Many Faces), the resulting two tokens can each copy a different creature.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you control two Anointed Processions, then the number of tokens created is four times the original number. If you control three, then the number of tokens created is eight times the original number, and so on.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'There are many important moments in the story, but the most crucial—called “story spotlights”—are shown on cards. These cards have the Planeswalker symbol in their text box; this symbol has no effect on gameplay. You can read more about these events in the official Magic fiction at http://www.mtgstory.com.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All other Cats you control get +1/+1 and have lifelink, not just those created by Regal Caracal’s last ability.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers whenever you "cycle or discard" a card triggers only once if you cycle a card. The ability "Whenever you discard a card" is functionally identical to this ability; cycling is mentioned for clarity.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "An ability that triggers whenever you discard a card doesn\'t give you permission to discard cards. You\'ll need another effect that instructs or allows you to discard them."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'If a player discards a card during their cleanup step due to having too many cards in hand, any appropriate abilities that trigger on discarding that card trigger. If this happens, those triggered abilities are put onto the stack and players receive priority in that cleanup step to cast spells or activate abilities (normally, no players may take actions during a cleanup step). Another cleanup step is created following that one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'Some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.\'}]', "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'An ability that triggers whenever you discard a card doesn’t give you permission to discard cards. You’ll need another effect that instructs or allows you to discard them.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'An ability that triggers whenever you “cycle or discard” a card triggers only once if you cycle a card. The ability “Whenever you discard a card” is functionally identical to this ability; cycling is mentioned for clarity.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Giving a creature flying after it’s already been blocked won’t change or undo that block. If you want the flying to affect what can block the creature, you must cycle or discard a card during the declare attackers step at the latest.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a player discards a card during their cleanup step due to having too many cards in hand, any appropriate abilities that trigger on discarding that card trigger. If this happens, those triggered abilities are put onto the stack and players receive priority in that cleanup step to cast spells or activate abilities (normally, no players may take actions during a cleanup step). Another cleanup step is created following that one.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'An ability that triggers whenever you discard a card doesn’t give you permission to discard cards. You’ll need another effect that instructs or allows you to discard them.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'An ability that triggers whenever you “cycle or discard” a card triggers only once if you cycle a card. The ability “Whenever you discard a card” is functionally identical to this ability; cycling is mentioned for clarity.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a player discards a card during their cleanup step due to having too many cards in hand, any appropriate abilities that trigger on discarding that card trigger. If this happens, those triggered abilities are put onto the stack and players receive priority in that cleanup step to cast spells or activate abilities (normally, no players may take actions during a cleanup step). Another cleanup step is created following that one.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While resolving Drake Haven’s triggered ability, you can’t pay {1} multiple times to get multiple Drakes.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'An ability that triggers whenever you discard a card doesn’t give you permission to discard cards. You’ll need another effect that instructs or allows you to discard them.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'An ability that triggers whenever you “cycle or discard” a card triggers only once if you cycle a card. The ability “Whenever you discard a card” is functionally identical to this ability; cycling is mentioned for clarity.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a player discards a card during their cleanup step due to having too many cards in hand, any appropriate abilities that trigger on discarding that card trigger. If this happens, those triggered abilities are put onto the stack and players receive priority in that cleanup step to cast spells or activate abilities (normally, no players may take actions during a cleanup step). Another cleanup step is created following that one.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While resolving Ruthless Sniper’s triggered ability, you can’t pay {1} multiple times to put more counters on creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'An ability that triggers whenever you discard a card doesn’t give you permission to discard cards. You’ll need another effect that instructs or allows you to discard them.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'An ability that triggers whenever you “cycle or discard” a card triggers only once if you cycle a card. The ability “Whenever you discard a card” is functionally identical to this ability; cycling is mentioned for clarity.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a player discards a card during their cleanup step due to having too many cards in hand, any appropriate abilities that trigger on discarding that card trigger. If this happens, those triggered abilities are put onto the stack and players receive priority in that cleanup step to cast spells or activate abilities (normally, no players may take actions during a cleanup step). Another cleanup step is created following that one.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'An opponent with one or two cards in their graveyard won’t exile any cards.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'When this ability resolves, first the player whose turn it is (if that player is an opponent) chooses two cards in their graveyard, then each other opponent in turn order does the same, then all of the other cards in their graveyards are exiled simultaneously. Each player will know the choices made by the players who chose before them.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Any change to a land’s type or abilities gained by a land can affect the types of mana a land can produce.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Naga Vitalist checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands you control, but it doesn’t check their costs or legality. For example, Spire of Industry says “{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool. Activate this ability only if you control an artifact.” If you control Spire of Industry and Naga Vitalist, you can tap Naga Vitalist for any color of mana. It doesn’t matter whether you control an artifact, whether you can pay 1 life, or whether Spire of Industry is untapped.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Naga Vitalist doesn’t care about any restrictions or riders your lands put on the mana they produce, such as the one Cavern of Souls has. It just cares about types of mana.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The types of mana are white, blue, black, red, green, and colorless.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when Vizier of Many Faces enters the battlefield. Any "as [this creature] enters the battlefield" or "[this creature] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the chosen creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'For each card with embalm, a corresponding game play supplement token can be found in some Amonkhet booster packs. These supplements are not required to play with cards with embalm; you can use the same items to represent an embalmed token as you would any other token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If Vizier of Many Faces somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another creature, Vizier of Many Faces can\'t become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that\'s already on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'If the card copied by the token had any "when [this permanent] enters the battlefield" abilities, then the token also has those abilities and will trigger them when it\\\'s created. Similarly, any "as [this permanent] enters the battlefield" or "[this permanent] enters the battlefield with" abilities that the token has copied will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'If the chosen creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If the chosen creature is a token, Vizier of Many Faces copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token. Vizier of Many Faces is not a token in this case unless it\'s embalmed."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'If the chosen creature is copying something else (for example, if the chosen creature is another Vizier of Many Faces), then Vizier of Many Faces enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen creature copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'The characteristics Vizier of Many Faces gains as part of its copy effect are copiable values that other effects may copy.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else. It doesn\'t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'The token is a Zombie in addition to its other types and is white instead of its other colors. It has no mana cost, and thus its mana value is 0. These are copiable values of the token that other effects may copy.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Vizier of Many Faces copies exactly what was printed on the original creature (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability puts a creature card with embalm into your graveyard during your main phase, you\'ll have priority immediately after that spell or ability resolves. You can activate the creature card\'s embalm ability before any player can exile it with an effect, such as that of Crook of Condemnation, if it\'s legal for you to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Once you\'ve activated an embalm ability, the card is immediately exiled. Opponents can\'t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnatnion."}]', "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Any power- or toughness-modifying effects (those that give +N/+N, for example) and counters will apply to the creature’s new base power and toughness, even if they started to apply before Illusory Wrappings became attached.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Illusory Wrappings overwrites all previous effects that set the creature’s base power and toughness to specific values, including those that define a * such as that of Enigma Drake. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply to a creature after Illusory Wrappings becomes attached to it will overwrite this effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Any “at the beginning of the next end step” triggered abilities won’t get the chance to trigger that turn because the end step is skipped. Those abilities will trigger at the beginning of the end step of the next turn.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Ending the turn this way means the following things happen in order: 1) All spells and abilities on the stack are exiled. This includes spells and abilities that can’t be countered. 2) If there are any attacking and blocking creatures, they’re removed from combat. 3) State-based actions are checked. No player gets priority, and no triggered abilities are put onto the stack. 4) The current phase and/or step ends. The game skips straight to the cleanup step. 5) The cleanup step happens in its entirety.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If Glorious End’s delayed triggered ability is countered, it won’t trigger again. The same is true if it’s removed from the stack in any other way (such as by a second even more Glorious End) or if it resolves and you don’t lose the game (perhaps because of the emblem of Gideon of the Trials).'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If any triggered abilities do trigger during this process, they’re put onto the stack during the cleanup step. If this happens, players will have a chance to cast spells and activate abilities, then there will be another cleanup step before the turn is over.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Though other spells and abilities that are exiled won’t get a chance to resolve, they don’t count as being countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Aura spells you cast target the permanent they will enchant.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'For each card with embalm, a corresponding game play supplement token can be found in some Amonkhet booster packs. These supplements are not required to play with cards with embalm; you can use the same items to represent an embalmed token as you would any other token.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else. It doesn’t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The token is a Zombie in addition to its other types and is white instead of its other colors. It has no mana cost, and thus its converted mana cost is 0. These are copiable values of the token that other effects may copy.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You’ll sacrifice Labyrinth Guardian even if you counter the spell that targets it. If that spell has no other targets, it’ll be countered when it tries to resolve.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a spell or ability puts a creature card with embalm into your graveyard during your main phase, you’ll have priority immediately after that spell or ability resolves. You can activate the creature card’s embalm ability before any player can exile it with an effect, such as that of Crook of Condemnation, if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve activated an embalm ability, the card is immediately exiled. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnatnion.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'For each card with embalm, a corresponding game play supplement token can be found in some Amonkhet booster packs. These supplements are not required to play with cards with embalm; you can use the same items to represent an embalmed token as you would any other token.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If Angel of Sanctions leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the target permanent won’t be exiled.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If the card copied by the token had any “when [this permanent] enters the battlefield” abilities, then the token also has those abilities and will trigger them when it’s created. Similarly, any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities that the token has copied will also work.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if Angel of Sanctions’s owner leaves the game, the exiled card will return to the battlefield. Because the one-shot effect that returns the card isn’t an ability that goes on the stack, it won’t cease to exist along with the leaving player’s spells and abilities on the stack.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The exiled card returns to the battlefield immediately after Angel of Sanctions leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between the two events, including state-based actions.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else. It doesn’t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The token is a Zombie in addition to its other types and is white instead of its other colors. It has no mana cost, and thus its mana value is 0. These are copiable values of the token that other effects may copy.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a spell or ability puts a creature card with embalm into your graveyard during your main phase, you’ll have priority immediately after that spell or ability resolves. You can activate the creature card’s embalm ability before any player can exile it with an effect, such as that of Crook of Condemnation, if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve activated an embalm ability, the card is immediately exiled. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnatnion.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If Cast Out leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the target permanent won’t be exiled.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if Cast Out’s owner leaves the game, the exiled card will return to the battlefield. Because the one-shot effect that returns the card isn’t an ability that goes on the stack, it won’t cease to exist along with the leaving player’s spells and abilities on the stack.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The exiled card returns to the battlefield immediately after Cast Out leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between the two events, including state-based actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until it’s removed as the turn ends, the damage a Grim Strider takes during combat may become lethal if you draw cards later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a spell or ability causes you to draw cards and then has you remove some from hand (such as by discarding them or putting them on top of your library), Grim Strider may briefly have 0 toughness or less. As long as its toughness is 1 or greater again after the spell or ability is finished resolving, it will remain on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Cartouche is an enchantment subtype with no special meaning. Other cards may care about which enchantments are Cartouches.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each Cartouche is an Aura with “Enchant creature you control.” If another player gains control of either the Cartouche or the enchanted creature (but not both), then the Cartouche will be enchanting an illegal permanent and be put into its owner’s graveyard as a state-based action.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If Cartouche of Strength leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the creature it last enchanted will fight the target creature if it’s still on the battlefield at that time. However, it won’t have +1/+1 from Cartouche of Strength anymore.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If the target creature becomes an illegal target before a Cartouche spell resolves, the spell doesn’t resolve. It doesn’t enter the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If the triggered ability’s target is illegal when it tries to resolve, or if the enchanted creature has left the battlefield, no creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The enchanted creature has +1/+1 and trample while it’s fighting. However, trample doesn’t apply during a fight.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Cartouche is an enchantment subtype with no special meaning. Other cards may care about which enchantments are Cartouches.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each Cartouche is an Aura with “Enchant creature you control.” If another player gains control of either the Cartouche or the enchanted creature (but not both), then the Cartouche will be enchanting an illegal permanent and be put into its owner’s graveyard as a state-based action.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If the target creature becomes an illegal target before a Cartouche spell resolves, the spell doesn’t resolve. It doesn’t enter the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The target creature for the triggered ability of Cartouche of Ambition doesn’t have to be the creature it enchants.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Cartouche is an enchantment subtype with no special meaning. Other cards may care about which enchantments are Cartouches.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each Cartouche is an Aura with “Enchant creature you control.” If another player gains control of either the Cartouche or the enchanted creature (but not both), then the Cartouche will be enchanting an illegal permanent and be put into its owner’s graveyard as a state-based action.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If the target creature becomes an illegal target before a Cartouche spell resolves, the spell doesn’t resolve. It doesn’t enter the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Certain older cards have variants of cycling, such as basic landcycling or Wizardcycling. New Perspectives gives these abilities an alternate activation cost as well.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you choose to pay New Perspectives’s alternate activation cost, you still discard the card with cycling to activate the ability.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The card you wish to cycle counts when determining whether you have seven or more cards in hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Certain older cards have variants of cycling, such as basic landcycling or Wizardcycling. Sacred Excavation can target these cards in your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Compulsory Rest grants the activated ability to the enchanted creature. That creature’s controller (not the controller of Compulsory Rest) may activate the ability and gain 2 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Damage that would be dealt to creatures you control is unaffected.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If multiple sources would deal damage to you at once (for example, several attacking creatures), 1 damage from each of those sources is prevented.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Decimator Beetle’s second ability can target any creature you control, not just one with a -1/-1 counter on it. It’ll put a -1/-1 counter on the opponent’s creature even if there isn’t one to remove from your creature.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If one target of Decimator Beetle’s second ability becomes illegal, the other will still be affected.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn’t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Djeru’s Resolve can target an untapped creature. Its prevention effect will still be applied.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Untapping an attacking creature doesn’t remove it from combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each Trial has an ability to return to your hand when a Cartouche enters the battlefield under your control. The Trial is returned to its owner’s hand only if it’s on the battlefield as the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If an effect allows you to exert a creature as it attacks, you may do so even if it has vigilance. It won’t be tapped.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Trial of Solidarity’s triggered ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. It won’t affect creatures that come under your control later in the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each Trial has an ability to return to your hand when a Cartouche enters the battlefield under your control. The Trial is returned to its owner’s hand only if it’s on the battlefield as the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Each additional Vizier of Remedies you control will decrease the number of -1/-1 counters put on a creature by one.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a creature you control is dealt damage by a source with wither or infect, that much damage is dealt, but one fewer -1/-1 counter is put on your creature. For example, if a 2/2 creature with lifelink and infect is blocked by Vizier of Remedies, the first creature’s controller gains 2 life and puts one -1/-1 counter on Vizier of Remedies.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If an effect puts Vizier of Remedies onto the battlefield with one or more -1/-1 counters on it, its effect won’t apply. This is because you must control Vizier of Remedies before the creature begins to enter the battlefield for its effect to apply. The same is true of any creatures entering the battlefield with -1/-1 counters on them at the same time as Vizier of Remedies enters the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If multiple creatures with wither and/or infect deal damage to a creature at once, Vizier of Remedies causes only one counter fewer to be put on that creature. Its effect doesn’t apply separately for each creature dealing damage.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': '“Put on a creature you control” includes that creature entering the battlefield with -1/-1 counters on it. If a creature would enter the battlefield under your control with a number of -1/-1 counters on it while you control Vizier of Remedies, it enters with that many counters minus one.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'For each card with embalm, a corresponding game play supplement token can be found in some Amonkhet booster packs. These supplements are not required to play with cards with embalm; you can use the same items to represent an embalmed token as you would any other token.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Heart-Piercer Manticore features a new style of triggered ability. When it enters the battlefield, its triggered ability goes on the stack without a target. While that ability is resolving, you may sacrifice a creature. If you do, a second ability triggers and you pick a target that will be dealt damage. This is different from other abilities that say “If you do . . .” in that players may cast spells and activate abilities before a creature is sacrificed and then again after the creature is sacrificed but before damage is dealt.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Heart-Piercer Manticore’s damage-dealing ability triggers only when you sacrifice a creature as a result of the instruction of its triggered ability. It won’t trigger if you sacrifice a creature for any other reason.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If the card copied by the token had any “when [this permanent] enters the battlefield” abilities, then the token also has those abilities and will trigger them when it’s created. Similarly, any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities that the token has copied will also work.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The sacrificed creature’s last known existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its power.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else. It doesn’t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The token is a Zombie in addition to its other types and is white instead of its other colors. It has no mana cost, and thus its converted mana cost is 0. These are copiable values of the token that other effects may copy.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can’t sacrifice multiple creatures to deal damage multiple times.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a spell or ability puts a creature card with embalm into your graveyard during your main phase, you’ll have priority immediately after that spell or ability resolves. You can activate the creature card’s embalm ability before any player can exile it with an effect, such as that of Crook of Condemnation, if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve activated an embalm ability, the card is immediately exiled. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnatnion.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'For each card with embalm, a corresponding game play supplement token can be found in some Amonkhet booster packs. These supplements are not required to play with cards with embalm; you can use the same items to represent an embalmed token as you would any other token.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If Anointer Priest enters the battlefield at the same time as a creature token, its ability triggers for that other creature. For example, if you control Anointed Procession and embalm Anointer Priest, the triggered ability of each one triggers twice and you gain a total of 4 life.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If Anointer Priest is a token, most likely because it’s embalmed, it will cause its own ability to trigger when it enters the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If the card copied by the token had any “when [this permanent] enters the battlefield” abilities, then the token also has those abilities and will trigger them when it’s created. Similarly, any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities that the token has copied will also work.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else. It doesn’t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The token is a Zombie in addition to its other types and is white instead of its other colors. It has no mana cost, and thus its mana value is 0. These are copiable values of the token that other effects may copy.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a spell or ability puts a creature card with embalm into your graveyard during your main phase, you’ll have priority immediately after that spell or ability resolves. You can activate the creature card’s embalm ability before any player can exile it with an effect, such as that of Crook of Condemnation, if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve activated an embalm ability, the card is immediately exiled. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnatnion.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'For each card with embalm, a corresponding game play supplement token can be found in some Amonkhet booster packs. These supplements are not required to play with cards with embalm; you can use the same items to represent an embalmed token as you would any other token.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else. It doesn’t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The token is a Zombie in addition to its other types and is white instead of its other colors. It has no mana cost, and thus its converted mana cost is 0. These are copiable values of the token that other effects may copy.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a spell or ability puts a creature card with embalm into your graveyard during your main phase, you’ll have priority immediately after that spell or ability resolves. You can activate the creature card’s embalm ability before any player can exile it with an effect, such as that of Crook of Condemnation, if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve activated an embalm ability, the card is immediately exiled. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnatnion.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'For each card with embalm, a corresponding game play supplement token can be found in some Amonkhet booster packs. These supplements are not required to play with cards with embalm; you can use the same items to represent an embalmed token as you would any other token.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else. It doesn’t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The token is a Zombie in addition to its other types and is white instead of its other colors. It has no mana cost, and thus its mana value is 0. These are copiable values of the token that other effects may copy.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a spell or ability puts a creature card with embalm into your graveyard during your main phase, you’ll have priority immediately after that spell or ability resolves. You can activate the creature card’s embalm ability before any player can exile it with an effect, such as that of Crook of Condemnation, if it’s legal for you to do so.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve activated an embalm ability, the card is immediately exiled. Opponents can’t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnatnion.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Gaining control of a creature doesn’t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it. They’ll remain attached, but an Aura’s effect that affects “you” still affects its controller rather than you, the controller of an Equipment can move it during their next main phase, and so on.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Gideon’s first ability will continue to prevent damage dealt by the target permanent even if Gideon leaves the battlefield before your next turn.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Gideon’s second ability causes him to become a creature with the creature types Human and Soldier. He remains a planeswalker with the planeswalker type Gideon. (He also retains any other card types or subtypes he may have had.) Each subtype is correlated to the proper card type: planeswalker is only a type (not a creature type), and Human and Soldier are just creature types (not planeswalker types).'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Gideon’s second ability doesn’t count as a creature entering the battlefield. Gideon was already on the battlefield; he only changed his types.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If Gideon becomes a creature the same turn he enters the battlefield, you can’t attack with him or use any of his {T} abilities (if he gains any).'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If Gideon leaves the battlefield after giving you his emblem, you’ll keep the emblem. Its effect will apply again later if another Gideon comes under your control.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If damage that can’t be prevented is dealt to Gideon after his second ability has resolved, that damage will have all applicable results: specifically, the damage is marked on Gideon (since he’s a creature) and that damage causes that many loyalty counters to be removed from him (since he’s a planeswalker). Even though he has indestructible, if Gideon has no loyalty counters on him, he’s put into his owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you have Gideon’s emblem in a Two-Headed Giant game and control a Gideon planeswalker, your team can’t lose the game and the opposing team can’t win the game. If your teammate controls a Gideon planeswalker but you do not, your emblem’s effect doesn’t apply.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'No game effect can cause you to lose the game or cause any opponent to win the game while Gideon’s emblem is in effect. It doesn’t matter whether you have 0 or less life, you’re forced to draw a card while your library is empty, you have ten or more poison counters, you’re at your Glorious End, your opponent casts a second Approach of the Second Sun, or so on. You keep playing.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Other circumstances can still cause you to lose the game. You will lose a game if you concede, if you’re penalized with a Game Loss or a Match Loss during a sanctioned tournament due to a DCI rules infraction, or if your Magic Online® game clock runs out of time.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If Bounty of the Luxa leaves the battlefield while its triggered ability is on the stack, you can’t remove any flood counters from it, even if it had one before it left the battlefield. You won’t put one on it as the ability resolves, but you will draw a card.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If Bounty of the Luxa somehow has multiple flood counters on it, you’ll still get only {C}{G}{U} when you remove them all.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If Consuming Fervor is removed, the enchanted creature keeps the -1/-1 counters but loses the +3/+3 bonus.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If one creature is enchanted with two Consuming Fervors, it has the triggered ability twice and it gets two -1/-1 counters at the beginning of your upkeep.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If Exemplar of Strength leaves the battlefield in response to its second triggered ability, you won’t be able to remove a counter from it, and you won’t gain 1 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If Gate to the Afterlife is put into a graveyard at the same time a nontoken creature you control dies, its first ability triggers for that creature.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'There is no card named God-Pharaoh’s Gift in this set. During the upcoming Hour of Devastation set, you may prove worthy of receiving it.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If Nissa leaves the battlefield while her second ability is on the stack, use her last known loyalty to determine whether you may put the top card of your library onto the battlefield. If Nissa left the battlefield because she took enough damage to reduce her loyalty to 0, then her last known loyalty is 0.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If X is 0, Nissa enters the battlefield with no loyalty and is put into her owner’s graveyard before you can activate her abilities.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Nissa’s last ability sets the base power and toughness of the lands to 5/5. Any +1/+1 or -1/-1 counters that were on those lands will apply to those values.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Once Nissa’s second ability begins to resolve, no player may take actions until it’s done. Notably, players can’t try to change Nissa’s loyalty once you look at the card or choose to put it onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While resolving Nissa’s second ability, if you can’t or don’t put the card onto the battlefield, it remains on top of your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If Synchronized Strike targets two creatures and one becomes an illegal target before it resolves, the remaining target creature will still be untapped and get +2/+2.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Synchronized Strike can target an untapped creature. It will still get +2/+2.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can cast Synchronized Strike with two, one, or zero targets.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can’t target the same creature twice to have it get +4/+4.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If Wayward Servant enters the battlefield at the same time as another Zombie creature, its ability triggers for that Zombie.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, the triggered ability of Wayward Servant causes the opposing team to lose 2 life and you gain 1 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a creature enters the battlefield under enchanted player’s control and causes an ability controlled by that player to trigger, the triggered ability of Trespasser’s Curse resolves first if it’s that player’s turn, and resolves last if it’s your turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a creature with wither or infect deals damage to a creature, the controller of the creature with wither or infect puts that many -1/-1 counters on the second creature.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If an effect has you put more -1/-1 counters on a creature than it has toughness, you’ll put all of those counters on it and create that many Insects, even if that makes its toughness a negative number.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a creature with wither or infect deals damage to a creature, the controller of the creature with wither or infect puts that many -1/-1 counters on the second creature.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you put any number of -1/-1 counters on more than one creature at once, Hapatra’s last ability triggers once for each of those creatures.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you put enough -1/-1 counters on Hapatra so that its toughness is 0 or less, its last ability triggers.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a creature with wither or infect deals damage to a creature, the controller of the creature with wither or infect puts that many -1/-1 counters on the second creature.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you put enough -1/-1 counters on Defiant Greatmaw so that its toughness is 0 or less, its last ability triggers.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a spell or ability an opponent controls causes a source you control to deal noncombat damage to a creature an opponent controls, that damage will be replaced with -1/-1 counters.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If an effect causes a creature you control to fight a creature an opponent controls, the damage is dealt simultaneously. For instance, if your 2/2 creature fights an opponent’s 4/4 creature, your creature will be dealt 4 damage and your opponent’s creature will have two -1/-1 counters put on it.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If multiple prevention and/or replacement effects are trying to apply to the same damage, the controller of the creature that would be dealt damage chooses the order in which to apply them. As examples, an opponent could choose to apply the effect of Djeru’s Resolve and prevent the damage rather than put -1/-1 counters on it; or an opponent could choose to convert the damage to -1/-1 counters before Insult could double it, and then Insult’s effect won’t apply anymore.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Soul-Scar Mage’s effect isn’t a prevention effect. Damage that can’t be prevented will be replaced with -1/-1 counters.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If an artifact enters the battlefield under an opponent’s control at the same time that Manglehorn enters the battlefield under your control, that artifact won’t enter tapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If an effect causes Supply Caravan to enter the battlefield tapped, it will satisfy its own triggered ability.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you don’t control a tapped creature as Supply Caravan enters the battlefield, its ability doesn’t trigger, even if you can tap a creature right away. If you control no tapped creatures as the ability resolves, nothing happens.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If another Zombie you control dies at the same time as Plague Belcher, Plague Belcher’s last ability will trigger for that Zombie.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, the triggered ability of Plague Belcher causes the opposing team to lose 2 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If either target becomes illegal after Manticore of the Gauntlet’s triggered ability is put onto the stack but before it resolves, the other is still affected as appropriate.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you can’t choose a target opponent when you put Manticore of the Gauntlet’s triggered ability on the stack (most likely because your opponents have hexproof), the ability is removed from the stack and you won’t put a -1/-1 counter on any creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If one of two target creatures becomes an illegal target in response to Splendid Agony, the -1/-1 counter that would have been put on that creature is lost. It can’t be put on the legal target.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You choose how the counters will be distributed as you cast Splendid Agony. Each target creature must be assigned at least one counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If other abilities trigger at the beginning of your end step, first those controlled by your opponents resolve, then yours resolve. Each player orders their triggers in any order.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, the triggered ability of Throne of the God-Pharaoh causes the opposing team to lose life equal to twice the number of tapped creatures you control. Tapped creatures your teammate controls aren’t counted.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Throne of the God-Pharaoh’s ability triggers at the beginning of each of your end steps, even if you control no tapped creatures. The number of tapped creatures you control is checked as the ability resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has X in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'If the exiled card is a land card, you may play it only if you have an available land play this turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as emerge costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, those must be paid to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If you don\'t play the card, it will remain exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Playing a card exiled with Oracle\'s Vault follows the normal timing rules for playing that card. For example, if the card is a creature card, you can cast that card only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "The cards exiled by Oracle\'s Vault are exiled face up."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "The first ability of Oracle\'s Vault puts a brick counter on it even if you can\'t or don\'t play the card."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "You may play the exiled card this turn even if Oracle\'s Vault is no longer on the battlefield or under your control."}]', "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If the creature’s power is greater than 2 as the activated ability tries to resolve, the ability won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. However, if instead the creature’s power is raised above 2 after the ability resolves, it still can’t be blocked that turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If the target nonland permanent is an illegal target by the time Winds of Rebuke resolves, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. No player loses cards from the top of their library.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If the top card of your library changes while you’re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, you can’t look at the new top card until you finish doing so. This means that if you cast the top card of your library, you can’t look at the next one until you’re done paying for that spell.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Normally, Vizier of the Menagerie allows you to cast the top card of your library if it’s a creature card, it’s your main phase, and the stack is empty. If that creature card has flash, you’ll be able to cast it any time you could cast an instant, even on an opponent’s turn.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The top card of your library isn’t in your hand, so you can’t cycle it, discard it, or activate any of its activated abilities.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Vizier of the Menagerie lets you look at the top card of your library whenever you want (with one restriction—see below), even if you don’t have priority. This action doesn’t use the stack. Knowing what that card is becomes part of the information you have access to, just like you can look at the cards in your hand.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You may spend mana as though it were mana of any type to cast any creature spell, not just creature spells that you cast from the top of your library.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You’ll still pay all costs for that spell, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs such as emerge or that of As Foretold.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you choose the name of a split card, you choose one name, not both. For example, you could name Failure or Comply, but not Failure // Comply. Opponents are still allowed to cast the half you didn’t choose.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You may choose the name of a land card. Cards with that name can still be played (since lands are never cast), but damage they would deal to you and your permanents will be prevented.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You must choose the name of a card, not the name of a token. For example, you can’t choose “Zombie” or “Ragavan.” However, if a token happens to have the same name as a card (such as an embalmed creature token), you can choose it.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'There are many important moments in the story, but the most crucial—called “story spotlights”—are shown on cards. These cards have the Planeswalker symbol in their text box; this symbol has no effect on gameplay. You can read more about these events in the official Magic fiction at http://www.mtgstory.com.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you discard a card with madness but don’t cast it, Shadow of the Grave can find it in your graveyard. If you do cast that card, Shadow of the Grave can’t find it in your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Shadow of the Grave returns to your hand all cards that you discarded for any reason—a card you cycled, cards you discarded to an opponent’s Unburden, and a card you discarded to cast Tormenting Voice all count.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Hazoret’s activated ability causes 2 damage to be dealt to each opponent, which is 4 damage to the opposing team.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Once Hazoret has attacked or blocked, it will remain in combat even if the number of cards in your hand becomes two or greater.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, the triggered ability of Faith of the Devoted causes the opposing team to lose 4 life and you gain 2 life.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While resolving the triggered ability of Faith of the Devoted, you can’t pay {1} multiple times to multiply the effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter whether the noncreature spell has resolved or was countered, as long as it was cast. That spell may even still be on the stack when you activate Seeker of Insight’s ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Neheb is affected by its own power-modifying ability once you have one or zero cards in hand.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'When Neheb’s triggered ability resolves, first the player whose turn it is chooses a card to discard, then each other player in turn order chooses a card to discard, then all of those cards are discarded simultaneously. No one sees what the other players are discarding before deciding which card to discard.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Once Kefnet has attacked or blocked, it will remain in combat even if the number of cards in your hand becomes six or fewer.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While resolving Kefnet’s activated ability, you don’t choose which land to return to its owner’s hand (or whether you’ll return one at all) until you see the card you draw.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Once Oketra has attacked or blocked, it will remain in combat even if the number of other creatures you control becomes two or fewer.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You don’t have to attack with three other creatures for Oketra to be able to attack. The same is true of blocking.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Once Rhonas has attacked or blocked, it will remain in combat even if you no longer control another creature with power 4 or greater.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You don’t have to attack with another creature with power 4 or greater for Rhonas to be able to attack. The same is true of blocking.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Once River Serpent has attacked, it will remain in combat even if the number of cards in your graveyard becomes four or fewer.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Once a creature has blocked, Merciless Javelineer’s ability can’t undo that block.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The target creature won’t be able to block even if the -1/-1 counter is removed from it or if the -1/-1 counter can’t be put on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Some cards with cycling have an ability that triggers when you cycle them. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Triggered abilities from cycling a card and the cycling ability itself aren’t spells. Effects that interact with spells (such as that of Cancel) won’t affect them.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can cycle a card even if it has a triggered ability from cycling that won’t have a legal target. This is because the cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. This also means that if either ability doesn’t resolve (due to being countered with Disallow, for example, or if the triggered ability’s targets have become illegal), the other ability will still resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Soulstinger’s second ability targets one creature to get all the counters. You can’t distribute the counters among multiple creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The enchanted player can’t choose to lose 5 life if they have a creature or planeswalker that can be sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The enchanted player chooses a permanent to sacrifice from among the creatures and planeswalkers that player controls. You don’t choose which type of permanent the player has to sacrifice.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'There are many important moments in the story, but the most crucial—called “story spotlights”—are shown on cards. These cards have the Planeswalker symbol in their text box; this symbol has no effect on gameplay. You can read more about these events in the official Magic fiction at http://www.mtgstory.com.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The set of creatures affected by In Oketra’s Name and how those creatures are affected is locked in as In Oketra’s Name resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t get any bonus, and creatures that start or stop being Zombies later in the turn won’t have their bonus changed.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Time to Reflect can target a creature that’s currently blocking or being blocked by a Zombie, or one that blocked or was blocked by a Zombie earlier in the turn.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Time to Reflect only cares that the second creature was a Zombie at the moment it blocked or became blocked by the target creature. If that Zombie has become a non-Zombie creature or left the battlefield, Time to Reflect can still target the first creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Untapping an attacking creature doesn’t remove it from combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'When Miasmic Mummy’s triggered ability resolves, first the player whose turn it is chooses a card to discard, then each other player in turn order chooses a card to discard, then all of those cards are discarded simultaneously. No one sees what the other players are discarding before deciding which card to discard.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While resolving Benefaction of Rhonas, you could put no cards, a creature card, an enchantment card, or a creature card and an enchantment card into your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can cast Bloodrage Brawler even if you have no other cards in your hand. If you have no cards in hand as its ability resolves, nothing happens.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can target a creature with no -1/-1 counters on it. It will still gain hexproof.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You don’t have to make the same choice for each kind of counter. For example, if a Gideon planeswalker has two loyalty counters and three -1/-1 counters on it, you can put another loyalty counter on it and remove a -1/-1 counter from it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'There are many important moments in the story, but the most crucial—called "story spotlights"—are shown on cards. These cards have the Planeswalker symbol in their text box; this symbol has no effect on gameplay. You can read more about these events in the official Magic fiction at http://www.mtgstory.com.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "The cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. If the triggered ability doesn\'t resolve (because, for example, it has been countered, or all of its targets have become illegal), the cycling ability will still resolve, and you\'ll draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'When you cycle this card, first the cycling ability goes on the stack, then the triggered ability goes on the stack on top of it. The triggered ability will resolve before you draw a card from the cycling ability.\'}]', "[{'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'There are many important moments in the story, but the most crucial—called “story spotlights”—are shown on cards. These cards have the Planeswalker symbol in their text box; this symbol has no effect on gameplay. You can read more about these events in the official Magic fiction at http://www.mtgstory.com.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Because damage remains marked on a creature until it\'s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Thresher Lizard while you have one or fewer cards in hand may become lethal if cards are put into your hand during that turn."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'A split card (such as those featured in the Amonkhet block) only counts once for Enigma Drake’s ability, even if it’s both an instant and a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The ability that defines Enigma Drake’s power works in all zones.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Giving a creature flying after it’s already been blocked won’t change or undo that block. If you want to affect what can block the creature, you must cast Mighty Leap during the declare attackers step at the latest.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that Tattered Mummy is dealt lethal damage, you lose the game before its triggered ability goes on the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, the triggered ability of Tattered Mummy causes the opposing team to lose 4 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You must discard exactly one card to cast Tormenting Voice; you can’t cast it without discarding a card, and you can’t discard additional cards.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to interfere with the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The sacrificed creature\'s last known existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its power."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you can\'t cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you can\'t sacrifice additional creatures."}]', "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once a creature with power 3 or greater has blocked Greater Sandwurm, changing the power of the blocking creature won’t cause Greater Sandwurm to become unblocked.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, a player may lose the game at the same time that their creatures die. If so, Bone Picker\'s cost reduction applies."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Galestrike tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You don\'t draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target land is an illegal target by the time Gift of Paradise tries to resolve, it doesn\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield, so its enters-the-battlefield ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Supernatural Stamina\'s effect works only once. If the targeted creature dies and is then returned to the battlefield, it\'s considered to be a new creature. If that new creature dies, it won\'t come back a second time."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'After the search is complete, the entire library is shuffled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Each search works exactly the same as normal except that the opponent doing the searching sees only the top four cards of that library. They can\'t look at the other cards in that library at all. Cards not in the top four cards of the library can\'t be found in the search, even if they\'re identifiable in some manner."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'For effects that check whether a player searched a library or may search a library, searching the top four cards of that library counts as searching that library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If an effect uses the word “search” once but allows an opponent to search for multiple cards, the top four cards remain the same throughout the entire search. Finding one card won\'t cause the fifth card to become included in the search."}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Rhonas\' Monument", \'text\': \'Grüne Kreaturenzauber, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\\nImmer wenn du einen Kreaturenzauber wirkst, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, +2/+2 und verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Auserwählten müssen ihre Körper vervollkommnen, um die grenzenlosen Energien des Jenseits auszuhalten." —Inschrift am Monument\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427207&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d629ca0b-5714-445f-9c9b-8d7cc1e98727\', \'multiverseId\': 427207}, \'multiverseid\': 427207}, {\'name\': \'Monumento a Rhonas\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar los hechizos de criatura verdes.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de criatura, la criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +2/+2 y gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': \'"Los dignos desarrollarán un cuerpo fuerte con el que resistir las energías ilimitadas del más allá". —Inscripción en el monumento\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2883df24-cba8-4348-b83a-2ccdae49c89e\', \'multiverseId\': 427476}, \'multiverseid\': 427476}, {\'name\': \'Monument de Rhonas\', \'text\': "Les sorts de créature verts que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de créature, une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +2/+2 et acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': "« Les valeureux renforceront leurs corps pour résister aux énergies intarissables de l\'au-delà. » —Inscription sur le monument", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427745&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb99296d-c319-421c-b9e4-e791f4a4ceac\', \'multiverseId\': 427745}, \'multiverseid\': 427745}, {\'name\': \'Monumento a Rhonas\', \'text\': \'Le magie creatura verdi che lanci costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia creatura, una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +2/+2 e ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': \'"I prescelti dovranno forgiare il proprio corpo affinché sia in grado di incanalare le inesauribili energie dell\\\'aldilà." —Iscrizione sul monumento\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cc8e55d-cad2-479a-b835-1624160e8f61\', \'multiverseId\': 428014}, \'multiverseid\': 428014}, {\'name\': \'ロナスの碑\', \'text\': \'あなたが緑のクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\nあなたがクリーチャー・呪文を１つ唱えるたび、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受けるとともにトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「蓋世の英雄は来世の限りない活力をもたらす強靭な肉体を持たねばならぬ。」 ――碑文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7ec6742-bb24-498e-a6f0-d267ecd0bbbd\', \'multiverseId\': 428283}, \'multiverseid\': 428283}, {\'name\': \'로나스 기념비\', \'text\': \'당신이 발동하는 녹색 생물 주문들은 발동하는 데 {1}이 덜 든다.\\n당신이 생물 주문을 발동할 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받고 돌진을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'"자격있는 자들은 신체를 강하게 단련해 사후 세계의 무한한 에너지를 견딜 수 있어야 한다." —기념비 비문\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fa2e416-5312-4f98-9b24-dbc18b4e0ee6\', \'multiverseId\': 428552}, \'multiverseid\': 428552}, {\'name\': \'Monumento de Rhonas\', \'text\': \'As mágicas de criatura verdes que você conjura custam {1} a menos para serem conjuradas.\\nToda vez que você conjura uma mágica de criatura, a criatura alvo que você controla recebe +2/+2 e ganha atropelar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'"Os dignos devem cultivar um corpo forte para suportar as energias ilimitadas da vida após a morte." — Inscrição no monumento\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9923457-6f25-47c7-95f9-b85d2dd9cba7\', \'multiverseId\': 428821}, \'multiverseid\': 428821}, {\'name\': \'Монумент Ронаса\', \'text\': \'Разыгрываемые вами заклинания зеленых существ стоят на {1} меньше.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание существа, целевое существо под вашим контролем получает +2/+2 и Пробивной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Достойные должны упражнять тело, чтобы выдержать безграничную энергию загробной жизни». — надпись на монументе\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ec1d223-7362-427a-9c29-5e11aaacbab2\', \'multiverseId\': 429090}, \'multiverseid\': 429090}, {\'name\': \'罗纳斯纪念碑\', \'text\': \'你施放的绿色生物咒语减少{1}来施放。\\n每当你施放生物咒语时，直到回合结束，目标由你操控的生物得+2/+2且获得践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'「豪英应磨练体格，方能承受来世无尽力量。」 ～纪念碑铭文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c2c0e3b-ca68-49d7-a2df-eb779d2ab224\', \'multiverseId\': 429359}, \'multiverseid\': 429359}, {\'name\': \'羅納斯紀念碑\', \'text\': \'你施放的綠色生物咒語減少{1}來施放。\\n每當你施放生物咒語時，直到回合結束，目標由你操控的生物得+2/+2且獲得踐踏異能。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'「豪英應磨練體格，方能承受來世無盡力量。」 ～紀念碑銘文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0e72476-0182-4e38-a184-3de4a9773e76\', \'multiverseId\': 429628}, \'multiverseid\': 429628}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abbrechen\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Lasst mich besser eins von Kefnets Rätseln lösen. Das hier war zu einfach."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427015&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b95ee95a-9285-4a0c-b343-5034cbded17e\', \'multiverseId\': 427015}, \'multiverseid\': 427015}, {\'name\': \'Deshacer\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Déjame intentar uno de los rompecabezas de Kefnet. Este era demasiado fácil".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36580e6a-6ab8-44ba-b0b3-ae2d50acbe80\', \'multiverseId\': 427284}, \'multiverseid\': 427284}, {\'name\': \'Annuler\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Laissez-moi tenter de résoudre l\'une des énigmes de Kefnet. Celle-ci était bien trop simple. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427553&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55553fc9-860c-4722-a1bf-17796f0891e4\', \'multiverseId\': 427553}, \'multiverseid\': 427553}, {\'name\': \'Eliminare\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Dovrei provare a risolvere uno degli enigmi di Kefnet. Questo era troppo facile."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ae8934e-36e3-4c7a-b946-331281e8187f\', \'multiverseId\': 427822}, \'multiverseid\': 427822}, {\'name\': \'取り消し\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「ケフネト様の難問に挑戦させてください。これは簡単過ぎます。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6715d04c-9b66-4d65-8c9d-3f6a8293a751\', \'multiverseId\': 428091}, \'multiverseid\': 428091}, {\'name\': \'주문 취소\', \'text\': \'주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"케프넷의 퍼즐 하나를 풀어보자. 이건 너무 쉽잖아."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4804a096-ef5a-4f8e-98e3-12c17c2b0273\', \'multiverseId\': 428360}, \'multiverseid\': 428360}, {\'name\': \'Cancelar\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Deixe-me tentar resolver um dos enigmas de Kefnet. Esse foi fácil demais."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85481988-87e4-4529-8ed0-5d06402c79a5\', \'multiverseId\': 428629}, \'multiverseid\': 428629}, {\'name\': \'Отмена\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Хочу попробовать какую-нибудь головоломку Кефнета. Эта задача была слишком уж простая».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7042203-71ae-418e-8dd5-6b8d8c5f061a\', \'multiverseId\': 428898}, \'multiverseid\': 428898}, {\'name\': \'取消\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「给我道刻法涅的谜题试试。这个太简单了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59f835c2-ce4b-47e4-827e-b9eea511fab1\', \'multiverseId\': 429167}, \'multiverseid\': 429167}, {\'name\': \'取消\', \'text\': \'反擊目標咒語。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「給我道刻法涅的謎題試試。這個太簡單了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e209382-07e9-42a6-af68-fed56e26f894\', \'multiverseId\': 429436}, \'multiverseid\': 429436}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abkehr vom Weltlichen\', \'text\': \'Schicke ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Was sind schon Gold und Schmuck? Bedeutungslose Annehmlichkeiten. Wahren Reichtum findet man erst im Jenseits."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426984&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9416a8dc-2051-4abd-baaa-f183659f7702\', \'multiverseId\': 426984}, \'multiverseid\': 426984}, {\'name\': \'Renunciar a lo terrenal\', \'text\': \'Exilia el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Por qué aferrarse a estos ornamentos? No son más que herramientas y artificios. La auténtica riqueza solo se puede obtener en el más allá".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8158d56-a281-4d81-bf54-45075e359122\', \'multiverseId\': 427253}, \'multiverseid\': 427253}, {\'name\': \'Renoncement au monde\', \'text\': "Exilez l\'artefact ciblé ou l\'enchantement ciblé.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Pourquoi se cramponner à tous ces attributs ? Ce ne sont que des instruments et des artifices. La véritable richesse ne peut être acquise que dans l\'au-delà. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427522&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84daef74-b169-45bf-adbb-815e56b946f0\', \'multiverseId\': 427522}, \'multiverseid\': 427522}, {\'name\': \'Ripudiare il Profano\', \'text\': \'Esilia un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Perché aggrapparsi a questi ornamenti? Non sono che strumenti di ostentazione. Otterremo la vera ricchezza solo nell\\\'aldilà."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f30a9ba9-bf3f-4724-bdc9-2e71a6b631b2\', \'multiverseId\': 427791}, \'multiverseid\': 427791}, {\'name\': \'俗物の放棄\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「なぜ装飾品などにこだわるのか。単なる道具や見せかけに過ぎないものに。真の財産は来世でのみ得られるのだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39dead82-6ca3-4807-ae1a-28bec13279f2\', \'multiverseId\': 428060}, \'multiverseid\': 428060}, {\'name\': \'속세 버리기\', \'text\': \'마법물체 또는 부여마법을 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 추방한다.\\n순환 {2} ({2}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"왜 이런 장식물에 집착하지? 그저 도구나 장신구에 불과한데. 진정한 부는 사후 세계에서만 얻을 수 있어."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a866cc1-2c81-4485-a620-9fed9d34c401\', \'multiverseId\': 428329}, \'multiverseid\': 428329}, {\'name\': \'Abandonar o Mundano\', \'text\': \'Exile o artefato ou encantamento alvo.\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, Descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Por que se apegar a esses ornamentos? Eles não passam de instrumentos e presunção. A verdadeira riqueza só pode ser possuída na vida após a morte."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b00ee7fe-d98f-4f0e-a803-205fd71a3979\', \'multiverseId\': 428598}, \'multiverseid\': 428598}, {\'name\': \'Отринуть Мирское\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевой артефакт или чары.\\nЦикл {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«К чему цепляться за мишуру? Все это — лишь инструменты для дела или пустое украшательство. Истинное богатство можно обрести только в загробной жизни».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb389b5b-869f-4b39-aefa-b23c80b358bd\', \'multiverseId\': 428867}, \'multiverseid\': 428867}, {\'name\': \'献逐凡物\', \'text\': \'放逐目标神器或结界。\\n循环{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「何必留恋于这些身份象征？它们不过是器具和虚饰。只有在来世才能获得真正的财富。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1420e2b-bf2d-4ed5-850f-ff2a3c8f017e\', \'multiverseId\': 429136}, \'multiverseid\': 429136}, {\'name\': \'獻逐凡物\', \'text\': \'放逐目標神器或結界。\\n循環{2}（{2}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「何必留戀於這些身份象徵？它們不過是器具和虛飾。只有在來世才能獲得真正的財富。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94fec33d-fece-4ac8-99ce-f96bcf5e57a1\', \'multiverseId\': 429405}, \'multiverseid\': 429405}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abtrünniger Diener\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein anderer Zombie unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Falls einer der Gesalbten nicht absolute Gehorsamkeit zeigt, ist die Wüste stets dazu bereit, ihn aufzunehmen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427179&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1e3bbb6-f93c-4b7c-a002-7c30f2625fb3\', \'multiverseId\': 427179}, \'multiverseid\': 427179}, {\'name\': \'Sirviente indisciplinado\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otro Zombie entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, cada oponente pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Si un ungido no logra servir con intachable obediencia, el desierto siempre está listo para recibirlo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'471e18e4-580f-4b6c-96cf-e88689f9ed65\', \'multiverseId\': 427448}, \'multiverseid\': 427448}, {\'name\': \'Servant rétif\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un autre zombie arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "Si l\'un des consacrés faillit à son devoir d\'obéissance aveugle, le désert est toujours prêt à l\'accueillir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427717&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37640cea-9441-47e2-bdff-9e8eee67926b\', \'multiverseId\': 427717}, \'multiverseid\': 427717}, {\'name\': \'Servo Disobbediente\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un altro Zombie entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Se uno dei consacrati si rifiuta di prestare obbedienza assoluta, il deserto è sempre pronto ad accoglierlo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'502627a0-04ea-45c5-ad84-9843ed4221ac\', \'multiverseId\': 427986}, \'multiverseid\': 427986}, {\'name\': \'むら気な召使い\', \'text\': \'他のゾンビが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'選定された者が完璧に従順に仕えられなかったなら、いつでも砂漠が待っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f081eae2-a131-4636-86c0-e8c7a5d9aa08\', \'multiverseId\': 428255}, \'multiverseid\': 428255}, {\'name\': \'방종한 하수인\', \'text\': \'다른 좀비가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 각 상대는 생명 1점을 잃고 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비\', \'flavor\': \'세례받은 자가 완전히 복종하지 않는다면 사막은 언제나 그런 자를 거둘 준비가 되어 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca8b388a-d062-43b5-83cc-50f7d72600e8\', \'multiverseId\': 428524}, \'multiverseid\': 428524}, {\'name\': \'Servo Desobediente\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que outro Zumbi entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'O deserto está sempre pronto para receber os ungidos que não servem com obediência absoluta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a5ec756-7ddb-4ff2-b3db-8e51fa6b6178\', \'multiverseId\': 428793}, \'multiverseid\': 428793}, {\'name\': \'Заблудший Слуга\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда другой Зомби выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, каждый оппонент теряет 1 жизнь, а вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': \'Если кто-то из умащенных отказывается служить и беспрекословно подчиняться приказам, его всегда готова принять пустыня.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8e5ee2a-7b5f-4b86-a1a7-8b6612fb55ea\', \'multiverseId\': 429062}, \'multiverseid\': 429062}, {\'name\': \'刚愎仆从\', \'text\': \'每当另一个灵俑在你的操控下进战场时，每位对手各失去1点生命且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'若圣洗者未能尽心侍奉，则沙漠便会是他们的最终归宿。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b54439f2-2b24-4893-a4e2-19a195da4393\', \'multiverseId\': 429331}, \'multiverseid\': 429331}, {\'name\': \'剛愎僕從\', \'text\': \'每當另一個殭屍在你的操控下進戰場時，每位對手各失去1點生命且你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍\', \'flavor\': \'若聖洗者未能盡心侍奉，則沙漠便會是他們的最終歸宿。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f3353f0-4449-47a0-be0b-0301c6e2563f\', \'multiverseId\': 429600}, \'multiverseid\': 429600}]', '[{\'name\': \'Als würdig erachten\', \'text\': \'Als würdig erachten fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 7 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nUmwandlung {3}{R} ({3}{R}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du Als würdig erachten umwandelst, kannst du es einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zufügen lassen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427098&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02502c2b-1ef6-4739-b02b-e4636dac9075\', \'multiverseId\': 427098}, \'multiverseid\': 427098}, {\'name\': \'Estimar como digno\', \'text\': \'Estimar como digno hace 7 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\nCiclo {3}{R}. ({3}{R}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando actives la habilidad de ciclo de Estimar como digno, puedes elegir que haga 2 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b80187e9-e86d-4795-9dbc-9d69c3142d07\', \'multiverseId\': 427367}, \'multiverseid\': 427367}, {\'name\': \'Jugé valeureux\', \'text\': "Jugé valeureux inflige 7 blessures à une créature ciblée.\\nRecyclage {3}{R} ({3}{R}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez Jugé valeureux, vous pouvez faire qu\'il inflige 2 blessures à une créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427636&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08e8bec5-446d-4012-83e6-06cd56c1bdfc\', \'multiverseId\': 427636}, \'multiverseid\': 427636}, {\'name\': \'Ammettere tra i Prescelti\', \'text\': \'Ammettere tra i Prescelti infligge 7 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\\nCiclo {3}{R} ({3}{R}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\\nQuando cicli Ammettere tra i Prescelti, puoi fargli infliggere 2 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cca4225-fab2-4c58-bb82-bf7ace878866\', \'multiverseId\': 427905}, \'multiverseid\': 427905}, {\'name\': \'蓋世の誉れ\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。蓋世の誉れはそれに７点のダメージを与える。\\nサイクリング{3}{R}（{3}{R}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\\nあなたが蓋世の誉れをサイクリングしたとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたは「蓋世の誉れはそれに２点のダメージを与える。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71ea11a8-4918-4670-aba2-7ab14c4c3566\', \'multiverseId\': 428174}, \'multiverseid\': 428174}, {\'name\': \'가치 인정\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 가치 인정은 그 생물에 피해 7점을 입힌다.\\n순환 {3}{R} ({3}{R}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)\\n가치 인정을 순환할 때, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 가치 인정이 그 생물에 피해 2점을 입히게 할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0664f56-9f36-4f54-a567-e7d62217c8bb\', \'multiverseId\': 428443}, \'multiverseid\': 428443}, {\'name\': \'Julgar Digno\', \'text\': \'Julgar Digno causa 7 pontos de dano à criatura alvo.\\nReciclar {3}{R} ({3}{R}, Descarte este card: Compre um card.)\\nQuando recicla Julgar Digno, você pode fazer com que ele cause 2 pontos de dano à criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2bff8d8-f105-4421-9d2a-a97ba1530931\', \'multiverseId\': 428712}, \'multiverseid\': 428712}, {\'name\': \'Признать Достойным\', \'text\': \'Признать Достойным наносит 7 повреждений целевому существу.\\nЦикл {3}{R} ({3}{R}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\\nКогда вы совершаете цикл Признать Достойным, вы можете заставить эту карту нанести 2 повреждения целевому существу.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e25552c4-6d49-463f-b675-15787ab313b6\', \'multiverseId\': 428981}, \'multiverseid\': 428981}, {\'name\': \'豪英裁定\', \'text\': \'豪英裁定对目标生物造成7点伤害。\\n循环{3}{R}（{3}{R}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\\n当你循环豪英裁定时，你可以让它对目标生物造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c76e5c62-2986-4281-a1c3-473172c39d66\', \'multiverseId\': 429250}, \'multiverseid\': 429250}, {\'name\': \'豪英裁定\', \'text\': \'豪英裁定對目標生物造成7點傷害。\\n循環{3}{R}（{3}{R}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）\\n當你循環豪英裁定時，你可以讓它對目標生物造成2點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f35bca62-7952-4ff2-8ca5-8fb500705b82\', \'multiverseId\': 429519}, \'multiverseid\': 429519}]', "[{'name': 'Anfang // Ende', 'text': 'Erzeuge zwei 1/1 weiße Krieger-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Wachsamkeit.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Anfang', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427186&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51935f9e-b8b3-468a-ade2-90ec6d256fea', 'multiverseId': 427186}, 'multiverseid': 427186}, {'name': 'Inicio // Fin', 'text': 'Crea dos fichas de criatura Guerrero blancas 1/1 con la habilidad de vigilancia.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Inicio', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427455&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '67179531-0c84-4d5e-a0f5-f868a71a9f8e', 'multiverseId': 427455}, 'multiverseid': 427455}, {'name': 'Début // Fin', 'text': 'Créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Guerrier avec la vigilance.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Début', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427724&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2cea3b77-f965-477e-b9fe-76097a2c3aaa', 'multiverseId': 427724}, 'multiverseid': 427724}, {'name': 'Inizio // Fine', 'text': 'Crea due pedine creatura Guerriero 1/1 bianche con cautela.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Inizio', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427993&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e4d83cd-9664-4da5-8909-2bec378ca785', 'multiverseId': 427993}, 'multiverseid': 427993}, {'name': '徹頭 // 徹尾', 'text': '警戒を持つ白の１/１の戦士・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '徹頭', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428262&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a5ce2f6f-eb18-41d8-93c7-23112c0386d1', 'multiverseId': 428262}, 'multiverseid': 428262}, {'name': '시작 // 끝', 'text': '경계를 가진 1/1 백색 전사 생물 토큰 두 개를 만든다.', 'type': '순간마법', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '시작', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428531&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b94e676-4867-4e70-bed2-7e5cff0646ed', 'multiverseId': 428531}, 'multiverseid': 428531}, {'name': 'Começar // Terminar', 'text': 'Crie duas fichas de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Guerreiro com vigilância.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Começar', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428800&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56587621-d0c8-41b0-a997-93e005c8c659', 'multiverseId': 428800}, 'multiverseid': 428800}, {'name': 'Начало // Конец', 'text': 'Создайте две фишки существа 1/1 белый Воин с Бдительностью.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Начало', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429069&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '04cbc7f8-87c7-4ae2-b74d-c8cc51d60010', 'multiverseId': 429069}, 'multiverseid': 429069}, {'name': '始生 // 终命', 'text': '派出两个1/1白色，具警戒异能的战士衍生生物。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '始生', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429338&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '93758c0a-276c-4a3a-acf1-5fa5e7af217f', 'multiverseId': 429338}, 'multiverseid': 429338}, {'name': '始生 // 終命', 'text': '派出兩個1/1白色，具警戒異能的戰士衍生生物。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '始生', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429607&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b828d8a1-8c34-4c69-b28f-22fb9e3e2eff', 'multiverseId': 429607}, 'multiverseid': 429607}]", "[{'name': 'Angler-Sceada', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nWenn der Angler-Sceada ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Kreatur deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurückbringen.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Sceada', 'flavor': 'Gleich nachdem sie schlüpfen, wird ihnen beigebracht, nur die größten Beutetiere aus dem Luxa zu fischen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427012&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '845b82d3-6618-40ae-be6c-1c1bd447cefb', 'multiverseId': 427012}, 'multiverseid': 427012}, {'name': 'Draco pescador', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nCuando el Draco pescador entre al campo de batalla, puedes regresar la criatura objetivo a la mano de su propietario.', 'type': 'Criatura — Draco', 'flavor': 'Desde que son simplemente unas crías, a los dracos de río se les enseña a sacar la presa más grande del Luxa.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427281&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '242d05a6-7e93-447b-8906-73408c92f2da', 'multiverseId': 427281}, 'multiverseid': 427281}, {'name': 'Drakôn pêcheur', 'text': 'Vol\\nQuand le Drakôn pêcheur arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez renvoyer une créature ciblée dans la main de son propriétaire.', 'type': 'Créature : drakôn', 'flavor': 'Les drakôns de rivière apprennent dès leur plus jeune âge à pêcher les plus grosses proies du Luxa.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427550&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '588c6d01-f0ae-4de7-92de-eb51ac41e441', 'multiverseId': 427550}, 'multiverseid': 427550}, {'name': 'Draghetto Pescatore', 'text': 'Volare\\nQuando il Draghetto Pescatore entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi far tornare una creatura bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario.', 'type': 'Creatura — Draghetto', 'flavor': 'Fin dai primi mesi di vita, ai draghetti di fiume viene insegnato a catturare prede enormi nel Luxa.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427819&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd07e80c-5e17-454b-888c-571d4fc87247', 'multiverseId': 427819}, 'multiverseid': 427819}, {'name': '釣りドレイク', 'text': '飛行\\n釣りドレイクが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれをオーナーの手札に戻してもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドレイク', 'flavor': '雛の時分から、川ドレイクはルクサ川最大の獲物を釣り上げる方法を教わる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428088&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c0ea8c17-4d4f-4584-b50d-967c4872f7fa', 'multiverseId': 428088}, 'multiverseid': 428088}, {'name': '낚시꾼 드레이크', 'text': '비행\\n낚시꾼 드레이크가 전장에 들어올 때, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 생물을 소유자의 손으로 되돌릴 수 있다.', 'type': '생물 — 드레이크', 'flavor': '강 드레이크는 새끼 때부터 럭사의 가장 큰 먹잇감을 사냥하는 법을 배운다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428357&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de53fcc7-1220-47a4-96f9-b23759c4c7cf', 'multiverseId': 428357}, 'multiverseid': 428357}, {'name': 'Dragonete Pescador', 'text': 'Voar\\nQuando Dragonete Pescador entra no campo de batalha, você pode devolver a criatura alvo para a mão de seu dono.', 'type': 'Criatura — Dragonete', 'flavor': 'Desde que são apenas filhotes, os dragonetes do rio são ensinados a pescar as maiores presas do Luxa.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428626&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '21dc7ad3-9e61-45b7-bee8-f6380571381b', 'multiverseId': 428626}, 'multiverseid': 428626}, {'name': 'Дрейк-Рыболов', 'text': 'Полет\\nКогда Дрейк-Рыболов выходит на поле битвы, вы можете вернуть целевое существо в руку его владельца.', 'type': 'Существо — Дрейк', 'flavor': 'Еще детенышами речных дрейков учат добывать из Луксы добычу покрупнее.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428895&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '478acf32-d93f-46cb-a5b8-73c98ea07723', 'multiverseId': 428895}, 'multiverseid': 428895}, {'name': '渔猎龙兽', 'text': '飞行\\n当渔猎龙兽进战场时，你可以将目标生物移回其拥有者手上。', 'type': '生物～龙兽', 'flavor': '河龙兽从出生的那一刻起，便学着从罗夏河捕捞最肥的猎物。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429164&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92afe2de-82c4-488d-9621-119a5c30a229', 'multiverseId': 429164}, 'multiverseid': 429164}, {'name': '漁獵龍獸', 'text': '飛行\\n當漁獵龍獸進戰場時，你可以將目標生物移回其擁有者手上。', 'type': '生物～龍獸', 'flavor': '河龍獸從出生的那一刻起，便學著從羅夏河捕撈最肥的獵物。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429433&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7b3773c5-3e19-4f0c-a916-9af025be57c0', 'multiverseId': 429433}, 'multiverseid': 429433}]", '[{\'name\': \'Anmutige Katze\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Anmutige Katze angreift, erhält sie +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze\', \'flavor\': \'Katzen, wenngleich als Symbole der Göttin Oketra verehrt, teilen nur selten ihren Sinn für Solidarität.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429719&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7207b20b-f5cc-4d06-9c8a-eb16bf7a6b65\', \'multiverseId\': 429719}, \'multiverseid\': 429719}, {\'name\': \'Felino distinguido\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Felino distinguido ataque, obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Aunque se les respeta profundamente como símbolos de la diosa Oketra, los gatos a menudo carecen del sentido de solidaridad de esta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c439f51f-fb0f-473c-a4ed-75d62e88072d\', \'multiverseId\': 429845}, \'multiverseid\': 429845}, {\'name\': \'Chat gracieux\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Chat gracieux attaque, il gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat\', \'flavor\': \'Bien que les chats inspirent un profond respect en tant que symboles de la déesse Oketra, ils partagent rarement son sens de la solidarité.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429737&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'653ec91b-7ac8-4bd6-9f16-3aff69e4426c\', \'multiverseId\': 429737}, \'multiverseid\': 429737}, {\'name\': \'Gatto Aggraziato\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Gatto Aggraziato attacca, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Nonostante siano venerati come simboli di Oketra, i gatti spesso mancano del senso di fratellanza della dea.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d02bbfc-6b8b-44e0-9969-94b29eac7605\', \'multiverseId\': 429755}, \'multiverseid\': 429755}, {\'name\': \'優雅な猫\', \'text\': \'優雅な猫が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、これは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫\', \'flavor\': \'オケチラ神の象徴として尊敬されている割には、大抵の猫には結束の精神が欠けている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2dab858-7055-479c-881d-9ffcaed2df4b\', \'multiverseId\': 429773}, \'multiverseid\': 429773}, {\'name\': \'우아한 고양이\', \'text\': \'우아한 고양이가 공격할 때마다, 우아한 고양이는 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이\', \'flavor\': \'고양이들은 오케트라 여신의 상징으로 높이 여겨지지만 그들의 결속력은 결여된 경우가 많다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4fa0692-3729-4766-8b15-98b7307076ab\', \'multiverseId\': 429791}, \'multiverseid\': 429791}, {\'name\': \'Gato Gracioso\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Gato Gracioso ataca, ele recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Embora sejam tidos em alta conta como símbolos da deusa Oketra, os gatos muitas vezes carecem de seu senso de solidariedade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52bc56f5-d0fa-40db-8078-b3ea68f1f8e4\', \'multiverseId\': 429809}, \'multiverseid\': 429809}, {\'name\': \'Грациозная Кошка\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Грациозная Кошка атакует, она получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка\', \'flavor\': \'Кошек почитают как живой символ Окетры, но у них редко можно встретить присущее этой богине чувство сплоченности.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26d8f4a2-661e-440d-b614-08019c089e73\', \'multiverseId\': 429827}, \'multiverseid\': 429827}, {\'name\': \'雅猫\', \'text\': \'每当雅猫攻击时，它得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～猫\', \'flavor\': \'猫虽被尊为神明欧柯塔的化身，对于团结一心倒不是特别在意。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6de45cfb-04b9-4cef-8719-9ada8513d34b\', \'multiverseId\': 429683}, \'multiverseid\': 429683}, {\'name\': \'雅貓\', \'text\': \'每當雅貓攻擊時，它得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～貓\', \'flavor\': \'貓雖被尊為神明歐柯塔的化身，對於團結一心倒不是特別在意。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fb24337-5c0a-43e0-9e69-efa9e80f0562\', \'multiverseId\': 429701}, \'multiverseid\': 429701}]', "[{'name': 'Anspruch erheben', 'text': 'Verzaubert eine bleibende Karte\\nDu kontrollierst die verzauberte bleibende Karte.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': 'Die Geweihten konzentrieren sich voll und ganz auf die Prüfungen. Alles andere liegt in der Hand der Götter.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427032&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd5a53c5-b582-417e-80b4-3d08de561216', 'multiverseId': 427032}, 'multiverseid': 427032}, {'name': 'Reclamar', 'text': 'Encantar permanente.\\nTú controlas el permanente encantado.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': 'Los iniciados solo deben preocuparse de sus pruebas. Todo lo demás está en manos de los dioses.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427301&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4301b96f-bb2d-4b5a-9e43-dc74a0d021ee', 'multiverseId': 427301}, 'multiverseid': 427301}, {'name': 'Revendiquer', 'text': 'Enchanter : permanent\\nVous contrôlez le permanent enchanté.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': 'Les adeptes ne doivent se préoccuper que des épreuves. Tout le reste est entre les mains des dieux.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427570&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8ea2793b-f8a1-4bbd-a210-d7737ee81590', 'multiverseId': 427570}, 'multiverseid': 427570}, {'name': 'Avanzare Pretese', 'text': 'Incanta permanente\\nControlli il permanente incantato.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': 'Gli iniziati devono concentrarsi solo sulle ordalie. Tutto il resto è nelle mani delle divinità.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427839&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a60155f7-267b-4148-9b90-0674b72a1fa8', 'multiverseId': 427839}, 'multiverseid': 427839}, {'name': '主張', 'text': 'エンチャント（パーマネント）\\nあなたはエンチャントされているパーマネントをコントロールする。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': '修練者は試練のみを気にすればよい。それ以外はすべて神々の手にある。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428108&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4af8acab-b078-4b72-8a6d-1b969b4a1c70', 'multiverseId': 428108}, 'multiverseid': 428108}, {'name': '소유권 주장', 'text': '지속물에 부여\\n당신이 부여된 지속물을 조종한다.\\n순환 {2} ({2}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)', 'type': '부여마법 — 마법진', 'flavor': '입회자는 시험에만 집중해야 한다. 나머지는 신들이 처리한다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428377&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cd0e5377-5938-4786-afd2-d11d01696a0d', 'multiverseId': 428377}, 'multiverseid': 428377}, {'name': 'Clamar Posse', 'text': 'Encantar permanente\\nVocê controla a permanente encantada.\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, Descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura', 'flavor': 'Os iniciados só precisam se preocupar com as provas. Tudo mais está nas mãos dos deuses.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428646&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2a6e91c-eb4c-4f70-af25-4bf731205825', 'multiverseId': 428646}, 'multiverseid': 428646}, {'name': 'Заявка на Владение', 'text': 'Зачаровать перманент\\nВы контролируете зачарованный перманент.\\nЦикл {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)', 'type': 'Чары — Аура', 'flavor': 'Послушникам нужно беспокоиться только об испытаниях. Все остальное — в руках богов.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428915&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b854a2db-e691-4b91-a668-1220ea0423dd', 'multiverseId': 428915}, 'multiverseid': 428915}, {'name': '宣示主权', 'text': '结附于永久物\\n你操控所结附的永久物。\\n循环{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': '祀徒只需专注祀炼。其余尽在神明的掌握之中。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429184&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5a8d04d8-e352-4627-a5c3-7ea9567da63b', 'multiverseId': 429184}, 'multiverseid': 429184}, {'name': '宣示主權', 'text': '結附於永久物\\n你操控所結附的永久物。\\n循環{2}（{2}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）', 'type': '結界～靈氣', 'flavor': '祀徒只需專注祀煉。其餘盡在神明的掌握之中。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429453&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '65661c19-5f7a-4d5e-89e2-a7437acd5c26', 'multiverseId': 429453}, 'multiverseid': 429453}]", '[{\'name\': \'Armut // Reichtum\', \'text\': \'Alle Kreaturen erhalten -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Armut\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427193&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71401eae-8281-4390-8f98-3a87ff62cf07\', \'multiverseId\': 427193}, \'multiverseid\': 427193}, {\'name\': \'Miseria // Fortuna\', \'text\': \'Todas las criaturas obtienen -2/-2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Miseria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75ddecfe-3ca9-4a54-bb7a-3e7620a2dd40\', \'multiverseId\': 427462}, \'multiverseid\': 427462}, {\'name\': \'Misère // Luxe\', \'text\': "Toutes les créatures gagnent -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Misère\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427731&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dc85569-0b15-4d3a-8ef6-c27feb90593f\', \'multiverseId\': 427731}, \'multiverseid\': 427731}, {\'name\': \'Povero // Principe\', \'text\': \'Tutte le creature prendono -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Povero\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfa124d7-53dd-4c26-a3d8-4988008e1f16\', \'multiverseId\': 428000}, \'multiverseid\': 428000}, {\'name\': \'貧窮 // 裕福\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、クリーチャーはすべて－２/－２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'貧窮\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c810e679-59af-48dd-baee-6fc76cb1e476\', \'multiverseId\': 428269}, \'multiverseid\': 428269}, {\'name\': \'거지 // 부자\', \'text\': \'모든 생물은 턴종료까지 -2/-2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'거지\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fcbb846-2405-41a1-885f-ad9e4b11a74a\', \'multiverseId\': 428538}, \'multiverseid\': 428538}, {\'name\': \'Lixo // Luxo\', \'text\': \'Todas as criaturas recebem -2/-2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Lixo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75f3f623-5f95-4960-92d6-f4785cbe70c0\', \'multiverseId\': 428807}, \'multiverseid\': 428807}, {\'name\': \'Нищета // Богатство\', \'text\': \'Все существа получают -2/-2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Нищета\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5055583d-4386-4679-a3f6-fe6802089d5b\', \'multiverseId\': 429076}, \'multiverseid\': 429076}, {\'name\': \'累骨 // 起家\', \'text\': \'所有生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'累骨\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ca74052-10ac-4753-8d83-9005de64e4f5\', \'multiverseId\': 429345}, \'multiverseid\': 429345}, {\'name\': \'累骨 // 起家\', \'text\': \'所有生物得-2/-2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'累骨\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fe435b1-6326-4af3-a5dc-dce5b4d6b176\', \'multiverseId\': 429614}, \'multiverseid\': 429614}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufleuchten der Hieroglyphen\', \'text\': \'Ziehe zwei Karten.\\nUmwandlung {U} ({U}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Antworten sind da. Man muss nur die Augen öffnen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427028&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7129838b-e335-4579-b94b-29a5667f1667\', \'multiverseId\': 427028}, \'multiverseid\': 427028}, {\'name\': \'Iluminación jeroglífica\', \'text\': \'Roba dos cartas.\\nCiclo {U}. ({U}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Las respuestas están aquí. Esta es la forma de superar la prueba".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00da01ca-42e5-47c1-8d20-44504caa97eb\', \'multiverseId\': 427297}, \'multiverseid\': 427297}, {\'name\': \'Illumination hiéroglyphique\', \'text\': \'Piochez deux cartes.\\nRecyclage {U} ({U}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Toutes les réponses sont ici. Voici comment surmonter les épreuves. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427566&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'595638d4-5682-4bf3-9206-757a56ba9a40\', \'multiverseId\': 427566}, \'multiverseid\': 427566}, {\'name\': \'Rivelazione Geroglifica\', \'text\': \'Pesca due carte.\\nCiclo {U} ({U}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Le risposte si trovano qui. Questo è il cammino per superare l\\\'ordalia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'877f562b-3417-4a26-9d79-de5c258820ac\', \'multiverseId\': 427835}, \'multiverseid\': 427835}, {\'name\': \'ヒエログリフの輝き\', \'text\': \'カードを２枚引く。\\nサイクリング{U}（{U}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「答えがここにある。試練を抜ける道だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c1ba4e5-5612-4796-92dc-05706f24b4dc\', \'multiverseId\': 428104}, \'multiverseid\': 428104}, {\'name\': \'상형문자 발광\', \'text\': \'카드 두 장을 뽑는다.\\n순환 {U} ({U}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"답이 여기 있어. 시험을 통과하는 방법은 바로 이거였어."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9255dbad-b737-4fd9-affd-dc8cc97159e1\', \'multiverseId\': 428373}, \'multiverseid\': 428373}, {\'name\': \'Iluminação Hieroglífica\', \'text\': \'Compre dois cards.\\nReciclar {U} ({U}, Descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"As respostas estão aqui. Esse é o caminho para superar a prova."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06bf3608-9150-408c-84c5-99c690f2b112\', \'multiverseId\': 428642}, \'multiverseid\': 428642}, {\'name\': \'Светящиеся Иероглифы\', \'text\': \'Возьмите две карты.\\nЦикл {U} ({U}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Все ответы здесь. Вот он — путь через испытание».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92a6fd34-02ce-4ce3-8edb-3ed78478704e\', \'multiverseId\': 428911}, \'multiverseid\': 428911}, {\'name\': \'图符幽光\', \'text\': \'抓两张牌。\\n循环{U}（{U}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「这就是答案。这就是通过祀炼的方法。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11e33504-221d-4ada-907e-3a996c6806e0\', \'multiverseId\': 429180}, \'multiverseid\': 429180}, {\'name\': \'圖符幽光\', \'text\': \'抽兩張牌。\\n循環{U}（{U}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「這就是答案。這就是通過祀煉的方法。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c9864e6-3989-4a7d-a8fa-eeebaebaa90c\', \'multiverseId\': 429449}, \'multiverseid\': 429449}]', "[{'name': 'Aufopferungsvoller Saatgefährte', 'text': 'Du kannst den Aufopferungsvollen Saatgefährten erschöpfen, sowie er angreift. Wenn du dies tust, bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 2 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. (Eine erschöpfte Kreatur enttappt nicht während deines nächsten Enttappsegments.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426981&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c4a0abf-dfe8-48bb-8d48-41d6a2b2bf2e', 'multiverseId': 426981}, 'multiverseid': 426981}, {'name': 'Camarada de simiente entregado', 'text': 'Puedes espolear al Camarada de simiente entregado en cuanto ataque. Cuando lo hagas, regresa la carta de criatura objetivo con coste de maná convertido de 2 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. (Una criatura espoleada no se enderezará durante tu próximo paso de enderezar.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Guerrero humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427250&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0928f7bc-b5f1-4fdf-bae3-d02521e2defe', 'multiverseId': 427250}, 'multiverseid': 427250}, {'name': 'Compagnon de moisson dévoué', 'text': 'Vous pouvez surmener le Compagnon de moisson dévoué au moment où il attaque. Quand vous faites ainsi, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière une carte de créature ciblée avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 2. (Une créature surmenée ne se dégage pas pendant votre prochaine étape de dégagement.)', 'type': 'Créature : humain et guerrier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427519&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e4372ae8-528f-4dd5-adf2-e7bb5bece56d', 'multiverseId': 427519}, 'multiverseid': 427519}, {'name': 'Comessiano Devoto', 'text': 'Puoi stremare il Comessiano Devoto mentre attacca. Quando lo fai, rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 2 dal tuo cimitero. (Una creatura stremata non STAPpa durante il tuo prossimo STAP.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Guerriero Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427788&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07c37d3e-768c-44d6-b4aa-754447971ac7', 'multiverseId': 427788}, 'multiverseid': 427788}, {'name': '献身的な門友', 'text': '献身的な門友が攻撃するに際し、あなたはこれを督励してもよい。そうしたとき、あなたの墓地から点数で見たマナ・コストが２以下のクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。（督励されたクリーチャーは、あなたの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428057&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ced0a065-f71e-4d2f-80cf-d35431503823', 'multiverseId': 428057}, 'multiverseid': 428057}, {'name': '헌신적 입문자 동료', 'text': '당신은 헌신적 입문자 동료로 공격을 선언하면서 헌신적 입문자 동료를 분전시킬 수 있다. 그렇게 할 때, 당신의 무덤에 있는 전환마나비용이 2 이하인 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 전장으로 되돌린다. (분전한 생물은 당신의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.)', 'type': '생물 — 인간 전사', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428326&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9aa2a75-c439-435d-9324-06f5b5466223', 'multiverseId': 428326}, 'multiverseid': 428326}, {'name': 'Colega de Safra Devotado', 'text': 'Você pode exaurir Colega de Safra Devotado conforme ele ataca. Quando fizer isso, devolva o card de criatura alvo com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 2 de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. (Uma criatura exaurida não será desvirada durante sua próxima etapa de desvirar.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428595&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3acfa7df-6376-4d36-bb0f-6871f9f22af7', 'multiverseId': 428595}, 'multiverseid': 428595}, {'name': 'Преданный Брат по Снопу', 'text': 'Вы можете подстегнуть Преданного Брата по Снопу в момент его атаки. Когда вы это делаете, верните целевую карту существа с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более 2 из вашего кладбища на поле битвы. (Подстегнутое существо не разворачивается во время вашего следующего шага разворота.)', 'type': 'Существо — Человек Воин', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428864&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4bda9593-7570-416e-9b84-c32373f6d979', 'multiverseId': 428864}, 'multiverseid': 428864}, {'name': '虔诚群伴', 'text': '你可以于虔诚群伴攻击时耗竭之。当你如此作时，将目标总法术力费用等于或小于2的生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。（已耗竭的生物于你的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。）', 'type': '生物～人类／战士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429133&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1826da3-f495-48af-a9ce-eae9f691e0eb', 'multiverseId': 429133}, 'multiverseid': 429133}, {'name': '虔誠群伴', 'text': '你可以於虔誠群伴攻擊時耗竭之。當你如此作時，將目標總魔法力費用等於或小於2的生物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。（已耗竭的生物於你的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。）', 'type': '生物～人類／戰士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429402&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '28e9c0ec-308e-48b0-8e19-4c579a915494', 'multiverseId': 429402}, 'multiverseid': 429402}]", '[{\'name\': \'Auserkoren // Führen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +1/+0 und Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Auserkoren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427188&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ad1dca2-e6dd-43f4-8580-e25b3002e7ec\', \'multiverseId\': 427188}, \'multiverseid\': 427188}, {\'name\': \'Destinado // Liderar\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+0 y gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Destinado\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1cad5d7-373c-4c13-9621-c6e748feafee\', \'multiverseId\': 427457}, \'multiverseid\': 427457}, {\'name\': \'Destinée // Commander\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +1/+0 et acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Destinée\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427726&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'574889a7-b38f-46a8-ac52-c0f229a95b19\', \'multiverseId\': 427726}, \'multiverseid\': 427726}, {\'name\': \'Destinata // Comando\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +1/+0 e ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Destinata\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68364922-54a9-4a45-94fe-4df0ac79aa6b\', \'multiverseId\': 427995}, \'multiverseid\': 427995}, {\'name\': \'天導 // 先導\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋０の修整を受けるとともに破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'天導\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f50cf2b-62e9-4649-afb5-143f8caf746e\', \'multiverseId\': 428264}, \'multiverseid\': 428264}, {\'name\': \'숙명 // 지도\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받고 무적을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'숙명\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a4ab151-069e-4b25-8c6c-d15fab25b85e\', \'multiverseId\': 428533}, \'multiverseid\': 428533}, {\'name\': \'Destinado // Liderar\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +1/+0 e ganha indestrutível até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Destinado\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12b9285e-1d58-45c1-8f04-339a320082de\', \'multiverseId\': 428802}, \'multiverseid\': 428802}, {\'name\': \'Предназначение // Вести за Собой\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +1/+0 и Неразрушимость до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Предназначение\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3661e2e-0ef5-4324-9241-9d1b37e73a49\', \'multiverseId\': 429071}, \'multiverseid\': 429071}, {\'name\': \'恩眷 // 引领\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标生物得+1/+0且获得不灭异能。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'恩眷\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08541880-c964-4caf-9f8b-2aa99e756971\', \'multiverseId\': 429340}, \'multiverseid\': 429340}, {\'name\': \'恩眷 // 引領\', \'text\': \'直到回合結束，目標生物得+1/+0且獲得不滅異能。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'恩眷\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab094042-204b-4815-8907-ed9550f545a5\', \'multiverseId\': 429609}, \'multiverseid\': 429609}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avior-Gedankenzensor\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\nFalls ein Gegner eine Bibliothek durchsuchen würde, durchsucht der Spieler stattdessen die obersten vier Karten jener Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Die einzige Frage, die du dir stellen solltest, ist: Wie diene ich am besten dem Gott-Pharao?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426976&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'830a49dc-001b-44c0-8d87-0c1844c6a996\', \'multiverseId\': 426976}, \'multiverseid\': 426976}, {\'name\': \'Censurador aven\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nVuela.\\nSi un oponente fuera a buscar en una biblioteca, en vez de eso, ese jugador busca en las cuatro primeras cartas de esa biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero ave\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo único que debemos preguntarnos es cómo podemos cumplir mejor la voluntad del Dios Faraón".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'200dded3-2a37-4459-a210-15b8cf968849\', \'multiverseId\': 427245}, \'multiverseid\': 427245}, {\'name\': \'Cérébrocenseur avemain\', \'text\': \'Flash\\nVol\\nSi un adversaire devait chercher dans une bibliothèque, ce joueur cherche dans les quatre cartes du dessus de cette bibliothèque à la place.\', \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« La seule question à se poser est de savoir comment accomplir au mieux la volonté du Dieu-Pharaon. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427514&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48933562-782d-4c95-9c0b-5b73149203df\', \'multiverseId\': 427514}, \'multiverseid\': 427514}, {\'name\': \'Censore Mentale Aviano\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nVolare\\nSe un avversario sta per passare in rassegna un grimorio, quel giocatore passa invece in rassegna le prime quattro carte di quel grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'unica domanda da porre è come compiere al meglio la volontà del Dio Faraone."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41037583-d328-4680-8280-d36c8cd2d423\', \'multiverseId\': 427783}, \'multiverseid\': 427783}, {\'name\': \'エイヴンの思考検閲者\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n飛行\\n対戦相手がライブラリーからカードを探すなら、代わりにそのプレイヤーはそのライブラリーの一番上から４枚のカードの中から探す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「我らが問うべき唯一のこと、それは王神の意志にお応えするための最上の方法である。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'825fbfc4-36bf-4a9a-9b15-c4be3c8c58ce\', \'multiverseId\': 428052}, \'multiverseid\': 428052}, {\'name\': \'에이븐 정신검열관\', \'text\': \'섬광\\n비행\\n상대가 서고에서 카드를 찾는 경우, 대신 그 상대는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 네 장에서만 찾는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"우리는 신 파라오의 의지를 가장 잘 이행하는 방법에 대해서만 생각해야 한다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35e571aa-8067-46a8-9a35-36767c3f3976\', \'multiverseId\': 428321}, \'multiverseid\': 428321}, {\'name\': \'Mnemocensor Aviano\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nVoar\\nSe um oponente deveria procurar em um grimório, em vez disso ele deverá procurar nos quatro primeiros cards daquele grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"A única pergunta que precisamos fazer é como melhor executar a vontade do Faraó-Deus."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b59e6935-3038-4592-ab34-09f07edea063\', \'multiverseId\': 428590}, \'multiverseid\': 428590}, {\'name\': \'Воздушный Блюститель Мыслей\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nПолет\\nЕсли оппонент должен искать в библиотеке, тот игрок ищет в четырех верхних картах той библиотеки вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы должны задаваться лишь одним вопросом: как наилучшим образом исполнить волю Бога-Фараона».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73ee676b-2eba-4b0e-885b-86a9a6d12d6d\', \'multiverseId\': 428859}, \'multiverseid\': 428859}, {\'name\': \'艾文核灵师\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n飞行\\n如果某对手将搜寻某牌库，则改为他搜寻该牌库顶的四张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～鸟／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「我们唯一要问的问题，便是如何彻底执行法老神的旨意。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f66b9f7-1129-4232-9f6f-927b0d161dee\', \'multiverseId\': 429128}, \'multiverseid\': 429128}, {\'name\': \'艾文核靈師\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n飛行\\n如果某對手將搜尋某牌庫，則改為他搜尋該牌庫頂的四張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～鳥／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「我們唯一要問的問題，便是如何徹底執行法老神的旨意。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04d8d2b1-4d20-442b-852e-dc3dce4d96f7\', \'multiverseId\': 429397}, \'multiverseid\': 429397}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avior-Geweihter\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nEinbalsamieren {6}{U} ({6}{U}, schicke diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie von ihr ist, außer dass er ein weißer Zombie-Vogel-Krieger ohne Manakosten ist. Spiele Einbalsamieren wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427014&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbabebf0-2ac9-4ac1-ab42-305547f05820\', \'multiverseId\': 427014}, \'multiverseid\': 427014}, {\'name\': \'Iniciado aven\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nEmbalsamar {6}{U}. ({6}{U}, exiliar esta carta de tu cementerio: Crea una ficha que es una copia de esta carta, excepto que es un Guerrero Ave Zombie blanco sin coste de maná. Activa la habilidad de embalsamar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'893f8f4f-2fd2-42d3-84e3-ef0e6abbda14\', \'multiverseId\': 427283}, \'multiverseid\': 427283}, {\'name\': \'Adepte avemain\', \'text\': "Vol\\nEmbaumement {6}{U} ({6}{U}, exilez cette carte de votre cimetière : Créez un jeton qui en est une copie, excepté que c\'est un zombie et oiseau et guerrier blanc sans coût de mana. N\'utilisez l\'embaumement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427552&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'508aa77c-b2ce-4bee-902e-be271fe4ab2f\', \'multiverseId\': 427552}, \'multiverseid\': 427552}, {\'name\': \'Iniziato Aviano\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nImbalsamare {6}{U} ({6}{U}, Esilia questa carta dal tuo cimitero: Crea una pedina che è una copia della carta, tranne che è un Guerriero Uccello Zombie bianco senza costo di mana. Imbalsama solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5e8e076-9c6f-4825-8e43-0523b20063b1\', \'multiverseId\': 427821}, \'multiverseid\': 427821}, {\'name\': \'エイヴンの修練者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n不朽{6}{U}（{6}{U}, あなたの墓地からこのカードを追放する：マナ・コストを持たない白のゾンビ・鳥・戦士であることを除きこれのコピーであるトークンを１体生成する。不朽はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9292cb6a-177b-4541-8e1c-4c1062debf95\', \'multiverseId\': 428090}, \'multiverseid\': 428090}, {\'name\': \'에이븐 입회자\', \'text\': \'비행\\n방부처리 {6}{U} ({6}{U}, 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 추방한다: 이 카드의 복사본인 토큰 한 개를 만든다. 단, 그 토큰은 마나 비용이 없는 백색 좀비 조류 전사다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 방부처리를 할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류 전사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68b50701-14c5-4d21-a5fd-b1c94fe7b366\', \'multiverseId\': 428359}, \'multiverseid\': 428359}, {\'name\': \'Iniciado Aviano\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nEmbalsamar {6}{U} ({6}{U}, Exile este card de seu cemitério: Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia dele, com a exceção de ser um Zumbi Ave Guerreiro branco sem custo de mana. Embalsame somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9837f299-c8f5-4c0a-a972-4f60b6bdd831\', \'multiverseId\': 428628}, \'multiverseid\': 428628}, {\'name\': \'Авен-Послушник\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nБальзамирование {6}{U} ({6}{U}, изгоните эту карту из вашего кладбища: создайте фишку, являющуюся ее копией, но при этом являющуюся белым Зомби Птицей Воином без мана-стоимости. Бальзамируйте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица Воин\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dfc2364-9aa7-4d82-ae4c-a37ee1b36e32\', \'multiverseId\': 428897}, \'multiverseid\': 428897}, {\'name\': \'艾文祀徒\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n遗存{6}{U}（{6}{U}，从你的坟墓场放逐此牌：派出一个衍生物，且为此牌的复制品，但它是白色灵俑／鸟／战士，且没有法术力费用。遗存的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'生物～鸟／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a36ac50a-7267-42a8-bece-2b87645fd584\', \'multiverseId\': 429166}, \'multiverseid\': 429166}, {\'name\': \'艾文祀徒\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n遺存{6}{U}（{6}{U}，從你的墳墓場放逐此牌：派出一個衍生物，且為此牌的複製品，但它是白色殭屍／鳥／戰士，且沒有魔法力費用。遺存的時機視同巫術。）\', \'type\': \'生物～鳥／戰士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5648c469-616a-4d2e-9f90-2dbae23753d6\', \'multiverseId\': 429435}, \'multiverseid\': 429435}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avior-Windführer\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit\\nKreaturenspielsteine, die du kontrollierst, haben Flugfähigkeit und Wachsamkeit.\\nEinbalsamieren {4}{W}{U} ({4}{W}{U}, schicke diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie von ihr ist, außer dass er ein weißer Zombie-Vogel-Krieger ohne Manakosten ist. Spiele Einbalsamieren wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427166&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2f13947-7c65-4803-98c6-d0ce53dbbef8\', \'multiverseId\': 427166}, \'multiverseid\': 427166}, {\'name\': \'Guía del viento aven\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia.\\nLas fichas de criatura que controlas tienen las habilidades de volar y vigilancia.\\nEmbalsamar {4}{W}{U}. ({4}{W}{U}, exiliar esta carta de tu cementerio: Crea una ficha que es una copia de esta carta, excepto que es un Guerrero Ave Zombie blanco sin coste de maná. Activa la habilidad de embalsamar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4cd47bd-eece-4173-890b-0e9069903139\', \'multiverseId\': 427435}, \'multiverseid\': 427435}, {\'name\': \'Guidevent avemain\', \'text\': "Vol, vigilance\\nLes jetons de créature que vous contrôlez ont le vol et la vigilance.\\nEmbaumement {4}{W}{U} ({4}{W}{U}, exilez cette carte de votre cimetière : Créez un jeton qui en est une copie, excepté que c\'est un zombie et oiseau et guerrier blanc sans coût de mana. N\'utilisez l\'embaumement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427704&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b0493c4-532b-49ff-b929-74b1f858f49e\', \'multiverseId\': 427704}, \'multiverseid\': 427704}, {\'name\': \'Guida dei Venti Aviana\', \'text\': \'Volare, cautela\\nLe pedine creatura che controlli hanno volare e cautela.\\nImbalsamare {4}{W}{U} ({4}{W}{U}, Esilia questa carta dal tuo cimitero: Crea una pedina che è una copia della carta, tranne che è un Guerriero Uccello Zombie bianco senza costo di mana. Imbalsama solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dd9309a-4f35-4e61-9e26-6a9fa16e80d6\', \'multiverseId\': 427973}, \'multiverseid\': 427973}, {\'name\': \'風案内のエイヴン\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒\\nあなたがコントロールするクリーチャー・トークンは飛行と警戒を持つ。\\n不朽{4}{W}{U}（{4}{W}{U}, あなたの墓地からこのカードを追放する：マナ・コストを持たない白のゾンビ・鳥・戦士であることを除きこれのコピーであるトークンを１体生成する。不朽はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1aab9e76-7284-4e23-8f95-ea9fc2ae24a0\', \'multiverseId\': 428242}, \'multiverseid\': 428242}, {\'name\': \'에이븐 바람 안내자\', \'text\': \'비행, 경계\\n당신이 조종하는 생물 토큰은 비행과 경계를 가진다.\\n방부처리 {4}{W}{U} ({4}{W}{U}, 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 추방한다: 이 카드의 복사본인 토큰 한 개를 만든다. 단, 그 토큰은 마나 비용이 없는 백색 좀비 조류 전사다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 방부처리를 할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류 전사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87650183-1eb0-4438-b7b3-288b4d42d422\', \'multiverseId\': 428511}, \'multiverseid\': 428511}, {\'name\': \'Guia Eólico Aviano\', \'text\': \'Voar, vigilância\\nAs fichas de criatura que você controla têm voar e vigilância.\\nEmbalsamar {4}{W}{U} ({4}{W}{U}, Exile este card de seu cemitério: Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia dele, com a exceção de ser um Zumbi Ave Guerreiro branco sem custo de mana. Embalsame somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0996658-dad4-4959-bb0f-7e2ed142c694\', \'multiverseId\': 428780}, \'multiverseid\': 428780}, {\'name\': \'Авен, Проводник Ветра\', \'text\': \'Полет, Бдительность\\nФишки существ под вашим контролем имеют Полет и Бдительность.\\nБальзамирование {4}{W}{U} ({4}{W}{U}, изгоните эту карту из вашего кладбища: создайте фишку, являющуюся ее копией, но при этом являющуюся белым Зомби Птицей Воином без мана-стоимости. Бальзамируйте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица Воин\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a5e0ed8-6fa5-4f4b-bfbd-0f53d041e063\', \'multiverseId\': 429049}, \'multiverseid\': 429049}, {\'name\': \'风兆艾文\', \'text\': \'飞行，警戒\\n由你操控的衍生生物具有飞行与警戒异能。\\n遗存{4}{W}{U}（{4}{W}{U}，从你的坟墓场放逐此牌：派出一个衍生物，且为此牌的复制品，但它是白色灵俑／鸟／战士，且没有法术力费用。遗存的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'生物～鸟／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90a22c12-36a4-439b-919b-52f2715325fa\', \'multiverseId\': 429318}, \'multiverseid\': 429318}, {\'name\': \'風兆艾文\', \'text\': \'飛行，警戒\\n由你操控的衍生生物具有飛行與警戒異能。\\n遺存{4}{W}{U}（{4}{W}{U}，從你的墳墓場放逐此牌：派出一個衍生物，且為此牌的複製品，但它是白色殭屍／鳥／戰士，且沒有魔法力費用。遺存的時機視同巫術。）\', \'type\': \'生物～鳥／戰士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34303717-76e4-4ca1-9fe6-92b7674f5317\', \'multiverseId\': 429587}, \'multiverseid\': 429587}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bauwerk der Autorität\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht angreifen. Lege eine Ziegelmarke auf das Bauwerk der Autorität.\\n{1}, {T}: Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug kann eine Kreatur deiner Wahl nicht angreifen oder blocken und ihre aktivierten Fähigkeiten können nicht aktiviert werden. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls sich drei oder mehr Ziegelmarken auf dem Bauwerk der Autorität befinden.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427197&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e220e214-d198-4bf5-ad81-70d726ed8eb8\', \'multiverseId\': 427197}, \'multiverseid\': 427197}, {\'name\': \'Edificio de autoridad\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: La criatura objetivo no puede atacar este turno. Pon un contador de bloque sobre el Edificio de autoridad.\\n{1}, {T}: Hasta tu próximo turno, la criatura objetivo no puede atacar ni bloquear y sus habilidades activadas no pueden activarse. Activa esta habilidad solo si hay tres o más contadores de bloque sobre el Edificio de autoridad.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b629fea0-2f84-4710-8bca-e4d1c6655c4e\', \'multiverseId\': 427466}, \'multiverseid\': 427466}, {\'name\': "Édifice d\'autorité", \'text\': "{1}, {T} : La créature ciblée ne peut pas attaquer ce tour-ci. Mettez un marqueur « brique » sur l\'Édifice d\'autorité.\\n{1}, {T} : Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, la créature ciblée ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer et ses capacités activées ne peuvent pas être activées. N\'activez cette capacité que s\'il y a au moins trois marqueurs « brique » sur l\'Édifice d\'autorité.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427735&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acd25b9f-5a8e-4f2a-88c5-393b379662c3\', \'multiverseId\': 427735}, \'multiverseid\': 427735}, {\'name\': "Edificio dell\'Autorità", \'text\': "{1}, {T}: Una creatura bersaglio non può attaccare in questo turno. Metti un segnalino mattone sull\'Edificio dell\'Autorità.\\n{1}, {T}: Fino al tuo prossimo turno, una creatura bersaglio non può attaccare o bloccare e le sue abilità attivate non possono essere attivate. Attiva questa abilità solo se ci sono tre o più segnalini mattone sull\'Edificio dell\'Autorità.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c63d8bf6-59be-4e27-9aa6-7b8d1b8d8da4\', \'multiverseId\': 428004}, \'multiverseid\': 428004}, {\'name\': \'権威の殿堂\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それでは攻撃できない。権威の殿堂の上に石材カウンターを１個置く。\\n{1}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたの次のターンまで、それでは攻撃したりブロックしたりできず、それの起動型能力は起動できない。この能力は、権威の殿堂の上に石材カウンターが３個以上置かれているときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2a88216-c43a-4127-8054-a52a02e268e8\', \'multiverseId\': 428273}, \'multiverseid\': 428273}, {\'name\': \'권위의 건물\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 이 턴에 공격할 수 없다. 권위의 건물에 벽돌 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n{1}, {T}: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 당신의 다음 턴까지, 그 생물은 공격하거나 방어할 수 없고 그 생물의 활성화능력은 활성화될 수 없다. 권위의 건물에 벽돌 카운터가 세 개 이상 있는 경우에만 이 능력을 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99c4f711-2c6e-4123-9d4d-7d3eafddd5b1\', \'multiverseId\': 428542}, \'multiverseid\': 428542}, {\'name\': \'Edifício da Autoridade\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: A criatura alvo não pode atacar neste turno. Coloque um marcador de tijolo em Edifício da Autoridade.\\n{1}, {T}: Até seu próximo turno, a criatura alvo não pode atacar nem bloquear e suas habilidades ativadas não podem ser ativadas. Ative esta habilidade somente se houver três ou mais marcadores de tijolo em Edifício da Autoridade.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fee63162-0679-40ab-a302-2d305722caea\', \'multiverseId\': 428811}, \'multiverseid\': 428811}, {\'name\': \'Здание Власти\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: целевое существо не может атаковать в этом ходу. Положите один жетон кирпича на Здание Власти.\\n{1}, {T}: до вашего следующего хода целевое существо не может атаковать или блокировать, и его активируемые способности не могут быть активированы. Активируйте эту способность, только если на Здании Власти есть не менее трех жетонов кирпича.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6549086-cebb-497d-ab1c-a563325e4cd3\', \'multiverseId\': 429080}, \'multiverseid\': 429080}, {\'name\': \'威权高塔\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：目标生物本回合不能攻击。在威权高塔上放置一个石砖指示物。\\n{1}，{T}：直到你的下一个回合，目标生物不能进行攻击或阻挡，其起动式异能也不能起动。只能于威权高塔上有三个或更多石砖指示物时起动此异能。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2314f41-82e0-477c-a81d-45fa80f86e0c\', \'multiverseId\': 429349}, \'multiverseid\': 429349}, {\'name\': \'威權高塔\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：目標生物本回合不能攻擊。在威權高塔上放置一個石磚指示物。\\n{1}，{T}：直到你的下一個回合，目標生物不能進行攻擊或阻擋，其起動式異能也不能起動。只能於威權高塔上有三個或更多石磚指示物時起動此異能。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'898afbf8-2232-40eb-8bcc-d2efbe113b74\', \'multiverseId\': 429618}, \'multiverseid\': 429618}]', "[{'name': 'Beleidigung // Verletzung', 'text': 'Schaden kann in diesem Zug nicht verhindert werden. Falls eine Quelle, die du kontrollierst, in diesem Zug Schaden zufügen würde, fügt sie stattdessen doppelt so viel Schaden zu.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Beleidigung', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427184&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da282906-3774-4c71-bdb9-c1d88dc6be64', 'multiverseId': 427184}, 'multiverseid': 427184}, {'name': 'Agravar // Heridas', 'text': 'El daño no puede ser prevenido este turno. Si una fuente que controlas fuera a hacer daño este turno, en vez de eso, hace el doble de ese daño.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Agravar', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427453&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac94d26c-7d17-4a0c-93da-2c69cd6760e5', 'multiverseId': 427453}, 'multiverseid': 427453}, {'name': 'Couteau // Plaie', 'text': 'Les blessures ne peuvent être prévenues ce tour-ci. Si une source que vous contrôlez devait infliger des blessures ce tour-ci, elle inflige le double de ces blessures à la place.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Couteau', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427722&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5574726-fdab-4fdd-a9f2-881cd3bcb9c8', 'multiverseId': 427722}, 'multiverseid': 427722}, {'name': 'Beffa // Danno', 'text': 'Il danno non può essere prevenuto in questo turno. Se una fonte che controlli sta per infliggere danno in questo turno, infligge invece il doppio di quel danno.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Beffa', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427991&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '854ea0bb-0bb1-4fd5-b96d-b00d308d1f60', 'multiverseId': 427991}, 'multiverseid': 427991}, {'name': '嘲笑 // 負傷', 'text': 'このターン、ダメージは軽減できない。このターン、あなたがコントロールする発生源がダメージを与えるなら、代わりにそれはその点数の２倍のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '嘲笑', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428260&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa750cd3-9e7c-4698-a8fa-0adeee81ffd9', 'multiverseId': 428260}, 'multiverseid': 428260}, {'name': '모욕 // 부상', 'text': '이 턴에는 피해를 방지할 수 없다. 당신이 조종하는 원천이 이 턴에 피해를 입히려 한다면, 대신 그 원천은 그 피해를 두 배로 입힌다.', 'type': '집중마법', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '모욕', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428529&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc1feaec-ad85-45e0-9688-838ee8a4c06b', 'multiverseId': 428529}, 'multiverseid': 428529}, {'name': 'Insulto // Agressão', 'text': 'Nenhum dano pode ser prevenido neste turno. Se uma fonte que você controla causaria dano neste turno, em vez disso, ela causa o dobro daquele dano.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Insulto', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428798&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a242d8c2-b1d0-4628-822b-a7e00705ec9e', 'multiverseId': 428798}, 'multiverseid': 428798}, {'name': 'Оскорбление // Ранение', 'text': 'Повреждения не могут быть предотвращены в этом ходу. Если источник под вашим контролем должен нанести повреждения в этом ходу, вместо этого он наносит те повреждения в двойном размере.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Оскорбление', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429067&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e6265709-5e98-4188-92bf-d2e8beb531e7', 'multiverseId': 429067}, 'multiverseid': 429067}, {'name': '侮辱 // 致伤', 'text': '本回合中，伤害不能被防止。本回合中，如果由你操控的某来源将造成伤害，则改为它造成两倍的伤害。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '侮辱', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429336&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '357b6cfd-8fa9-4388-aa63-03c7cb58caf6', 'multiverseId': 429336}, 'multiverseid': 429336}, {'name': '侮辱 // 致傷', 'text': '本回合中，傷害不能被防止。本回合中，如果由你操控的某來源將造成傷害，則改為它造成兩倍的傷害。', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '侮辱', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429605&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1f0a703b-91a2-4fa6-9cbd-e34330534813', 'multiverseId': 429605}, 'multiverseid': 429605}]", '[{\'name\': \'Bestärkter Glauben\', \'text\': \'Du erhältst 6 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nUmwandlung {1}{W} ({1}{W}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du den Bestärkten Glauben umwandelst, kannst du 2 Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Zu sehen, wie Götter unter den Menschen wandeln, gemeinsam leben … Wahrlich inspirierend."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426996&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fe121c1-fd8e-403b-8f1e-b552436f83e4\', \'multiverseId\': 426996}, \'multiverseid\': 426996}, {\'name\': \'Fe renovada\', \'text\': \'Ganas 6 vidas.\\nCiclo {1}{W}. ({1}{W}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando actives la habilidad de ciclo de la Fe renovada, puedes ganar 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ver a dioses entre la gente, siendo parte de su día a día... Es toda una inspiración".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a84d2457-755f-4f93-b506-4fbb4253c20c\', \'multiverseId\': 427265}, \'multiverseid\': 427265}, {\'name\': \'Foi renouvelée\', \'text\': \'Vous gagnez 6 points de vie.\\nRecyclage {1}{W} ({1}{W}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez la Foi renouvelée, vous pouvez gagner 2 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Voir les dieux évoluer parmi le peuple, dans leur quotidien... C\'est une source d\'inspiration. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427534&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37c78df4-59da-426d-9c4a-0711293fc027\', \'multiverseId\': 427534}, \'multiverseid\': 427534}, {\'name\': \'Fede Rinnovata\', \'text\': \'Guadagni 6 punti vita.\\nCiclo {1}{W} ({1}{W}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\\nQuando cicli la Fede Rinnovata, puoi guadagnare 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Vedere le divinità tra i comuni mortali, come parte integrante della loro vita quotidiana... È indubbiamente fonte di ispirazione."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b974762-7d67-437d-bbb7-f7194211e18f\', \'multiverseId\': 427803}, \'multiverseid\': 427803}, {\'name\': \'新たな信仰\', \'text\': \'あなたは６点のライフを得る。\\nサイクリング{1}{W}（{1}{W}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\\nあなたが新たな信仰をサイクリングしたとき、あなたは２点のライフを得てもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「神々が人々の日常生活になじんでいる様子というのは……感動的だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f094847c-1d61-41de-bba7-d0f18a3349a0\', \'multiverseId\': 428072}, \'multiverseid\': 428072}, {\'name\': \'되살아난 믿음\', \'text\': \'당신은 생명 6점을 얻는다.\\n순환 {1}{W} ({1}{W}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)\\n당신이 되살아난 믿음을 순환할 때, 당신은 생명 2점을 얻을 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"사람들 사이에 있는 신들과 그들의 일상을 보는 것은... 많은 영감을 불러일으킨다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a70448d-2f9f-4507-ade2-35d6f8ee7230\', \'multiverseId\': 428341}, \'multiverseid\': 428341}, {\'name\': \'Fé Renovada\', \'text\': \'Você ganha 6 pontos de vida.\\nReciclar {1}{W} ({1}{W}, Descarte este card: Compre um card.)\\nQuando recicla Fé Renovada, você pode ganhar 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Ver deuses em meio às pessoas, sendo parte das vidas delas... é inspirador."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbec13b7-356e-4a1a-bbb9-8c4aeb0505c6\', \'multiverseId\': 428610}, \'multiverseid\': 428610}, {\'name\': \'Обновленная Вера\', \'text\': \'Вы получаете 6 жизней.\\nЦикл {1}{W} ({1}{W}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\\nКогда вы совершаете цикл Обновленной Веры, вы можете получить 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Видеть богов среди людей, в их обычной, повседневной жизни... Это очень воодушевляет».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20e1cfe0-c5b7-4863-92a2-fd43bf5d06a1\', \'multiverseId\': 428879}, \'multiverseid\': 428879}, {\'name\': \'重拾信念\', \'text\': \'你获得6点生命。\\n循环{1}{W}（{1}{W}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\\n当你循环重拾信念时，你可以获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「看到神明亲临凡间，体恤民情. . .真令人振奋。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a348b929-fc5b-4f6a-a0d0-569ea12d02ea\', \'multiverseId\': 429148}, \'multiverseid\': 429148}, {\'name\': \'重拾信念\', \'text\': \'你獲得6點生命。\\n循環{1}{W}（{1}{W}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）\\n當你循環重拾信念時，你可以獲得2點生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「看到神明親臨凡間，體恤民情. . .真令人振奮。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06ef588f-f3fe-4640-bc48-c76290bc87b2\', \'multiverseId\': 429417}, \'multiverseid\': 429417}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bewahrer der Glyphen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Bewahrer der Glyphen zum ersten Mal in einem Zug das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, neutralisiere den Zauberspruch oder die Fähigkeit.\\nEinbalsamieren {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, schicke diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie von ihr ist, außer dass er eine weiße Zombie-Sphinx ohne Manakosten ist. Spiele Einbalsamieren wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427026&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bbd722d-38e4-4ebf-af06-35bbb5caf8fb\', \'multiverseId\': 427026}, \'multiverseid\': 427026}, {\'name\': \'Protector de jeroglíficos\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Protector de jeroglíficos sea objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad por primera vez en cada turno, contrarresta ese hechizo o habilidad.\\nEmbalsamar {5}{U}{U}. ({5}{U}{U}, exiliar esta carta de tu cementerio: Crea una ficha que es una copia de esta carta, excepto que es una Esfinge Zombie blanca sin coste de maná. Activa la habilidad de embalsamar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a4baf64-56bc-4d2b-9312-9a53c2835888\', \'multiverseId\': 427295}, \'multiverseid\': 427295}, {\'name\': \'Gardien des glyphes\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Gardien des glyphes devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité pour la première fois à chaque tour, contrecarrez ce sort ou cette capacité.\\nEmbaumement {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, exilez cette carte de votre cimetière : Créez un jeton qui en est une copie, excepté que c\'est un zombie et sphinx blanc sans coût de mana. N\'utilisez l\'embaumement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature : sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427564&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9253f069-7f79-4b3e-9a17-261c1a095cb2\', \'multiverseId\': 427564}, \'multiverseid\': 427564}, {\'name\': \'Custode dei Glifi\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Custode dei Glifi diventa bersaglio di una magia o abilità per la prima volta in ogni turno, neutralizza quella magia o abilità.\\nImbalsamare {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, Esilia questa carta dal tuo cimitero: Crea una pedina che è una copia della carta, tranne che è una Sfinge Zombie bianca senza costo di mana. Imbalsama solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e875dadc-aa67-44cb-8b52-e016dea5f499\', \'multiverseId\': 427833}, \'multiverseid\': 427833}, {\'name\': \'象形の守り手\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n象形の守り手が各ターン最初に呪文や能力の対象になるたび、その呪文や能力を打ち消す。\\n不朽{5}{U}{U}（{5}{U}{U}, あなたの墓地からこのカードを追放する：マナ・コストを持たない白のゾンビ・スフィンクスであることを除きこれのコピーであるトークンを１体生成する。不朽はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'867452be-86a0-4b93-97f6-57881a384871\', \'multiverseId\': 428102}, \'multiverseid\': 428102}, {\'name\': \'상형문자 수호자\', \'text\': \'비행\\n상형문자 수호자가 매 턴 최초로 주문이나 능력의 목표로 정해질 때마다, 그 주문이나 능력을 무효화한다.\\n방부처리 {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 추방한다: 이 카드의 복사본인 토큰 한 개를 만든다. 단, 그 토큰은 마나 비용이 없는 백색 좀비 스핑크스다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 방부처리를 할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 스핑크스\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5536a69b-06a3-4397-b531-f081181e9682\', \'multiverseId\': 428371}, \'multiverseid\': 428371}, {\'name\': \'Guardião dos Glifos\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Guardião dos Glifos se tornar o alvo de uma mágica ou habilidade pela primeira vez em cada turno, anule aquela mágica ou habilidade.\\nEmbalsamar {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, Exile este card de seu cemitério: Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia dele, com a exceção de ser um Zumbi Esfinge branco sem custo de mana. Embalsame somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c48be81-3bed-4d77-8c03-86e4a33109f5\', \'multiverseId\': 428640}, \'multiverseid\': 428640}, {\'name\': \'Страж Знаков\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда Страж Знаков становится целью заклинания или способности первый раз в каждом ходу, отмените то заклинание или способность.\\nБальзамирование {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, изгоните эту карту из вашего кладбища: создайте фишку, являющуюся ее копией, но при этом являющуюся белым Зомби Сфинксом без мана-стоимости. Бальзамируйте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Сфинкс\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab4cc72d-7e77-4145-81b1-3116659190e9\', \'multiverseId\': 428909}, \'multiverseid\': 428909}, {\'name\': \'图符守护者\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当图符守护者在一回合中首度成为咒语或异能的目标时，反击该咒语或异能。\\n遗存{5}{U}{U}（{5}{U}{U}，从你的坟墓场放逐此牌：派出一个衍生物，且为此牌的复制品，但它是白色灵俑／史芬斯，且没有法术力费用。遗存的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'生物～史芬斯\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64debfb2-bafc-432a-83fa-01886c78f394\', \'multiverseId\': 429178}, \'multiverseid\': 429178}, {\'name\': \'圖符守護者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當圖符守護者在一回合中首度成為咒語或異能的目標時，反擊該咒語或異能。\\n遺存{5}{U}{U}（{5}{U}{U}，從你的墳墓場放逐此牌：派出一個衍生物，且為此牌的複製品，但它是白色殭屍／史芬斯，且沒有魔法力費用。遺存的時機視同巫術。）\', \'type\': \'生物～史芬斯\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4004949d-128e-4d2e-95be-2e64d57fac4a\', \'multiverseId\': 429447}, \'multiverseid\': 429447}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bewaldete Schlucht\', \'text\': \'Die Bewaldete Schlucht kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {R} oder {G}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Tazeem ist rau zu seinen Bewohnern, doch diejenigen, die es Heimat nennen, würden nirgendwo anders leben wollen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429731&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e7c8f6d-dd96-4720-8555-a4da8562db3f\', \'multiverseId\': 429731}, \'multiverseid\': 429731}, {\'name\': \'Desfiladero de madera\', \'text\': \'El Desfiladero de madera entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {G} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'El abrazo de Tazeem es rudo, pero no podría ser más acogedor para aquellos que lo llaman hogar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26d54364-2901-46f9-a226-032434173314\', \'multiverseId\': 429857}, \'multiverseid\': 429857}, {\'name\': \'Gorge du massif\', \'text\': \'La Gorge du massif arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {G} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Tazeem est rude, mais pour ceux qui le considèrent comme leur foyer, ce continent n\'a pas son pareil.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429749&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de0795ea-4579-49be-b729-58afab061f2a\', \'multiverseId\': 429749}, \'multiverseid\': 429749}, {\'name\': \'Gola Boscosa\', \'text\': \'La Gola Boscosa entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {G} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "L\'abbraccio di Tazeem è duro, ma chi lo chiama patria non desidera nient\'altro.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5582683c-ac07-4698-b0d8-531bf3436679\', \'multiverseId\': 429767}, \'multiverseid\': 429767}, {\'name\': \'森林の地溝\', \'text\': \'森林の地溝はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{R}か{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'タジームの自然環境は過酷だが、そこを故郷とする者には何にも代えがたい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e291ad7-0503-410c-a182-2d6acb576561\', \'multiverseId\': 429785}, \'multiverseid\': 429785}, {\'name\': \'산림 협곡\', \'text\': \'산림 협곡은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}: {R} 또는 {G}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': \'타짐의 환경은 척박하지만, 이곳이 삶의 터전인 자들에게는 천국이나 다름없다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63119e55-77ca-4342-9830-562e9ae75bae\', \'multiverseId\': 429803}, \'multiverseid\': 429803}, {\'name\': \'Desfiladeiro da Mata\', \'text\': \'Desfiladeiro da Mata entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {G} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'O abraço de Tazeem é bruto, mas, para os que fazem dela seu lar, nada o substitui.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf0a632a-966d-4efc-98de-0ddca6a4ce90\', \'multiverseId\': 429821}, \'multiverseid\': 429821}, {\'name\': \'Лесная Теснина\', \'text\': \'Лесная Теснина выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {R} или {G} в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Объятья Тазима суровы, но для тех, кто называет это место домом, не подойдет ничто иное.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63fcef97-cb0c-46ff-accb-e49921ca97ae\', \'multiverseId\': 429839}, \'multiverseid\': 429839}, {\'name\': \'林场峡谷\', \'text\': \'林场峡谷须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{R}或{G}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'虽然塔晋的环境严酷，但对以此为家乡者而言，却是无可替代的所在。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79faf773-2624-485a-9997-223e7dc38467\', \'multiverseId\': 429695}, \'multiverseid\': 429695}, {\'name\': \'林場峽谷\', \'text\': \'林場峽谷須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{R}或{G}到你的魔法力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'雖然塔晉的環境嚴酷，但對以此為家鄉者而言，卻是無可替代的所在。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc9f34b6-175a-4a29-b6bb-effc6b93f38b\', \'multiverseId\': 429713}, \'multiverseid\': 429713}]', "[{'name': 'Bewässertes Ackerland', 'text': '({T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {W} oder {U}.)\\nDas Bewässerte Ackerland kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land — Ebene, Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427216&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9844cf16-3e1b-4903-b5c1-d407b2040fd8', 'multiverseId': 427216}, 'multiverseid': 427216}, {'name': 'Cultivos irrigados', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {W} o {U} a tu reserva de maná.)\\nLos Cultivos irrigados entran al campo de batalla girados.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra — Llanura isla', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427485&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3b7991cc-b409-4d38-88cf-1b4dd5fab98d', 'multiverseId': 427485}, 'multiverseid': 427485}, {'name': 'Terres arables irriguées', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U} à votre réserve.)\\nLes Terres arables irriguées arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain : plaine et île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427754&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fc6e1670-ad4c-4e51-afb8-db920465c1e7', 'multiverseId': 427754}, 'multiverseid': 427754}, {'name': 'Colture Irrigate', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U} alla tua riserva di mana.)\\nLe Colture Irrigate entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra — Pianura Isola', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428023&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9e66f2ef-a678-4feb-b42d-495bc37a6a3b', 'multiverseId': 428023}, 'multiverseid': 428023}, {'name': '灌漑農地', 'text': '（{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{W}か{U}を加える。）\\n灌漑農地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': '土地 — 平地・島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428292&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f380061c-f370-4496-b024-af75ac1f06a3', 'multiverseId': 428292}, 'multiverseid': 428292}, {'name': '관개 농지', 'text': '({T}: {W} 또는 {U}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.)\\n관개 농지는 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n순환 {2} ({2}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)', 'type': '대지 — 들 섬', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428561&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f9f871c0-6e65-4513-835e-29867cde7b65', 'multiverseId': 428561}, 'multiverseid': 428561}, {'name': 'Fazendas Irrigadas', 'text': '({T}: Adicione {W} ou {U} à sua reserva de mana.)\\nFazendas Irrigadas entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, Descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Terreno — Planície Ilha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428830&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '113d8f47-cfa5-4f21-b548-f5985cea632f', 'multiverseId': 428830}, 'multiverseid': 428830}, {'name': 'Орошаемые Поля', 'text': '({T}: добавьте {W} или {U} в ваше хранилище маны.)\\nОрошаемые Поля выходят на поле битвы повернутыми.\\nЦикл {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)', 'type': 'Земля — Равнина Остров', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429099&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '90a24fd8-4f9b-48a4-99c1-69dfc1fde056', 'multiverseId': 429099}, 'multiverseid': 429099}, {'name': '漫灌农地', 'text': '（{T}：加{W}或{U}到你的法术力池中。）\\n漫灌农地须横置进战场。\\n循环{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）', 'type': '地～平原／海岛', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429368&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '70a52846-af9f-4ee5-8434-29f4fe22f979', 'multiverseId': 429368}, 'multiverseid': 429368}, {'name': '漫灌農地', 'text': '（{T}：加{W}或{U}到你的魔法力池中。）\\n漫灌農地須橫置進戰場。\\n循環{2}（{2}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）', 'type': '地～平原／海島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429637&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '85b224fe-5908-4883-8a97-c79c95c84b4f', 'multiverseId': 429637}, 'multiverseid': 429637}]", '[{\'name\': \'Bitterklingenkämpfer\', \'text\': \'Du kannst den Bitterklingenkämpfer erschöpfen, sowie er angreift. Wenn du dies tust, erhält er +1/+0 und Todesberührung bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Eine erschöpfte Kreatur enttappt nicht während deines nächsten Enttappsegments.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schakal, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Wesirin der Gifte lehrt eine eher unkonventionelle Art zu kämpfen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427128&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffde89d8-1a83-481d-9047-7747fb25efcb\', \'multiverseId\': 427128}, \'multiverseid\': 427128}, {\'name\': \'Guerrero filoamargo\', \'text\': \'Puedes espolear al Guerrero filoamargo en cuanto ataque. Cuando lo hagas, obtiene +1/+0 y gana la habilidad de toque mortal hasta el final del turno. (Una criatura espoleada no se enderezará durante tu próximo paso de enderezar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero chacal\', \'flavor\': \'"La visir de los venenos instruye un tipo de fuerza poco convencional".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e5fafe8-f1c2-4a04-a77e-8ecede1879c0\', \'multiverseId\': 427397}, \'multiverseid\': 427397}, {\'name\': \'Guerrier âprelame\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez surmener le Guerrier âprelame au moment où il attaque. Quand vous faites ainsi, il gagne +1/+0 et acquiert le contact mortel jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Une créature surmenée ne se dégage pas pendant votre prochaine étape de dégagement.)", \'type\': \'Créature : chacal et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Le vizir des poisons enseigne une forme de force peu conventionnelle. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427666&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de46b12b-bc8c-4f75-b6d8-0ede88defcef\', \'multiverseId\': 427666}, \'multiverseid\': 427666}, {\'name\': \'Guerriero Aspralama\', \'text\': \'Puoi stremare il Guerriero Aspralama mentre attacca. Quando lo fai, prende +1/+0 e ha tocco letale fino alla fine del turno. (Una creatura stremata non STAPpa durante il tuo prossimo STAP.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Sciacallo\', \'flavor\': \'"La visir dei veleni insegna a padroneggiare un tipo di forza poco convenzionale."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db724b93-61ec-4b39-be3f-e0212c065a99\', \'multiverseId\': 427935}, \'multiverseid\': 427935}, {\'name\': \'苦刃の戦士\', \'text\': \'苦刃の戦士が攻撃するに際し、あなたはこれを督励してもよい。そうしたとき、ターン終了時まで、これは＋１/＋０の修整を受けるとともに接死を得る。（督励されたクリーチャーは、あなたの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ジャッカル・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「毒物の侍臣は伝統的なものとは異なる形の強さを教える。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'780fbcbf-0d34-4009-8311-e5a3fc443c9a\', \'multiverseId\': 428204}, \'multiverseid\': 428204}, {\'name\': \'맹독검 전사\', \'text\': \'당신은 맹독검 전사로 공격을 선언하면서 맹독검 전사를 분전시킬 수 있다. 그렇게 할 때, 맹독검 전사는 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받고 치명타를 얻는다. (분전한 생물은 당신의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 자칼 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"독의 고관들은 새로운 유형의 힘을 가르친다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e584d3d-53a8-480a-a7f5-24eb35295cd6\', \'multiverseId\': 428473}, \'multiverseid\': 428473}, {\'name\': \'Guerreiro Laminamarga\', \'text\': \'Você pode exaurir Guerreiro Laminamarga conforme ele ataca. Quando você faz isso, ele recebe +1/+0 e ganha toque mortífero até o final do turno. (Uma criatura exaurida não será desvirada durante sua próxima etapa de desvirar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chacal Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"A vizir das poções ensina um tipo não convencional de força."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88ccc83c-641a-432b-a86d-2b03d892d3bb\', \'multiverseId\': 428742}, \'multiverseid\': 428742}, {\'name\': \'Воин Клинка Горечи\', \'text\': \'Вы можете подстегнуть Воина Клинка Горечи в момент его атаки. Когда вы это делаете, он получает +1/+0 и Смертельное касание до конца хода. (Подстегнутое существо не разворачивается во время вашего следующего шага разворота.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Шакал Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Визирь ядов учит той силе, что привычна немногим».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7a09145-df6b-4268-8543-6a0b90d8fbec\', \'multiverseId\': 429011}, \'multiverseid\': 429011}, {\'name\': \'毒刃战士\', \'text\': \'你可以于毒刃战士攻击时耗竭之。当你如此作时，直到回合结束，它得+1/+0且获得死触异能。（已耗竭的生物于你的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。）\', \'type\': \'生物～豺狼／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「司毒维齐尔授人以非比寻常的力量。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc7d0542-2141-480a-a4e1-7ee668da132f\', \'multiverseId\': 429280}, \'multiverseid\': 429280}, {\'name\': \'毒刃戰士\', \'text\': \'你可以於毒刃戰士攻擊時耗竭之。當你如此作時，直到回合結束，它得+1/+0且獲得死觸異能。（已耗竭的生物於你的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。）\', \'type\': \'生物～豺狼／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「司毒維齊爾授人以非比尋常的力量。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a194992c-5343-4bc9-a56f-10499f5744bb\', \'multiverseId\': 429549}, \'multiverseid\': 429549}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutdurst-Erwecker\', \'text\': \'{T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Für den Sieg! Für Ruhm und Ehre! Für die Ewigkeit!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427091&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39c7e61e-0ca5-4af5-882e-83ae2a56d3d2\', \'multiverseId\': 427091}, \'multiverseid\': 427091}, {\'name\': \'Instigador de sed de sangre\', \'text\': \'{T}: La criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Por la victoria! ¡Por la gloria! ¡Por la eternidad!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0fd3992-e7f4-4bb6-90ee-536a739d93f7\', \'multiverseId\': 427360}, \'multiverseid\': 427360}, {\'name\': \'Incitateur à la soif de sang\', \'text\': "{T} : La créature ciblée acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Pour la victoire ! Pour la gloire ! Pour l\'éternité ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427629&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa5e11ec-08ed-4773-b630-ff6af725858b\', \'multiverseId\': 427629}, \'multiverseid\': 427629}, {\'name\': \'Fomentatore della Sete di Sangue\', \'text\': \'{T}: Una creatura bersaglio ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Per la vittoria! Per la gloria! Per l\\\'eternità!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d35a0cf0-d6eb-4848-b30d-d62bdfc6c4a5\', \'multiverseId\': 427898}, \'multiverseid\': 427898}, {\'name\': \'血に飢えた振起者\', \'text\': \'{T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「勝利を！栄光を！永遠を！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e866dc25-ee0d-4041-a504-e117e1530dd6\', \'multiverseId\': 428167}, \'multiverseid\': 428167}, {\'name\': \'야만적 선동자\', \'text\': \'{T}: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 신속을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"승리를 위해! 영광을 위해! 영원을 위해!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e81f469-6721-4eb7-a3ae-ce5b2b4cfd30\', \'multiverseId\': 428436}, \'multiverseid\': 428436}, {\'name\': \'Incitador da Sede de Sangue\', \'text\': \'{T}: A criatura alvo ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"À vitória! À glória! À eternidade!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fac0e34f-bcd3-42f1-9dbd-88ebc4a08303\', \'multiverseId\': 428705}, \'multiverseid\': 428705}, {\'name\': \'Кровожадный Подстрекатель\', \'text\': \'{T}: целевое существо получает Ускорение до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«К победе! К славе! К вечности!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3d1f130-8400-43b1-881c-63b27727d1dd\', \'multiverseId\': 428974}, \'multiverseid\': 428974}, {\'name\': \'嗜血鼓动师\', \'text\': \'{T}：目标生物获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「为了胜利！为了荣誉！为了永生！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86b1e6bb-ace7-4533-9718-a91428c8cbff\', \'multiverseId\': 429243}, \'multiverseid\': 429243}, {\'name\': \'嗜血鼓動師\', \'text\': \'{T}：目標生物獲得敏捷異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「為了勝利！為了榮譽！為了永生！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09130085-b5df-4fbd-aad2-8802fd7aa3ae\', \'multiverseId\': 429512}, \'multiverseid\': 429512}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutzorn-Raufbold\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Blutzorn-Raufbold ins Spiel kommt, wirf eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Minotaurus, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Hazoret betrachtet jeden, der für sie kämpft, als ein geliebtes Kind.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427092&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd9d2ee5-d0ba-4379-8f1b-7dce9d871998\', \'multiverseId\': 427092}, \'multiverseid\': 427092}, {\'name\': \'Pendenciero de la ira sangrienta\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Pendenciero de la ira sangrienta entre al campo de batalla, descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'Para Hazoret, quienes luchan por ella son sus amados hijos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9695704f-867c-4f5d-89b0-2650286b59cc\', \'multiverseId\': 427361}, \'multiverseid\': 427361}, {\'name\': \'Bagarreur à la rage de sang\', \'text\': "Quand le Bagarreur à la rage de sang arrive sur le champ de bataille, défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : minotaure et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'Hazoret considère ceux qui se battent en son nom comme ses enfants bien-aimés.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427630&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2411f78b-a3f6-4dc6-81b3-379ca51ef17a\', \'multiverseId\': 427630}, \'multiverseid\': 427630}, {\'name\': "Lottatore dell\'Ira Sanguinaria", \'text\': "Quando il Lottatore dell\'Ira Sanguinaria entra nel campo di battaglia, scarta una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'Hazoret considera tutti coloro che combattono per lei come suoi figli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b74dc160-d90b-4c91-b010-8bc836fe9722\', \'multiverseId\': 427899}, \'multiverseid\': 427899}, {\'name\': \'血怒りの喧嘩屋\', \'text\': \'血怒りの喧嘩屋が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ミノタウルス・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'ハゾレトにとって、自分のために戦う者は愛する我が子のようなものだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b3d0bf4-26a0-4464-969f-c3567fb88442\', \'multiverseId\': 428168}, \'multiverseid\': 428168}, {\'name\': \'피에 분노하는 싸움꾼\', \'text\': \'피에 분노하는 싸움꾼이 전장에 들어올 때, 카드 한 장을 버린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 미노타우로스 전사\', \'flavor\': \'하조렛에게 그녀를 위해 싸우는 이들은 그녀의 자식들이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'855d1b69-ab07-48ff-8553-fdb2410b5a44\', \'multiverseId\': 428437}, \'multiverseid\': 428437}, {\'name\': \'Brigão da Ira Sanguinária\', \'text\': \'Quando Brigão da Ira Sanguinária entrar no campo de batalha, descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Minotauro Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Para Hazoret, os que lutam por ela são seus amados filhos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80fb6926-a544-426b-80bf-73f0a48a124e\', \'multiverseId\': 428706}, \'multiverseid\': 428706}, {\'name\': \'Воитель Кровавой Ярости\', \'text\': \'Когда Воитель Кровавой Ярости выходит на поле битвы, сбросьте карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Минотавр Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Для Хазорет все, кто сражается за нее, становятся ее возлюбленными детьми.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca9913a9-a180-45b0-adfd-c4ed1405370c\', \'multiverseId\': 428975}, \'multiverseid\': 428975}, {\'name\': \'血怒好斗者\', \'text\': \'当血怒好斗者进战场时，弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～牛头怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'对哈佐蕾来说，为她而战的都是她的子民。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24bf955c-d6be-4d0a-ac38-6cd03b875833\', \'multiverseId\': 429244}, \'multiverseid\': 429244}, {\'name\': \'血怒好鬥者\', \'text\': \'當血怒好鬥者進戰場時，棄一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～牛頭怪／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'對哈佐蕾來說，為她而戰的都是她的子民。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'387ffca5-63a5-41bd-92b1-0dd25c55a09f\', \'multiverseId\': 429513}, \'multiverseid\': 429513}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bontu die Vielgepriesene\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich, Unzerstörbar\\nBontu die Vielgepriesene kann nicht angreifen oder blocken, es sei denn, eine Kreatur ist diesem Zug unter deiner Kontrolle gestorben.\\n{1}{B}, opfere eine andere Kreatur: Hellsicht 1. Jeder Gegner verliert 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Gott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427053&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c77423fe-a872-471a-81eb-4e0fb0776ea4\', \'multiverseId\': 427053}, \'multiverseid\': 427053}, {\'name\': \'Bontu, la Venerada\', \'text\': \'Amenaza, indestructible.\\nBontu, la Venerada no puede atacar ni bloquear a menos que una criatura muriera bajo tu control este turno.\\n{1}{B}, sacrificar otra criatura: Adivina 1. Cada oponente pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Deidad\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3640c5a-e0d4-43ce-8671-1b5fa98eae47\', \'multiverseId\': 427322}, \'multiverseid\': 427322}, {\'name\': \'Bontu la Glorifiée\', \'text\': "Menace, indestructible\\nBontu la Glorifiée ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer à moins qu\'une créature ne soit morte sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci.\\n{1}{B}, sacrifiez une autre créature : Regard 1. Chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427591&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d59a879-b8de-4762-859a-280ac9f78921\', \'multiverseId\': 427591}, \'multiverseid\': 427591}, {\'name\': \'Bontu la Gloriosa\', \'text\': "Minacciare, indistruttibile\\nBontu la Gloriosa non può attaccare o bloccare a meno che non sia morta una creatura sotto il tuo controllo in questo turno.\\n{1}{B}, Sacrifica un\'altra creatura: Profetizza 1. Ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Dio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'311d2bc2-fda2-4f18-b23d-eedd341d49f7\', \'multiverseId\': 427860}, \'multiverseid\': 427860}, {\'name\': \'栄光の神バントゥ\', \'text\': \'威迫、破壊不能\\nこのターンにクリーチャーがあなたのコントロール下で死亡していないかぎり、栄光の神バントゥでは攻撃したりブロックしたりできない。\\n{1}{B}, 他のクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：占術１を行う。各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55458e81-f5ef-43e0-b2c1-584865bb8e4b\', \'multiverseId\': 428129}, \'multiverseid\': 428129}, {\'name\': \'영광의 본투\', \'text\': \'호전적, 무적\\n이 턴에 당신이 조종하는 생물이 죽지 않았다면, 영광의 본투는 공격하거나 방어할 수 없다.\\n{1}{B}, 다른 생물 한 개를 희생한다: 점술 1을 한다. 각 상대는 생명 1점을 잃고 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 신\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86b939fe-3e06-428b-bda4-d24b095a8c46\', \'multiverseId\': 428398}, \'multiverseid\': 428398}, {\'name\': \'Bontu, a Glorificada\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar, indestrutível\\nBontu, a Glorificada, não pode atacar nem bloquear, a menos que uma criatura tenha morrido sob seu controle neste turno.\\n{1}{B}, Sacrifique outra criatura: Use vidência 1. Cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Deus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5bc5272-2499-4bad-b5dd-727c437963ac\', \'multiverseId\': 428667}, \'multiverseid\': 428667}, {\'name\': \'Бонту Прославленная\', \'text\': \'Угроза, Неразрушимость\\nБонту Прославленная не может атаковать или блокировать, если только в этом ходу под вашим контролем не умерло существо.\\n{1}{B}, пожертвуйте другое существо: предскажите 1. Каждый оппонент теряет 1 жизнь, а вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Бог\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a52704e-cf8e-4fc1-976e-21a4bc027ef6\', \'multiverseId\': 428936}, \'multiverseid\': 428936}, {\'name\': \'荣光神芭图\', \'text\': \'威慑，不灭\\n除非本回合有生物在你的操控下死去，否则荣光神芭图不能进行攻击或阻挡。\\n{1}{B}，牺牲另一个生物：占卜1。每位对手各失去1点生命且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'845bef62-5cb9-46b6-b6a9-52fe7687f493\', \'multiverseId\': 429205}, \'multiverseid\': 429205}, {\'name\': \'榮光神芭圖\', \'text\': \'威懾，不滅\\n除非本回合有生物在你的操控下死去，否則榮光神芭圖不能進行攻擊或阻擋。\\n{1}{B}，犧牲另一個生物：占卜1。每位對手各失去1點生命且你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5c37a3b-b2ba-4408-ab02-06a4517c2451\', \'multiverseId\': 429474}, \'multiverseid\': 429474}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bontus Monument\', \'text\': \'Schwarze Kreaturenzauber, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\\nImmer wenn du einen Kreaturenzauber wirkst, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Auserwählten sollen nach Größe streben. Macht im Diesseits bedeutet Macht im Jenseits." —Inschrift am Monument\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427196&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73985a51-e51f-48bd-a8b9-64643989c284\', \'multiverseId\': 427196}, \'multiverseid\': 427196}, {\'name\': \'Monumento a Bontu\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar los hechizos de criatura negros.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de criatura, cada oponente pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': \'"Los dignos se esforzarán por alcanzar la grandeza. La supremacía en la vida lleva a la supremacía en el más allá". —Inscripción en el monumento\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'840bcfbd-3152-4cf7-9938-b60811581c79\', \'multiverseId\': 427465}, \'multiverseid\': 427465}, {\'name\': \'Monument de Bontu\', \'text\': \'Les sorts de créature noirs que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de créature, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': "« Les valeureux aspireront à l\'excellence. La suprématie dans la vie assure la suprématie dans l\'au-delà. » —Inscription sur le monument", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427734&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4619a956-8b9e-4f44-adbb-f7ba51e1476e\', \'multiverseId\': 427734}, \'multiverseid\': 427734}, {\'name\': \'Monumento a Bontu\', \'text\': \'Le magie creatura nere che lanci costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia creatura, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': \'"I prescelti dovranno lottare strenuamente per raggiungere la grandezza. La supremazia in vita è il lasciapassare per la supremazia nell\\\'aldilà." —Iscrizione sul monumento\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b9738a9-75ea-44ca-bd6f-7d83f6bb92bc\', \'multiverseId\': 428003}, \'multiverseid\': 428003}, {\'name\': \'バントゥの碑\', \'text\': \'あなたが黒のクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\nあなたがクリーチャー・呪文を１つ唱えるたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「蓋世の英雄は偉業を目指さねばならぬ。現世での卓越は来世での卓越に通ず。」 ――碑文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18638988-802c-48d7-b5b7-d6b6d4f4c5b4\', \'multiverseId\': 428272}, \'multiverseid\': 428272}, {\'name\': \'본투 기념비\', \'text\': \'당신이 발동하는 흑색 생물 주문들은 발동하는 데 {1}이 덜 든다.\\n당신이 생물 주문을 발동할 때마다, 각 상대는 생명 1점을 잃고 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'"자격있는 자들은 위대함을 추구해야 한다. 생전의 우월성은 사후 세계에서의 우월성으로 이어진다." —기념비 비문\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81382469-1a3a-48ca-8c43-818434a7a582\', \'multiverseId\': 428541}, \'multiverseid\': 428541}, {\'name\': \'Monumento de Bontu\', \'text\': \'As mágicas de criatura pretas que você conjura custam {1} a menos para serem conjuradas.\\nToda vez que você conjura uma mágica de criatura, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'"Os dignos buscarão a grandeza. A supremacia em vida leva à supremacia após a morte." — Inscrição no monumento\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bba6aceb-074f-4c48-871a-4f0f2ea9a2fc\', \'multiverseId\': 428810}, \'multiverseid\': 428810}, {\'name\': \'Монумент Бонту\', \'text\': \'Разыгрываемые вами заклинания черных существ стоят на {1} меньше.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание существа, каждый оппонент теряет 1 жизнь, а вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Достойные должны стремиться к величию. Превосходство в жизни земной ведет к превосходству в жизни загробной». — надпись на монументе\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d44d163-69ab-4085-89e5-6529b2472790\', \'multiverseId\': 429079}, \'multiverseid\': 429079}, {\'name\': \'芭图纪念碑\', \'text\': \'你施放的黑色生物咒语减少{1}来施放。\\n每当你施放生物咒语时，每位对手各失去1点生命且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'「豪英应永求上进，前生伟业奠定来世地位。」 ～纪念碑铭文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1517ff51-2e6a-4145-b449-bb659d734d27\', \'multiverseId\': 429348}, \'multiverseid\': 429348}, {\'name\': \'芭圖紀念碑\', \'text\': \'你施放的黑色生物咒語減少{1}來施放。\\n每當你施放生物咒語時，每位對手各失去1點生命且你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'「豪英應永求上進，前生偉業奠定來世地位。」 ～紀念碑銘文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52ab6445-307f-45da-8592-45ddb958bc74\', \'multiverseId\': 429617}, \'multiverseid\': 429617}]', '[{\'name\': \'Böenwanderer\', \'text\': \'Du kannst den Böenwanderer erschöpfen, sowie er angreift. Wenn du dies tust, erhält er +1/+1 und Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Eine erschöpfte Kreatur enttappt nicht während deines nächsten Enttappsegments.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich trage vielleicht keine Waffen, aber ich bin niemals unbewaffnet."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426988&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0c69586-8d93-4a6a-b69f-ad2a8f6f7067\', \'multiverseId\': 426988}, \'multiverseid\': 426988}, {\'name\': \'Caminavientos\', \'text\': \'Puedes espolear al Caminavientos en cuanto ataque. Cuando lo hagas, obtiene +1/+1 y gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno. (Una criatura espoleada no se enderezará durante tu próximo paso de enderezar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Nunca voy desarmado".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb94cbd1-3807-4513-998c-48eafb281f47\', \'multiverseId\': 427257}, \'multiverseid\': 427257}, {\'name\': \'Marcheur des rafales\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez surmener le Marcheur des rafales au moment où il attaque. Quand vous faites ainsi, il gagne +1/+1 et acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Une créature surmenée ne se dégage pas pendant votre prochaine étape de dégagement.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Je ne suis jamais désarmé. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427526&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88dbcd69-3ee7-4817-8b15-9a27d6af7090\', \'multiverseId\': 427526}, \'multiverseid\': 427526}, {\'name\': \'Calcaraffiche\', \'text\': \'Puoi stremare il Calcaraffiche mentre attacca. Quando lo fai, prende +1/+1 e ha volare fino alla fine del turno. (Una creatura stremata non STAPpa durante il tuo prossimo STAP.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Non sono mai disarmato."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a45da7ff-c6e1-4b00-b581-6e224222b98b\', \'multiverseId\': 427795}, \'multiverseid\': 427795}, {\'name\': \'突風歩き\', \'text\': \'突風歩きが攻撃するに際し、あなたはこれを督励してもよい。そうしたとき、ターン終了時まで、これは＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに飛行を得る。（督励されたクリーチャーは、あなたの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「私が丸腰でいることはない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90565a17-950e-4fe9-8116-d113569a3782\', \'multiverseId\': 428064}, \'multiverseid\': 428064}, {\'name\': \'질풍 보행자\', \'text\': \'당신은 질풍 보행자로 공격을 선언하면서 질풍 보행자를 분전시킬 수 있다. 그렇게 할 때, 질풍 보행자는 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받고 비행을 얻는다. (분전한 생물은 당신의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"난 언제나 방비 상태야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b5cba95-b2bb-47a0-933b-ab23fa34dad8\', \'multiverseId\': 428333}, \'multiverseid\': 428333}, {\'name\': \'Caminhante das Rajadas\', \'text\': \'Você pode exaurir Caminhante das Rajadas conforme ele ataca. Quando você faz isso, ele recebe +1/+1 e ganha voar até o final do turno. (Uma criatura exaurida não será desvirada durante sua próxima etapa de desvirar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu nunca estou desarmado."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5e7f330-ada5-4530-ad7b-9ad2e8f322d9\', \'multiverseId\': 428602}, \'multiverseid\': 428602}, {\'name\': \'Путник Ветра\', \'text\': \'Вы можете подстегнуть Путника Ветра в момент его атаки. Когда вы это делаете, он получает +1/+1 и Полет до конца хода. (Подстегнутое существо не разворачивается во время вашего следующего шага разворота.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Я никогда не бываю без оружия».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cd3a9b2-a9b4-4cf1-8fce-c6fe57029fa5\', \'multiverseId\': 428871}, \'multiverseid\': 428871}, {\'name\': \'踏风客\', \'text\': \'你可以于踏风客攻击时耗竭之。当你如此作时，直到回合结束，它得+1/+1且获得飞行异能。（已耗竭的生物于你的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「我永远不会缺武器用。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3871a7c-223b-4a25-8862-727c3ffb3aa4\', \'multiverseId\': 429140}, \'multiverseid\': 429140}, {\'name\': \'踏風客\', \'text\': \'你可以於踏風客攻擊時耗竭之。當你如此作時，直到回合結束，它得+1/+1且獲得飛行異能。（已耗竭的生物於你的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「我永遠不會缺武器用。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cd1f3ed-d4e9-4f96-a055-1afa187f8148\', \'multiverseId\': 429409}, \'multiverseid\': 429409}]', '[{\'name\': \'Champion der Ahn-Saat\', \'text\': \'Du kannst den Champion der Ahn-Saat erschöpfen, sowie er angreift. Wenn du dies tust, enttappe alle anderen Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst. (Eine erschöpfte Kreatur enttappt nicht während deines nächsten Enttappsegments.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Zweite Sonne nähert sich ihrer Bestimmung! Möge sie uns auch den Weg zu unserer erleuchten!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427165&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a09a2c0-78b8-428a-ab6f-d10ca1784fbb\', \'multiverseId\': 427165}, \'multiverseid\': 427165}, {\'name\': \'Campeón de la simiente Ahn\', \'text\': \'Puedes espolear al Campeón de la simiente Ahn en cuanto ataque. Cuando lo hagas, endereza todas las otras criaturas que controlas. (Una criatura espoleada no se enderezará durante tu próximo paso de enderezar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡El Segundo Sol se acerca a su destino! ¡Deja que nos ilumine el camino!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95febaae-dcc4-4a76-8b17-d32436b4e076\', \'multiverseId\': 427434}, \'multiverseid\': 427434}, {\'name\': \'Champion de la moisson Ahn\', \'text\': \'Vous pouvez surmener le Champion de la moisson Ahn au moment où il attaque. Quand vous faites ainsi, dégagez toutes les autres créatures que vous contrôlez. (Une créature surmenée ne se dégage pas pendant votre prochaine étape de dégagement.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Le Second Soleil approche de sa destination ! Qu\'il éclaire notre chemin vers la nôtre ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427703&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90edf689-2bad-4464-b454-c86872cca5e8\', \'multiverseId\': 427703}, \'multiverseid\': 427703}, {\'name\': \'Campione della Messe Ahn\', \'text\': \'Puoi stremare il Campione della Messe Ahn mentre attacca. Quando lo fai, STAPpa tutte le altre creature che controlli. (Una creatura stremata non STAPpa durante il tuo prossimo STAP.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Il secondo sole si avvicina alla sua meta. Possa illuminare il cammino che ci porterà alla nostra!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d5ca339-0ab3-44dc-9289-d3dccd13c064\', \'multiverseId\': 427972}, \'multiverseid\': 427972}, {\'name\': \'アン一門の勇者\', \'text\': \'アン一門の勇者が攻撃するに際し、あなたはこれを督励してもよい。そうしたとき、あなたがコントロールする他のクリーチャーをすべてアンタップする。（督励されたクリーチャーは、あなたの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「副陽が目的の場所に近づいている！我らが道の明かりとせよ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5124edb8-f737-4257-9725-c5b7ed594666\', \'multiverseId\': 428241}, \'multiverseid\': 428241}, {\'name\': \'안 입문자 용사\', \'text\': \'당신은 안 입문자 용사로 공격을 선언하면서 안 입문자 용사를 분전시킬 수 있다. 그렇게 할 때, 당신이 조종하는 다른 생물을 모두 언탭한다. (분전한 생물은 당신의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"두 번째 태양이 목적지에 접근한다! 우리의 길을 밝혀주소서!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc657977-c2c4-4393-8055-6b5097f2befc\', \'multiverseId\': 428510}, \'multiverseid\': 428510}, {\'name\': \'Campeão da Safra Ahn\', \'text\': \'Você pode exaurir Campeão da Safra Ahn conforme ele ataca. Quando fizer isso, desvire todas as outras criaturas que você controla. (Uma criatura exaurida não será desvirada durante sua próxima etapa de desvirar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"O Segundo Sol aproxima-se de seu destino! Que ele ilumine o caminho até o nosso!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02654b88-30e2-441a-9eea-16defeed11b9\', \'multiverseId\': 428779}, \'multiverseid\': 428779}, {\'name\': \'Поборник Снопа Ан\', \'text\': \'Вы можете подстегнуть Поборника Снопа Ан в момент его атаки. Когда вы это делаете, разверните все другие существа под вашим контролем. (Подстегнутое существо не разворачивается во время вашего следующего шага разворота.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Второе Солнце уже в конце своего пути! Пусть же оно осветит и наш путь!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bdd431e-888e-429e-9228-86f12fd88b90\', \'multiverseId\': 429048}, \'multiverseid\': 429048}, {\'name\': \'阿恩祀群斗士\', \'text\': \'你可以于阿恩祀群斗士攻击时耗竭之。当你如此作时，重置所有其他由你操控的生物。（已耗竭的生物于你的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「神日即将就位！愿其指引我们明路！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f385f1a8-0954-40cb-a060-0ff63d2f03f8\', \'multiverseId\': 429317}, \'multiverseid\': 429317}, {\'name\': \'阿恩祀群鬥士\', \'text\': \'你可以於阿恩祀群鬥士攻擊時耗竭之。當你如此作時，重置所有其他由你操控的生物。（已耗竭的生物於你的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「神日即將就位！願其指引我們明路！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43e057e4-308c-414e-b7a8-d711ecc279e4\', \'multiverseId\': 429586}, \'multiverseid\': 429586}]', '[{\'name\': \'Champion des Rhonas\', \'text\': \'Du kannst den Champion des Rhonas erschöpfen, sowie er angreift. Wenn du dies tust, kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen. (Eine erschöpfte Kreatur enttappt nicht während deines nächsten Enttappsegments.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schakal, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Die einzige Art, die Prüfung der Stärke zu beenden, ist mit einer Basiliskenschuppe in der Hand.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427130&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f900a943-36d8-4d42-87cf-1d217ee27f0f\', \'multiverseId\': 427130}, \'multiverseid\': 427130}, {\'name\': \'Campeona de Rhonas\', \'text\': \'Puedes espolear a la Campeona de Rhonas en cuanto ataque. Cuando lo hagas, puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de criatura de tu mano. (Una criatura espoleada no se enderezará durante tu próximo paso de enderezar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero chacal\', \'flavor\': \'La única manera de terminar la Prueba de fuerza es con una escama de basilisco en la mano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cf724d3-d300-46cb-bd8f-46e83c1a20b5\', \'multiverseId\': 427399}, \'multiverseid\': 427399}, {\'name\': \'Championne de Rhonas\', \'text\': \'Vous pouvez surmener la Championne de Rhonas au moment où elle attaque. Quand vous faites ainsi, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature de votre main. (Une créature surmenée ne se dégage pas pendant votre prochaine étape de dégagement.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : chacal et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "La seule façon de terminer l\'Épreuve de force est d\'avoir une écaille de basilic en main.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427668&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'044e0d78-2a98-4218-99d4-ceb2b6d6a40f\', \'multiverseId\': 427668}, \'multiverseid\': 427668}, {\'name\': \'Campionessa di Rhonas\', \'text\': \'Puoi stremare la Campionessa di Rhonas mentre attacca. Quando lo fai, puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura dalla tua mano. (Una creatura stremata non STAPpa durante il tuo prossimo STAP.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Sciacallo\', \'flavor\': "L\'Ordalia della Forza può essere superata solo brandendo una squama di basilisco.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1430f4e-c882-40af-a23a-275d649fae5e\', \'multiverseId\': 427937}, \'multiverseid\': 427937}, {\'name\': \'ロナスの勇者\', \'text\': \'ロナスの勇者が攻撃するに際し、あなたはこれを督励してもよい。そうしたとき、あなたはあなたの手札からクリーチャー・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。（督励されたクリーチャーは、あなたの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ジャッカル・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'活力の試練を完遂する唯一の方法はバジリスクの鱗を持って行くことだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'804abba2-9c3f-41f0-91d7-46a2b1952826\', \'multiverseId\': 428206}, \'multiverseid\': 428206}, {\'name\': \'로나스의 용사\', \'text\': \'당신은 로나스의 용사로 공격을 선언하면서 로나스의 용사를 분전시킬 수 있다. 그렇게 할 때, 당신은 손에 있는 생물 카드 한 장을 전장에 놓을 수 있다. (분전한 생물은 당신의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 자칼 전사\', \'flavor\': \'힘의 시험을 끝내는 유일한 방법은 바실리스크 비늘을 손에 넣는 것이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4632490b-a544-4ef9-8e1e-885f67aab8fa\', \'multiverseId\': 428475}, \'multiverseid\': 428475}, {\'name\': \'Campeã de Rhonas\', \'text\': \'Você pode exaurir Campeã de Rhonas conforme ela ataca. Quando fizer isso, você poderá colocar no campo de batalha um card de criatura de sua mão. (Uma criatura exaurida não será desvirada durante sua próxima etapa de desvirar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chacal Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'A única forma de completar a Prova da Força é com uma escama de basilisco na mão.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9480aa8-3875-41b2-86c9-5bdab7fa8855\', \'multiverseId\': 428744}, \'multiverseid\': 428744}, {\'name\': \'Поборница Ронаса\', \'text\': \'Вы можете подстегнуть Поборницу Ронаса в момент ее атаки. Когда вы это делаете, вы можете положить карту существа из вашей руки на поле битвы. (Подстегнутое существо не разворачивается во время вашего следующего шага разворота.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Шакал Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Успешно завершить испытание силы можно лишь с чешуйкой василиска в руках.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39917256-111b-4a70-991b-152de5bca4ac\', \'multiverseId\': 429013}, \'multiverseid\': 429013}, {\'name\': \'罗纳斯的斗士\', \'text\': \'你可以于罗纳斯的斗士攻击时耗竭之。当你如此作时，你可以将一张生物牌从你手上放进战场。（已耗竭的生物于你的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。）\', \'type\': \'生物～豺狼／战士\', \'flavor\': \'要完成力量祀炼，唯有拔下蜥怪鳞片一途。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab70ded6-8ac3-4e26-9f1b-f525d4255dac\', \'multiverseId\': 429282}, \'multiverseid\': 429282}, {\'name\': \'羅納斯的鬥士\', \'text\': \'你可以於羅納斯的鬥士攻擊時耗竭之。當你如此作時，你可以將一張生物牌從你手上放進戰場。（已耗竭的生物於你的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。）\', \'type\': \'生物～豺狼／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'要完成力量祀煉，唯有拔下蜥怪鱗片一途。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d701a999-d3d3-4021-9d08-d3e67785350e\', \'multiverseId\': 429551}, \'multiverseid\': 429551}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Herz bloßlegen\', \'text\': \'Ein Gegner deiner Wahl zeigt die Karten auf seiner Hand offen vor. Du bestimmst eine Karte davon, die weder legendär noch ein Land ist. Der Spieler wirft jene Karte aus seiner Hand ab.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Unsere wahren Absichten tragen wir nicht im Kopf, sondern im Herzen." —Bontu, Göttin des Ehrgeizes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427067&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'970b1136-b5a3-4205-869a-f6f24784fc3b\', \'multiverseId\': 427067}, \'multiverseid\': 427067}, {\'name\': \'Poner el corazón al descubierto\', \'text\': \'El oponente objetivo muestra su mano. Tú eliges de ahí una carta que no sea tierra ni legendaria. Ese jugador descarta esa carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Las verdaderas intenciones no se hallan en la cabeza, sino en el corazón". —Bontu, diosa de la ambición\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7c0e576-8774-40ec-83b6-4d229e58e9f0\', \'multiverseId\': 427336}, \'multiverseid\': 427336}, {\'name\': \'Cœur à nu\', \'text\': "L\'adversaire ciblé révèle sa main. Vous y choisissez une carte non-légendaire non-terrain. Ce joueur se défausse de cette carte.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Les véritables intentions ne résident pas dans la tête mais dans le cœur. » —Bontu, déesse de l\'Ambition", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427605&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ccb99c3-a679-47a5-b51e-f7ae7c9077f8\', \'multiverseId\': 427605}, \'multiverseid\': 427605}, {\'name\': \'Scoprire il Cuore\', \'text\': \'Un avversario bersaglio rivela la sua mano. Scegli una carta non leggendaria e non terra da quella mano. Quel giocatore scarta quella carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Le vere intenzioni non dimorano nella mente, bensì nel cuore." —Bontu, dea dell\\\'ambizione\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77c43e1a-d751-48ae-b97c-6686b5ca39b9\', \'multiverseId\': 427874}, \'multiverseid\': 427874}, {\'name\': \'心臓露呈\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の手札を公開する。あなたはその中から伝説でも土地でもないカード１枚を選ぶ。そのプレイヤーはそのカードを捨てる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「真意が宿るのは頭脳ではなく心臓だ。」 ――野望の神、バントゥ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1091c26-ef6c-4d05-ac11-fcb9ca545234\', \'multiverseId\': 428143}, \'multiverseid\': 428143}, {\'name\': \'심장 적출\', \'text\': \'상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 자신의 손을 공개한다. 그 중 전설이 아니고 대지가 아닌 카드 한 장을 선택한다. 그 플레이어는 그 카드를 버린다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"진짜 의도를 보려면 머릿속이 아닌 마음을 보아라." —야망의 신 본투\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17c946f8-9026-4a85-9aab-9a58f6d41d38\', \'multiverseId\': 428412}, \'multiverseid\': 428412}, {\'name\': \'Expor o Coração\', \'text\': \'O oponente alvo revela a própria mão. Você escolhe um card que não seja lendário nem terreno da mão dele. Aquele jogador descarta aquele card.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"As verdadeiras intenções não estão na cabeça, mas no coração." — Bontu, deusa da ambição\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa62e684-4ace-4503-9deb-ac504d33dc23\', \'multiverseId\': 428681}, \'multiverseid\': 428681}, {\'name\': \'Открытое Сердце\', \'text\': \'Целевой оппонент показывает свою руку. Вы выбираете из нее нелегендарную карту, не являющуюся землей. Тот игрок сбрасывает ту карту.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Истинные намерения скрываются не в голове, а в сердце». — Бонту, богиня устремленности\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58b3c347-7f33-45a3-8869-bc7f9a0a645b\', \'multiverseId\': 428950}, \'multiverseid\': 428950}, {\'name\': \'活取真心\', \'text\': \'目标对手展示其手牌。你选择其中一张非传奇且非地的牌。该牌手弃掉该牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「真实的企图不在脑中，而在心里。」 ～野心之神芭图\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73699842-770b-45f9-82f9-7b352052ab6b\', \'multiverseId\': 429219}, \'multiverseid\': 429219}, {\'name\': \'活取真心\', \'text\': \'目標對手展示其手牌。你選擇其中一張非傳奇且非地的牌。該玩家棄掉該牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「真實的企圖不在腦中，而在心裡。」 ～野心之神芭圖\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96a729f8-37c4-409a-9ba0-7a095fb3de4f\', \'multiverseId\': 429488}, \'multiverseid\': 429488}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dezimierender Käfer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Dezimierende Käfer ins Spiel kommt, lege eine -1/-1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\\nImmer wenn der Dezimierende Käfer angreift, entferne eine -1/-1-Marke von einer Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, und lege eine -1/-1-Marke auf bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die der verteidigende Spieler kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427168&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18f0ae2b-1091-46b1-a9cb-a2a43c415f8d\', \'multiverseId\': 427168}, \'multiverseid\': 427168}, {\'name\': \'Escarabajo diezmador\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Escarabajo diezmador entre al campo de batalla, pon un contador -1/-1 sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas.\\nSiempre que el Escarabajo diezmador ataque, remueve un contador -1/-1 de la criatura objetivo que controlas y pon un contador -1/-1 sobre hasta una criatura objetivo que controla el jugador defensor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4ed7c30-782d-44a7-8d03-0f205c675c3b\', \'multiverseId\': 427437}, \'multiverseid\': 427437}, {\'name\': \'Scarabée de décimation\', \'text\': "Quand le Scarabée de décimation arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur -1/-1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Scarabée de décimation attaque, retirez un marqueur -1/-1 d\'une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez, ciblez jusqu\'à une créature que le joueur défenseur contrôle et mettez un marqueur -1/-1 sur elle.", \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427706&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1c7f777-e686-46ad-885a-24a2f0ac4474\', \'multiverseId\': 427706}, \'multiverseid\': 427706}, {\'name\': \'Coleottero Decimatore\', \'text\': \'Quando il Coleottero Decimatore entra nel campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino -1/-1 su una creatura bersaglio che controlli.\\nOgniqualvolta il Coleottero Decimatore attacca, rimuovi un segnalino -1/-1 da una creatura bersaglio che controlli e scegli fino a una creatura bersaglio controllata dal giocatore in difesa. Metti un segnalino -1/-1 su di essa.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a05054a1-c48e-4f6c-8c9f-6f77f5eea5e2\', \'multiverseId\': 427975}, \'multiverseid\': 427975}, {\'name\': \'潰滅甲虫\', \'text\': \'潰滅甲虫が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に－１/－１カウンターを１個置く。\\n潰滅甲虫が攻撃するたび、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体と、防御プレイヤーがコントロールするクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。その前者の上から－１/－１カウンターを１個取り除き、その後者の上に－１/－１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03a09724-7ce6-4333-beb9-7705bbfdc710\', \'multiverseId\': 428244}, \'multiverseid\': 428244}, {\'name\': \'대량학살 풍뎅이\', \'text\': \'대량학살 풍뎅이가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 -1/-1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n대량학살 풍뎅이가 공격할 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 생물 한 개와 수비플레이어가 조종하는 생물을 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정한다. 첫 번째 목표에서 -1/-1 카운터 한 개를 제거하고 두 번째 목표에 -1/-1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 곤충\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'942a72b7-09dc-4ddb-aadb-db59b050b19e\', \'multiverseId\': 428513}, \'multiverseid\': 428513}, {\'name\': \'Besouro Dizimador\', \'text\': \'Quando Besouro Dizimador entrar no campo de batalha, coloque um marcador -1/-1 na criatura alvo que você controla.\\nToda vez que Besouro Dizimador atacar, remova um marcador -1/-1 da criatura alvo que você controla e coloque um marcador -1/-1 em até uma criatura alvo que o jogador defensor controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Inseto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2d99359-fbe7-4053-9265-f89588b8fe95\', \'multiverseId\': 428782}, \'multiverseid\': 428782}, {\'name\': \'Жук-Истребитель\', \'text\': \'Когда Жук-Истребитель выходит на поле битвы, положите один жетон -1/-1 на целевое существо под вашим контролем.\\nКаждый раз, когда Жук-Истребитель атакует, удалите один жетон -1/-1 с целевого существа под вашим контролем и положите один жетон -1/-1 на не более чем одно целевое существо под контролем защищающегося игрока.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Насекомое\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a969cb1d-5419-402d-aeef-2c4f54bf119e\', \'multiverseId\': 429051}, \'multiverseid\': 429051}, {\'name\': \'摧残甲虫\', \'text\': \'当摧残甲虫进战场时，在目标由你操控的生物上放置一个-1/-1指示物。\\n每当摧残甲虫攻击时，从目标由你操控的生物上移去一个-1/-1指示物，且在至多一个目标由防御牌手操控的生物上放置一个-1/-1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～昆虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31537b9b-7a87-4f8d-9edd-922e5d5abe5c\', \'multiverseId\': 429320}, \'multiverseid\': 429320}, {\'name\': \'摧殘甲蟲\', \'text\': \'當摧殘甲蟲進戰場時，在目標由你操控的生物上放置一個-1/-1指示物。\\n每當摧殘甲蟲攻擊時，從目標由你操控的生物上移去一個-1/-1指示物，且在至多一個目標由防禦玩家操控的生物上放置一個-1/-1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～昆蟲\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09a0882d-a6ae-4d70-b326-be3ab6519d71\', \'multiverseId\': 429589}, \'multiverseid\': 429589}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Sande aufwühlen\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge drei 2/2 schwarze Zombie-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\nUmwandlung {3}{B} ({3}{B}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du Die Sande aufwühlen umwandelst, erzeuge einen 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427081&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4796225-c001-4170-81eb-dc19d4427806\', \'multiverseId\': 427081}, \'multiverseid\': 427081}, {\'name\': \'Agitar las arenas\', \'text\': \'Crea tres fichas de criatura Zombie negras 2/2.\\nCiclo {3}{B}. ({3}{B}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando actives la habilidad de ciclo de Agitar las arenas, crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6741733-1b4d-452c-9096-ad20f8f11e28\', \'multiverseId\': 427350}, \'multiverseid\': 427350}, {\'name\': \'Éveil du sable\', \'text\': "Créez trois jetons de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.\\nRecyclage {3}{B} ({3}{B}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez l\'Éveil du sable, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427619&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f00289a-6ec1-484a-95ac-25372edca83a\', \'multiverseId\': 427619}, \'multiverseid\': 427619}, {\'name\': \'Smuovere le Sabbie\', \'text\': \'Crea tre pedine creatura Zombie 2/2 nere.\\nCiclo {3}{B} ({3}{B}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\\nQuando cicli Smuovere le Sabbie, crea una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a061c9c-c7e5-40fd-ab81-720480f96bc7\', \'multiverseId\': 427888}, \'multiverseid\': 427888}, {\'name\': \'砂の撹拌\', \'text\': \'黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンを３体生成する。\\nサイクリング{3}{B}（{3}{B}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\\nあなたが砂の撹拌をサイクリングしたとき、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf9fb2c7-fed5-4c6d-a567-d602b9d6c077\', \'multiverseId\': 428157}, \'multiverseid\': 428157}, {\'name\': \'모래 젓기\', \'text\': \'2/2 흑색 좀비 생물 토큰 세 개를 만든다.\\n순환 {3}{B} ({3}{B}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)\\n모래 젓기를 순환할 때, 2/2 흑색 좀비 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf428312-db73-40e8-8935-8a586641a73f\', \'multiverseId\': 428426}, \'multiverseid\': 428426}, {\'name\': \'Agitar as Areias\', \'text\': \'Crie três fichas de criatura preta 2/2 do tipo Zumbi.\\nReciclar {3}{B} ({3}{B}, Descarte este card: Compre um card.)\\nQuando reciclar Agitar as Areias, crie uma ficha de criatura preta 2/2 do tipo Zumbi.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12dbc10d-85cb-48bf-a33a-0bc880c1cd66\', \'multiverseId\': 428695}, \'multiverseid\': 428695}, {\'name\': \'Возмущение Песков\', \'text\': \'Создайте три фишки существа 2/2 черный Зомби.\\nЦикл {3}{B} ({3}{B}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\\nКогда вы совершаете цикл Возмущения Песков, создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 черный Зомби.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'303fa5c7-fc1b-42a9-aff5-b43a9bc0264f\', \'multiverseId\': 428964}, \'multiverseid\': 428964}, {\'name\': \'惊扰沙漠\', \'text\': \'派出三个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。\\n循环{3}{B}（{3}{B}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\\n当你循环惊扰沙漠时，派出一个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'234a89a8-77dc-475e-9191-9b6332a431e7\', \'multiverseId\': 429233}, \'multiverseid\': 429233}, {\'name\': \'驚擾沙漠\', \'text\': \'派出三個2/2黑色殭屍衍生生物。\\n循環{3}{B}（{3}{B}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）\\n當你循環驚擾沙漠時，派出一個2/2黑色殭屍衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05de594a-97d4-4386-8771-1ec9111cf228\', \'multiverseId\': 429502}, \'multiverseid\': 429502}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die ewig Dienenden\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Toten übernehmen sämtliche Arbeiten — auf den Feldern, im Haus, in den Schulen. Selbst die Einbalsamierung der anderen Verstorbenen. Die Lebenden müssen nichts tun, außer zu trainieren. Wie könnte es besser sein?" —Temmet, Wesir von Naktamun\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427003&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba901c9a-40bb-4cce-ae1e-d296a87d7798\', \'multiverseId\': 427003}, \'multiverseid\': 427003}, {\'name\': \'Sirvientes\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Aquí los muertos hacen todo el trabajo: cultivar, construir, instruir... incluso embalsamar a otras momias. Los vivos no necesitan hacer nada más que entrenar. ¿Qué sistema podría ser más perfecto?" —Temmet, visir de Naktamun\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dad75a2b-6798-4f03-97bc-f4543e6bc08a\', \'multiverseId\': 427272}, \'multiverseid\': 427272}, {\'name\': \'Ceux qui servent\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "« Les morts font tout le travail ici : agriculture, construction, éducation et même embaumement des autres momies. Les vivants n\'ont rien à faire, sinon s\'entraîner. Quel système pourrait être plus parfait ? » —Temmet, vizir de Naktamon", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427541&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78e9cc09-9c6e-4a4b-aef7-0eeeab666565\', \'multiverseId\': 427541}, \'multiverseid\': 427541}, {\'name\': \'Coloro che Servono\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Tutto il lavoro qui viene svolto dai morti, che coltivano, costruiscono edifici, insegnano e imbalsamano persino altre mummie. I vivi devono solo pensare ad addestrarsi. Un sistema più che ingegnoso!" —Temmet, visir di Naktamun\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6118014-f84c-4da9-9068-b627d6c65094\', \'multiverseId\': 427810}, \'multiverseid\': 427810}, {\'name\': \'仕える者たち\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'「ここでは死者があらゆる仕事をする。耕作、建設、教育。仲間のミイラに不朽処理を行う者までいる。生者はそれを訓練するのみでよい。これ以上の仕組みがあるかね？」 ――ナクタムンの侍臣、テムメト\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59a2613e-9e85-475b-9463-49557c65a610\', \'multiverseId\': 428079}, \'multiverseid\': 428079}, {\'name\': \'섬기는 자\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비\', \'flavor\': \'"이곳에서는 망자들이 농사, 건설, 교육, 심지어 동료 미라의 방부처리까지 모든 일을 도맡는다. 산 자는 수련에만 집중한다. 이 얼마나 완벽한 시스템인가?" —나크타문의 고관 테멧\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6364e43-2076-487c-bfa1-113c65e43817\', \'multiverseId\': 428348}, \'multiverseid\': 428348}, {\'name\': \'Aqueles que Servem\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'"Os mortos fazem todo o trabalho aqui: cultivo, construção, instrução, até mesmo o embalsamamento de suas companheiras múmias. Os vivos não precisam fazer nada, a não ser treinar. Que sistema poderia ser mais perfeito?" — Temmet, vizir de Nactamon\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef2f7f81-de9a-4296-9bdc-be383062bd05\', \'multiverseId\': 428617}, \'multiverseid\': 428617}, {\'name\': \'Те, Кто Служат\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': \'«Мертвецы выполняют здесь всю работу: возделывают землю, строят, обучают, даже бальзамируют новых мумий. Живым остается лишь тренироваться. Возможна ли более совершенная система?» — Теммет, визирь Нактамуна\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'650599c0-2889-494a-8908-31f057be24b8\', \'multiverseId\': 428886}, \'multiverseid\': 428886}, {\'name\': \'奴隶木乃伊\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'「死者在这里负责所有的工作～耕种、建造、授课，甚至还为木乃伊同伴处理防腐。生者只管专心训练。还有更完美的体制吗？」 ～拿塔蒙维齐尔蒂穆特\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15355372-2a55-49b0-bbd3-a9f1ea1f40fd\', \'multiverseId\': 429155}, \'multiverseid\': 429155}, {\'name\': \'奴隸木乃伊\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍\', \'flavor\': \'「死者在這裡負責所有的工作～耕種、建造、授課，甚至還為木乃伊同伴處理防腐。生者只管專心訓練。還有更完美的體制嗎？」 ～拿塔蒙維齊爾蒂穆特\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'541bb31c-e19f-4457-bace-36684bb7bc40\', \'multiverseId\': 429424}, \'multiverseid\': 429424}]', '[{\'name\': \'Djerus Entschlossenheit\', \'text\': \'Enttappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Verhindere allen Schaden, der ihr in diesem Zug zugefügt würde.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn ich stärker werden will, trainiere ich. Wenn ich weiser werden will, lese ich. Wenn ich mich ausruhen will, beginne ich erneut."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426982&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25df0bbd-07ee-4a8f-884e-1c52da8beb0e\', \'multiverseId\': 426982}, \'multiverseid\': 426982}, {\'name\': \'Determinación de Djeru\', \'text\': \'Endereza la criatura objetivo. Prevén todo el daño que se le fuera a hacer este turno.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando deseo ser fuerte, entreno. Cuando deseo ser sabio, estudio. Cuando deseo descansar, empiezo de nuevo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea9c2e17-d154-43a0-9153-62f7641f287b\', \'multiverseId\': 427251}, \'multiverseid\': 427251}, {\'name\': \'Résolution de Djeru\', \'text\': \'Dégagez la créature ciblée. Prévenez toutes les blessures qui devraient lui être infligées ce tour-ci.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Quand je veux être fort, je m\'entraîne. Quand je veux être sage, j\'étudie. Quand je veux me reposer, je recommence. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427520&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8e99372-f78e-43b4-aaaa-f8eb78c73993\', \'multiverseId\': 427520}, \'multiverseid\': 427520}, {\'name\': \'Determinazione di Djeru\', \'text\': \'STAPpa una creatura bersaglio. Previeni tutto il danno che le verrebbe inflitto in questo turno.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Per essere forte, mi esercito. Per essere saggio, studio. Per riposarmi, ricomincio da capo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'491b8523-3970-4c0b-a616-396c17883ea9\', \'multiverseId\': 427789}, \'multiverseid\': 427789}, {\'name\': \'デジェルの決意\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをアンタップする。このターン、それに与えられるダメージをすべて軽減する。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「強くなりたいなら鍛える。知恵が必要なら学ぶ。休みたくなったなら、最初からやり直す。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9929d4e5-f70e-4359-bf36-d2db2537d31c\', \'multiverseId\': 428058}, \'multiverseid\': 428058}, {\'name\': \'제루의 결의\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 언탭한다. 이 턴에 그 생물에 입혀지려 하는 모든 피해를 방지한다.\\n순환 {2} ({2}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"난 강해지고 싶으면 수련하고, 현명해지고 싶으면 공부하고, 쉬고 싶으면 다시 시작한다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9780ac8d-acb8-4867-abbd-7540a8fc904a\', \'multiverseId\': 428327}, \'multiverseid\': 428327}, {\'name\': \'Resolução de Djeru\', \'text\': \'Desvire a criatura alvo. Previna todo o dano que seria causado a ela neste turno.\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, Descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando eu quero ser forte, eu treino. Quando eu quero ser sábio, eu estudo. Quando eu quero descansar, eu recomeço."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31ff1905-88f4-479c-b45d-123fe92abc89\', \'multiverseId\': 428596}, \'multiverseid\': 428596}, {\'name\': \'Решимость Джеру\', \'text\': \'Разверните целевое существо. Предотвратите все повреждения, которые должны быть нанесены ему в этом ходу.\\nЦикл {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Когда я хочу стать сильным, я упражняюсь. Когда я хочу стать мудрым, я учусь. Когда я хочу отдохнуть, я начинаю все заново».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea7b7198-2162-4d5c-a51b-322a09487374\', \'multiverseId\': 428865}, \'multiverseid\': 428865}, {\'name\': \'杰鲁的决心\', \'text\': \'重置目标生物。于本回合中，防止将对它造成的所有伤害。\\n循环{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我想要强壮时，就刻苦训练；我想要智慧时，就努力学习；我想要休息时，就加倍努力。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a22ed7b7-74a2-452f-a834-92e99b338c59\', \'multiverseId\': 429134}, \'multiverseid\': 429134}, {\'name\': \'傑魯的決心\', \'text\': \'重置目標生物。於本回合中，防止將對它造成的所有傷害。\\n循環{2}（{2}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我想要強壯時，就刻苦訓練；我想要智慧時，就努力學習；我想要休息時，就加倍努力。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4d05a6f-0d4c-41bf-9a49-95303ff1437e\', \'multiverseId\': 429403}, \'multiverseid\': 429403}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drescher-Eidechse\', \'text\': \'Die Drescher-Eidechse erhält +1/+2, solange du eine oder weniger Karten auf deiner Hand hast.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eidechse\', \'flavor\': \'Der Lärm ihres gepanzerter Schwanzes, der auf die Wüstensteine schlägt, lässt viele die Ankunft eines weitaus größeren Raubtiers erwarten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427121&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1f0e5a3-fd4b-4c37-a0b9-0431f21bbb13\', \'multiverseId\': 427121}, \'multiverseid\': 427121}, {\'name\': \'Lagarto trillador\', \'text\': \'El Lagarto trillador obtiene +1/+2 mientras tengas una carta o menos en tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lagarto\', \'flavor\': \'El sonido que produce su cola blindada al golpear contra las rocas del desierto suele confundirse con los pasos de un depredador mucho más grande.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b7147d6-7d72-4766-8032-eaf4ef79a0ba\', \'multiverseId\': 427390}, \'multiverseid\': 427390}, {\'name\': \'Lézard batteur\', \'text\': \'Le Lézard batteur gagne +1/+2 tant que vous avez une carte ou moins en main.\', \'type\': \'Créature : lézard\', \'flavor\': "Le bruit de sa queue cuirassée battant les rochers du désert est souvent confondu avec celui des pas d\'un prédateur bien plus gros.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427659&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'789fc598-00b8-4a95-91d5-66f31bca35f7\', \'multiverseId\': 427659}, \'multiverseid\': 427659}, {\'name\': \'Lucertola Trebbiatrice\', \'text\': \'La Lucertola Trebbiatrice prende +1/+2 fintanto che hai una o meno carte in mano.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lucertola\', \'flavor\': \'Il rumore della sua coda metallica che batte sulle rocce del deserto viene spesso confuso con i passi di un predatore molto più grande.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6cfb88a-e0fa-476d-b58c-632ce117be19\', \'multiverseId\': 427928}, \'multiverseid\': 427928}, {\'name\': \'オナガトカゲ\', \'text\': \'あなたの手札のカードが１枚以下であるかぎり、オナガトカゲは＋１/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — トカゲ\', \'flavor\': \'その鱗状の尾が砂漠の岩を打つ音は、大きな捕食者の足音と紛らわしい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5645319-cda7-40e2-a6be-1d72b26ef624\', \'multiverseId\': 428197}, \'multiverseid\': 428197}, {\'name\': \'타작 도마뱀\', \'text\': \'당신의 손에 있는 카드가 한 장 이하인 한, 타작 도마뱀은 +1/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 도마뱀\', \'flavor\': \'비늘로 덮인 꼬리가 사막 바위를 때리는 소리는 종종 거대 포식자의 발소리로 오해받는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad305f66-ac7c-4750-bfa4-af8a4003dbd4\', \'multiverseId\': 428466}, \'multiverseid\': 428466}, {\'name\': \'Lagarto-raposo\', \'text\': \'Lagarto-raposo recebe +1/+2 enquanto você tiver um card ou menos na mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lagarto\', \'flavor\': \'O som de sua cauda encouraçada batendo nas pedras do deserto é muitas vezes confundido com os passos de um predador muito maior.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dd03901-ec57-43be-bb72-5a33f28d9305\', \'multiverseId\': 428735}, \'multiverseid\': 428735}, {\'name\': \'Ящер-Молотильщик\', \'text\': \'Ящер-Молотильщик получает +1/+2, пока у вас в руке не больше одной карты.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ящер\', \'flavor\': \'Стук его чешуйчатого хвоста по камням в пустыне легко спутать с топотом гораздо более крупного хищника.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce4c860b-e75c-433c-b8be-b894c2075ab3\', \'multiverseId\': 429004}, \'multiverseid\': 429004}, {\'name\': \'扫尾蜥\', \'text\': \'只要你的手牌为一张或更少，扫尾蜥便得+1/+2。\', \'type\': \'生物～蜥蜴\', \'flavor\': \'它尾巴上有层层鳞甲，敲打砂岩时发出的声响常被当作大型捕食者的脚步声。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f30c337d-1c68-4e65-8e84-6478ef5d640c\', \'multiverseId\': 429273}, \'multiverseid\': 429273}, {\'name\': \'掃尾蜥\', \'text\': \'只要你的手牌為一張或更少，掃尾蜥便得+1/+2。\', \'type\': \'生物～蜥蜴\', \'flavor\': \'牠尾巴上有層層鱗甲，敲打砂岩時發出的聲響常被當作大型捕食者的腳步聲。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59703f9e-cd23-47b9-94a2-d7e8cff48db4\', \'multiverseId\': 429542}, \'multiverseid\': 429542}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dünenkäfer\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Sandstürme Shefets sorgen dafür, dass sein Panzer stets glänzt, und die Horden von Verfluchten dafür, dass er niemals hungert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427060&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c82fe238-5a72-4aeb-8410-c4dc6c76d923\', \'multiverseId\': 427060}, \'multiverseid\': 427060}, {\'name\': \'Escarabajo de las dunas\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'Las ásperas arenas del Shefet pulen su caparazón, y las huestes de los malditos llenan su estómago.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb265153-0461-40c2-a873-8627f4eb6f5e\', \'multiverseId\': 427329}, \'multiverseid\': 427329}, {\'name\': \'Scarabée des dunes\', \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': "Les sables purificateurs de Shefet polissent sa carapace, et les troupes de damnés lui remplissent l\'estomac.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427598&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17b0a5a6-4b3e-4996-9768-8e33833228ee\', \'multiverseId\': 427598}, \'multiverseid\': 427598}, {\'name\': \'Coleottero delle Dune\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'La sua corazza è levigata dalle sabbie corrosive di Shefet e il suo stomaco riempito da schiere di dannati.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d835885e-f8cd-412e-ac31-7f9cd1d2861c\', \'multiverseId\': 427867}, \'multiverseid\': 427867}, {\'name\': \'砂丘甲虫\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'シェフェトの研磨性の砂がその甲殻を磨く。呪われた者たちがその腹を充たす。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd93c51d-77ad-4eff-b61d-2437b4519ddf\', \'multiverseId\': 428136}, \'multiverseid\': 428136}, {\'name\': \'사구 풍뎅이\', \'type\': \'생물 — 곤충\', \'flavor\': \'셰페트의 긁어내는 모래가 껍질의 광을 내고, 저주받은 자들로 그 뱃속을 채운다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'797de83c-4c76-41b9-b92e-d4a77a43398f\', \'multiverseId\': 428405}, \'multiverseid\': 428405}, {\'name\': \'Besouro-das-dunas\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Inseto\', \'flavor\': \'As areias abrasivas do Shefet lustram sua carapaça, e as fileiras dos amaldiçoados enchem sua barriga.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdbfe45d-5481-4040-b627-275d5e89df0e\', \'multiverseId\': 428674}, \'multiverseid\': 428674}, {\'name\': \'Дюнный Жук\', \'type\': \'Существо — Насекомое\', \'flavor\': \'Жесткие пески пустыни Шефет полируют его панцирь, а плоть проклятых — наполняет брюхо.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ddff221-5ee7-46d1-9cce-90568458ef7c\', \'multiverseId\': 428943}, \'multiverseid\': 428943}, {\'name\': \'沙丘甲虫\', \'type\': \'生物～昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'谢菲的猛烈风沙磨亮其甲壳，大群受诅者则填饱其肚子。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6aec466-840e-4981-91d6-e7eb54efad46\', \'multiverseId\': 429212}, \'multiverseid\': 429212}, {\'name\': \'沙丘甲蟲\', \'type\': \'生物～昆蟲\', \'flavor\': \'謝菲的猛烈風沙磨亮其甲殼，大群受詛者則填飽其肚子。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=429481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e29166b7-a165-4c38-9803-b8295994f040\', \'multiverseId\': 429481}, \'multiverseid\': 429481}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427221&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cb75aeec-5878-4c79-bd48-13a4257d4b45', 'multiverseId': 427221}, 'multiverseid': 427221}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427490&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '62a3b0f4-f359-4874-86bd-f6fa80ce3c67', 'multiverseId': 427490}, 'multiverseid': 427490}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=427759&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6350e352-8900-4431-b457-d1e4c7a58c20', 'multiverseId': 427759}, 'multiverseid': 427759}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428028&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '081a72d7-7033-4e16-8303-8757de40b30e', 'multiverseId': 428028}, 'multiverseid': 428028}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428297&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a18a71a1-a5dd-428f-ae4e-d77eecbd61a2', 'multiverseId': 428297}, 'multiverseid': 428297}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=428566&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ef645aca-4b50-474f-bc58-f20dea6e722d', 'multiverseId': 4285